<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">ISAIAH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">ISAIAH</para>
  <para style="toc3">Isa</para>
  <para style="mt1">ISAIAH</para>
  <para style="mt2">Isaiah</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Isaiah ccauh hynh BC 700 loukaw kya Jerusalem khua a la umpaw profeh lepaw lu kheit a min Isaiah cikuhpaw min kha lee hae zah a min a phu hae paw nynh thua. E ccauh hynh phuin thum lang phia kho athua:</para>
  <para style="ip">(1) Byaria 1-39 lungkhu e bya hynh alia peenaw athuapaw Judah kha a pe umpaw, athungpaw Assiria nynh dou lan a paccynku ccyh lya-e bya nynh thua. Judah hiinnaw kya ri lan a um ccaccingpaw tuh Assiria thawzung thua leite, mih minphuin a seinaw te Pachia kaw a einaw hae te Pachia a doliaku leinaw hae kha nynh thua cipaw Isaiah nynh a muih. Isaiah nynh ccungccaw hae te mih cciakhaetu hae kha adingpaw te ahmepaw hiinnaw kalan ccaerarihpaw bya te ko hae zah a ryalawnaw te mah a muihsah hae. Pachia bya ngae leinaw nynh ronaw a thuakhae cite raeringnaw a pya hae. Te Isaiah nynh laephi pynpi daenaw ccyh a um lanpaw te David ciihan kyate siapharan hoypaw a pui lanpaw kong kha mah a ho.</para>
  <para style="ip">(2) Byaria 40-55: E ccyh hynh Judah hae patae tuh Babilon ram kya see lang tang hae zah tuaasahnaw teing hae zah ngaehoinaw hoi leite a um lya hae nynh thua. Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae kha hiinnaw thawpaw te hiinsah khylan luenaw a pya cih hae zah Jerusalem lang a kikhae cih hae, cipaw kha profeh nynh a ho. E byaria hae kyaze syntawku lanpaw abyalu tuh: Pachia tuh ccungccaw phungpaw Bawipaw thua zah, a ccungccaw Israel hae hanlan a paccynpaw tuh Israel hae liate hythua a ccou cih hae paw minphuin hae balyn hanlan minmin nynh rya a law lan hae paw kha nynh thua. “Bawipaw Ryalahtu” cikuhpaw bya hynh Byakin Ryn kyaze ny huapaw bya nynh athuabua.</para>
  <para style="ip">(3) Byaria 56-66 lungkhu e bya hynh Jerusalem lang a ki vae hae paw elang a zeipaw thua zah, Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae elang bya a kinkupaw kha a ccingsah cih cipaw phe ria lan a nyh ry hae paw hanlan a zeipaw nynh thua. Dingnaw kong, Sabbath sungnaw kong, silawnaw kong te sawsangnaw kong ccangpyanaw kha ah muih oh. Syntawku lanpaw bya tuh 61.1-2 kha thua zah, Jesu nynh a rya a thotakaw lya a mangpaw bya nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Raeringnaw pyanaw te byakinpyakunaw 1.1—12.6</para>
  <para style="io1">Minphuin hae detahnaw 13.1—23.18</para>
  <para style="io1">Pachia nynh laephi kha byapianaw 24.1—27.13</para>
  <para style="io1">Raeringnaw pyanaw te byakinpyakunaw 28.1—35.10</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah siapharan Hezekiah te Assiria hae 36.1—39.8</para>
  <para style="io1">Byakinpyakunaw te ngaehoinaw bya hae 40.1—55.13</para>
  <para style="io1">Raeringnaw pyanaw te byakinpyakunaw 56.1—66.24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz ccapaw Isaiah nynh Judah te Jerusalem kong te asekuhte Judah siapharan hae Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz te Hezekiah she lya a muihpaw vizin tuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:1-7">2Si 15.1-7</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:32-16:20">15.32—16.20</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18.1—20.21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:1-32:33">2Sh 26.1—32.33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Judah A Hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou vaawlui, thaetua,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou laephi, ngaetua;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kua hae paw te ka do-oih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn dou vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaetua nynh a hoitupaw kha nyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lann nynh mah a bawipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">looh a pyanawpaw kua kha a ny;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama Israel hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kha yn nyh khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nyhthya khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A seipaw minphuin,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw te phe abeihpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw a raepaw ciihan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ozia athahpaw ccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na vua vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na theihrya oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang na sangsah vae oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccemou detahkunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccungku ung oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccemou palei na dou ung oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae lu balyn tuh vaemaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">phe beih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thinlung balyn tuh a thawzya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nae ccukaw te nae lu kyacia</para>
  <para style="q2">dannaw um khyh, aduinpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">vaemaw te anae aluapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vaemaw kha nynh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih vaemaw hae kha singpya, heepya,</para>
  <para style="q2">chitui te thuhpya thua khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nae ram tuh ccungccaw um vae khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae khuapi hae tuh maee nynh a u;</para>
  <para style="q1">na muihnaw oh ccaccei khe</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin ccangpaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ram kha a ro hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">phe a ro vae hae paw hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Misu khokhu kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">buhang hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zinae loo kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">bu hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhaw hae nynh a koihlu hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion ccanung kyalya nynh a laehy vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening elang</para>
  <para style="q2">ciihan beihtaraw san</para>
  <para style="q2">oun la haangpya khyh ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">aening tuh Sodom khua hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ah thua cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Gomorrah khua te ah lokuh vae cih oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Gen 19.24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:29">Rom 9.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sodom khua a uktu hae nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha thae oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Gomorrah khua e ccungccaw hae nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">ah Pachia kya-e ccangpyanaw kha ngae oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ka kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">na rae oh paw silawnaw patae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ry cih cite tou na tua oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Maee-ute silawnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na raenaw oh paw tuu hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">looh na dang oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">sahiin hae tho khate phe ka byn vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaetua chii, tuutaw chii te miaa chii kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ry khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:21-22">Amo 5.21-22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning nynh ka malang</para>
  <para style="q2">langku khylan he nae ccia vae oh ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">hum nynh mou e hynh ae ngia oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">ka voidu kha syde nan vae oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nae ccyngpah oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">nae pya oh paw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">nae pya oh paw amynkhuhpaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hanlan anungsikuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Sawpaw sah thawpaw poi,</para>
  <para style="q2">sabbath te zapi pumkunaw—</para>
  <para style="q1">hoyleinaw te apykuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">beiknaw pumkunaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ngaesang kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae sawpaw sah thawpaw poi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">nae poi hae kha ka hua;</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e hae tuh ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">phupaw ripaw lang tang zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka phunaw phe ka bang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nae kuih he na dyng vae oh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka mit kha ccanglang kae hawitaw cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">patae saw na sang oh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ngaepah lan khyh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kuih tuh chiise te phe abeih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Naemaw te naemaw singkuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">naemaw te naemaw thyaasakuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na cyi oh paw hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka mit nynh a muihnaw kyate vua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">hoyleinaw kha rae nan vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />hoynaw rae kha ccangkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">dingnaw kha ccung oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahkunaw a teing hae paw kha khum oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngawraw hae kha thungkhaw oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nomae hae kha pankhaw oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q2">atu rang oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyte tua kalang oh sih:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae seinaw tuh sekakin lan se salamah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiraw hawte araw cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">sephaphuh lan se salamah</para>
  <para style="q2">tuuming hawte athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nanning nynh lungthote</para>
  <para style="q2">kaw na ngae oh zetuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ram kyate apoupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw hoypaw kha na ae cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />thuasalama nanning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kaw-eite nae dou oh zetuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi rhaw te na chih cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Aseipaw Khuapi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A lungzipaw khuapi nynh pawtemou</para>
  <para style="q2">ohhuanung lang phe a tang!</para>
  <para style="q1">Aning tuh byading te phe beih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungkhu kya dingnaw a um,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama atu vae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw theihtu hae nynh a um vae hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na ngunphua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athupaw lang tang vae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na misutui tuh tui te phe pykuh vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na bawi hae tuh rhawthotu hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">miruh hae ruiban nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih balyn mawte pyaruh kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ry hae zah lasung kha a ae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ngawraw hae kha thungkhaw khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nomae hae byathan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaepah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze alesaepaw Bawipaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Athungpaw Israel</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rhaw hae tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw kha ka ccawsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw ccaccei nynh ka rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka liaru cih hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka kuih kae hangnua vae cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaw kha tuisahte a thyaasah hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">kae thyaasah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya-e sivawthuhpaw balyn kha ka vua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Langmawlya kae nungpya hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">byapiatu hae te tuanaw pyatu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae nungpah thui cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tetuh nang kha dingnaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungzipaw khuapi cite ae ko cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zion khuapi kha byading liate</para>
  <para style="q2">shawkhaw athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ngaesikuh hae paw khuapi lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha dingnaw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">shawkhaw athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama misei hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a doutu hae kha tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">pynkheihlan ro athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a vua hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maemih athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nae lungry a la thuakhaekupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw phaesi ku hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nae maethah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na la poku oh paw khokhu hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nae maesue aroh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">anaw anaanpaw phaesi thing te</para>
  <para style="q2">na lokuh cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tui um leipaw khokhu hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Athawsaepaw tuh maeetuanawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thingthyh hawte athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalaw tuh maeesoi hawte athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">mimaw te mih ryalaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ukheih cih hae, tuh-e maee tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thetu lu kheit san um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Malang Ccyh e Pachia Inn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MIC 4:1-3">Mik 4.1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amoz ccapaw Isaiah nynh Judah te Jerusalem konglang a thaepaw Pachia bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Malang ccyh vae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn a umnaw mua hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">mua hae kyaze ahang huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hawte atyn cih zah, mua taraw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">luki lang hangthung athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e mua langkhe a cceih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Rang oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mua,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob Pachia inn lang cceihthung oh sih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a laanpi kha oun ccangpah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aening nynh amaw ccunoh kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ah zui cih oh,” cite oun ho cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize Zion kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpyanaw yn pou cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya</para>
  <para style="q2">yn langkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minphuin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bya oun pia cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw patae kha oun hopia cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih zunghe hae kha tamuin lang</para>
  <para style="q1">oun suhkuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccoi hae kha tangpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">oun suhkuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin ccangkheit te ccangkheit</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtukkuh vae lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtukkunaw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangkuh vae lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:10">Joe 3.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Lungkhungnaw tungvaw Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pou Jakob ciihan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">rang oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> awnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">cceih oh sih!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pachia, nang nynh na ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob ciihan hae kha na vua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin tuh nithua lang e</para>
  <para style="q2">naawthyanaw te thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Filistin hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">beidin dothyanaw te thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">phe beih hae zah, ramccang hae</para>
  <para style="q2">phung kha a zuibua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mih ram tuh sui te</para>
  <para style="q2">ngun te phe beih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih sisua tuh thang kho khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ram tuh marang te phe beih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">marangle hae tuh riatae um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih ram tuh zohtuh hae te phe abeih;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuih nynh a raepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">mimaw kuihdung ccaccei nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a raepaw kha a beik hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nyaasah bung thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih balyn mawte nesah bung athua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha ngaethya nan hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lesaenaw te a phu-enaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">lungpi lungkhu lang tee lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laenoi kya reku tua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:15">Bya 6.15</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:9">2Th 1.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nin kya tuh ccungccaw hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakunaw mit kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nesah bung athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lysakunaw kha nyaasah athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> lu kheit kyalya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hangthung athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin nin khe vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a lysakuhpaw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">a tansakuhpaw balyn te</para>
  <para style="q1">a hangsakuhpaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a nyaasah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lebanon e ahangpaw sidar thing balyn te</para>
  <para style="q2">Bashan ram e phaesi thing balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a nge cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahangpaw mua hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">sangpyng hae kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />rhawviainn hae balyn te</para>
  <para style="q2">khua a koihlupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawlungrua hae balyn kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">a ting cih hae zah a bialaesah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tarshish ccingbaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">kuih te raepaw apuithyapaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a zosah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a tansakunaw hae balyn kha a roh cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyalya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hangthung athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zohtuh hae tuh a zo cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bungzousah khylan he yn thokuh te,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">a lesaenaw te a phu-enaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkarung lungkhu lang te</para>
  <para style="q2">laekarung lungkhu lang tee oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">beik lan a la raeku hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">sui zohtuh hae te ngun zohtuh hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">theihmung hae te balaw hae kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">oun vuapah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bungzousah khylan he yn thokuh te,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lesaenaw te a phu-enaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">lungkarung hae te laekarung hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">tee khylan khahcite oun rekuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mih naduh kya hy kyalya</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoi hae paw ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaehoikuh nan oh, minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria lan a um hae zawtou?</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Atu alesaepaw Bawipaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem khua te Judah ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">bawmnaw te a doliaku hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a lah vae cih—</para>
  <para style="q2">a bawm hae paw sanlou te tui—</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a rawthungpaw te rhawkaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">byapiatu te profeh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a pawepaw te kum tangpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />rhawbawi te uktu bawi,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuanaw pyatu te mitleihthyapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">byaho apuakuh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a lah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pise taraw hae kha minmin uktu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nung cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nosi hae nynh minmin kha a uk cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh lu kheit te lu kheit,</para>
  <para style="q2">innpaw lu kheit te lu kheit,</para>
  <para style="q1">vawsaw a pyakuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mino nynh piccan kha sawtua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccalei hae paw nynh sawtuaruapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha sawtua lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh phin kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">athua hae paw a puizia kha heize</para>
  <para style="q2">a kyngde cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh boeining na hoi;</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening oun cciakhaetu lang</para>
  <para style="q1">oun umpah lah, hynh-e arohpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">apumkuhpaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na uknaw zakaw a um cih,” a cipah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama aning nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Kae tuh a raethuitu ka thua kho lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka inn kya sanlou um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">boeining mah um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw cciakhaetu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">yn nung nan oh,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">siaruate a ho cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem tuh a pu vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Judah tuh a khuliakuh vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize mih byaho te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih cyisahnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rawse zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a umnaw aphu-epaw kha a thusah hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mih maesue nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsete ccaekia a khan;</para>
  <para style="q1">Sodom khuaccaaw hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">mih seinaw kha pheiku leite</para>
  <para style="q2">a phyku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin hanlan ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize mimaw tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw kha a thuakhaeku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miding hae tuh mih lungtua cih</para>
  <para style="q2">cipaw kha miding hae kha hopah hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize mih ryalaw mee</para>
  <para style="q2">athae kha a ae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoylei hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um! Hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a tung hae paw nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize a la cyi hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tungvaw kya cyiru athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Imua hae nynh ka ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tuaa a sah hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">nopi hae nynh minmin kha a uk hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou ka ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning ae cciakhae oh paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha ae cciakhaesei oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccianaw oh paw laanpi kha ae ropya oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a byathan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ho khylan a paccynkuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">byapia khylan a thadyn vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">piccan hae te uktu bawi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">byapianaw lungkhu lang a teekhae hae:</para>
  <para style="q2">Nanning nynh misu khokhu kha na lua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ryachi hae uccaw na luade oh paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae inn kya a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccemou ka ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na miade oh zah, ryachi hae mae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na tude oh? cite Bawipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw Pachia nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Zion ccanung hae tuh lysakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maemae angthungte a cceih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pise hae kha darote phalah do hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccia vae hae ze byabyate a kaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ccu kya a khiiku hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">khinling taraw kha a ccaesah bia hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipaw nynh Zion ccanung hae</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kha a o cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih ccakaete</para>
  <para style="q2">a nung cih hae zah maethya</para>
  <para style="q1">a law cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Bawipaw nynh ccu kya ccaankunawpaw hae, lu kya voikupaw hae, nging kya oikupaw hae, <verse number="19" style="v" />si alungmung hae, khawccan hae, mae kya bongkupaw hae; <verse number="20" style="v" />lukhung hae, kuih kya khiikupaw hae, taeccia hae, zimuin bawng hae te mitleih uccaw hae; <verse number="21" style="v" />tazeih kuihpu hae te naduhhuing hae; <verse number="22" style="v" />ahoypaw boei hae, angkiccua, poi toonawpaw angki hae te kuihccyng zaw hae; <verse number="23" style="v" />myarya pahpaw boeining, pavua hae, pungde hae te mae bongkupaw boei hae kha a lawpah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zimuin hanpaw athuhpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">taeccia nebaleihpaw hanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tangkaraepaw arui;</para>
  <para style="q1">akhekuhpaw sang nebaleihpaw hanpaw lu-o;</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw boei nebaleihpaw hanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">buriboei ahuikuhpaw;</para>
  <para style="q2">puithyanaw nebaleihpaw hanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na ccungccaw hae tuh thaloi te</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na rhawkaw hae tuh rhawtuknaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuapi koikua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ngaethah cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a rah a khui cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi tuh boeining leite</para>
  <para style="q1">laekhu a haungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopinung hawte athua cih.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin khe nopi lu sari nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">pise lu kheit kha a kyng cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kaemaw looh kha kae ae cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">kaemaw boeining kha kae lawkuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae maethyanaw kha khawku khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">kae vawpaw cite ko kyalya</para>
  <para style="q1">kae ko sah,” oun ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Zion Um hae paw Malang Ccyh Phu-enaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e thingkaran tuh a puithya cih zah a phu-e cih, ram kya-e looh athae tuh Israel hae laku e a hiinhy hae paw mih rykunaw te mih phu-enaw athua cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion te Jerusalem kya a laehypaw miakaw, Jerusalem kya ahiinhypaw ccazing kya a umpaw miakaw kha mithyaa cite ko athua cih, <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipaw nynh Zion ccanung hae kya-e nungsikunaw kha a singpya vae hae, Jerusalem lungkhu chiise luanaw kha byapianaw huhan te maeesoi huhan khate a thyaasah vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Zion Mua vawlan te tuin kya a pumkuh hae paw balyn luki khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh khuadae khe maeking a umsah cih zah khuazi khe maeekhuh te aruapaw maee a umsah cih. Pachia phu-enaw nynh khuapi kha abalyn mawte a bong cih zah a thungkhaw cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21">Exo 13.21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 24:16">24.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />A phu-enaw tuh khuapi kha khuadae asopaw kyate khaw khylan mynlyh athua cih zah, khuaa te khise kyate khum khylan khynnawpaw te bu athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Misu Khokhu Hlaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka sungsah kya-e misu khokhu te</para>
  <para style="q2">asekuhpaw sungsakunaw hlaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sungsah hanlan ka sahpah cih:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka sungsahpaw tuh laephi myarya</para>
  <para style="q1">hoynaw mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">misu khokhu ccangkheit a hoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:33">Mat 21.33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1">Mar 12.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9">Luk 20.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laephi kha thae zah lung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe thyaa lan a vua,</para>
  <para style="q1">te ahoypaw misu ku kha a lin;</para>
  <para style="q2">khokhu ngaelung khe ngawnawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">buhang kha sak zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">misu mia nawlan akhu kha a karyn;</para>
  <para style="q1">misu thae a thae lanpaw kha a ngaehoi,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama ahoy leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">misu thae lang nynh phe thae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te atu, Jerusalem um hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">Judah ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae te ka misu khokhu hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">bya oun pia oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka misu khokhu hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">cyipya lan ccan zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka cyipya leipaw pawmou a um ung?</para>
  <para style="q2">Misu thae a thae lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ngaehoi lyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou ahoy leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">misu thae lang poh a thae?</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka misu khokhu hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">pawmou ka cyih cih cipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">atu kae hopah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">A hohung kha ka roh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">milae nynh a ae cih; a lungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ting cih zah syde athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Misu khokhu kha alakawpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tangsah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoy leipaw akaran kha baepya te</para>
  <para style="q2">pohpia te phopya mah thua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thabu te hinpaw ku hae nynh a zithin cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">khokhu kya khuaa araw khyh nawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">maeking kha mah kaw ka pya cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel phin tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">misu khokhu nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah ccungccaw hae tuh aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a linkupaw misu ku nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh byading kha a ngaehoi,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama chiise luanaw kha a muih;</para>
  <para style="q1">dingnaw kha a ngaehoi,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama rawnaw roi kha a thae!</para>
  <para style="s1">Dingleinaw kha Seibenaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Milae hanlan umnaw a um lei lan ciate,</para>
  <para style="q2">inn te inn po kyngkuh lan</para>
  <para style="q2">na piade oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae loo pe ccangpaw loo kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na piachih oh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ram lungkhu khe naemaw kyalya</para>
  <para style="q2">na um oh paw tuh ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thaenaw kya bya a kinkupaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Le zah apuithyapaw inn patae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a umtu um leite</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw adae ccaccing cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize misu khokhu</para>
  <para style="q2">ekah ccanghaw nynh misutui galan</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangtaruh loukaw kha a pou cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccacii phu haw a tupaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">phu kheit kyalya kha a mue cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ruithyapaw kha nia khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">awkhua takaw te a tho hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuazi mah misutui po a rui hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning hanlan ngaethya lan kou um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih poi kya tuh tintang te</para>
  <para style="q2">arui lungpaw tintang,</para>
  <para style="q2">tamboring, phyly te misutui a hoi hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a cyipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih te rya a lawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">muih khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nytaw leite kyng hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang lang a cciakhae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin a cciakhaetu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">vuelawte vyavya a chih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccungccaw zapi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tui kanmaw hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze michi khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aerang-niarang myarya thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a khalang kha thawte a aw;</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem a phu-enaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw zapi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungtuapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccahbung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh maethyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a bakhung hae, mih balynte</para>
  <para style="q1">nyaasah bung hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a lysakuh hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih maesue phe roh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw te hangthung thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Athyaapaw Pachia nynh a thyaanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw toulou nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw liate a langsahku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tetuh arohpaw khuapi lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q2">tuutaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ram a paeekunaw hae kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a ae hae hawte a ae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">miaataw hae nynh rampaeekunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a muihkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hoyleinaw kha seinaw rui te</para>
  <para style="q2">a sue hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q1">le kha arui te sue hawte seinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a sue hae paw nanning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Aening nynh ah muih ccaw oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">arangte lah vae sah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Aening nynh ah ny ccaw oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a paccynkupaw kha ccingsah lan</para>
  <para style="q2">rangsakuh vae sah!” cite na ho oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahoy leipaw kha ahoy,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw kha hoy khyh cite</para>
  <para style="q1">a ho hae paw, awnaw kha mohnaw lang,</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw kha awnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a tangsah hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">akhahpaw kha a-epaw lang,</para>
  <para style="q2">a-epaw kha akhahpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a tangsah hae paw nanning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka haw cite na muihkuh oh paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">naemaw mitmuihnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">na hawsakuh oh paw nanning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Misutui nianaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">minthaan hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">aphuinphuin pykuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ruithyapaw nianaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rawthungpaw nanning te</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />pyaruh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">a sei hae paw kha daangsah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">seinaw a hoi lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mue lan accanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a pya lei hae paw nanning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="s1">Ramccang nynh Kyngku lanpaw Hotynaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, maee nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccatanphue kha u zah maeesoi nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">lonua aroupaw kha a u hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tharui tuh a thuh cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin apaw tuh vuiping hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">akhuhthung cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thuiheinaw kha ngae leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">Athyaapaw Israel Pachia bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria vae khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae tungvaw maee lang rua zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih dyngnua te minmin kha detah hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae tuh hy hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">mih rhua hae tuh laanpi kya athupaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a um hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">dae khyh zah a kuih po a dyng ung.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asawnaw umpaw minphuin hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">syntawnawpaw alan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a hangpah thung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi adianaw umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">fari kha a tupah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Te minmin nynh arangte</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceih vae hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Minmin kya a thawbangpaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a thy a pawkuhpaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ngawphukuhpaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ihpaw um khyh, cce kya</para>
  <para style="q1">voikupaw mah phoukuh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a phanah rui paepaw um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />mih the tuh ahe, mih li tuh a tang,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih marang ccukoh hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rihlung te lokuh zah, mih leccu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khiccung te nynh a loku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mih roi tuh chindeih a siapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">roi te lokuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih anopaw hawte a sia hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">hurawte saw kha a kyngku hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e saw tuh a cciakhaeku hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">te lu kheit nynh sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">luesah kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuin nin khe minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rili tuileih athopaw roi hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">a sia a rua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuh-e ram tuh do lanze mohnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">riathaenaw rou nynh a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw tuh maeking khate</para>
  <para style="q1">amohkhaekuh vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Isaiah A Ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uzziah siapharan a chi kum khe, hang zah a sung-epaw bawitungkhung kya a haungpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka muih; a boeining rae tuh beikinn kya phe abeih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:7">2Si 15.7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:23">2Sh 26.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaawccungccaw hae tuh a pe khe um hae zah, sake ccangtaruh cci a hoi hae: sake ccangning te mih mae kha bongkuh hae zah, ccangpaw ccangning te mih ccu kha a bongku hae, te ccangpaw ccangning khate a zou hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te lu kheit te lu kheit hokuh hae zah:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Athyaa, athyaa, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh athyaa;</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi pynpi tuh a phu-enaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">phe abeih,” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 4:8">Bya 4.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e a sia hae paw roi keiccuze thuakawtung hae tuh hy zah, inn tuh maeekhuh te phe abeih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 15:8">Bya 15.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “Ka hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Phe ka thang vae, pawccecize kae tuh munglae a thyaa leipaw ka thua zah, munglae a thyaa lei hae paw laku a umpaw nynh ka thua; tuhzemah ka mit te Siapharan, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka muih vae!” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh vaawpaw lu kheit nynh silawhang vawlan e tetakia te takeihkuhpaw maee-e zaezae epaw ccangkheit kha ka kalan yn zoukhae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e maee-e tuh ka mung kya yn nae zah: “E maee-e nynh phe ae ty vae, na cyiseinaw tuh zo vae zah, na seinaw tuh ngaethya athua vae,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Hummou ka saw cih? Kaening hanlan hummou a cceih cih?” cite a hopaw roi kha ka thae. Te kae nynh, “E kya mang ka um; kae hynh yn saw!” ka ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “E ccungccaw hae kalan cceih lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Ngae oh lah mah, asuilan</para>
  <para style="q2">na nyhthya lan khyh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">do oh lah mah, na thaethya lan khyh oh,’</para>
  <para style="q2">cite hopah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:14-15">Mat 13.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mar 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:10">Luk 8.10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:40">Joh 12.40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:26-27">Loc 28.26-27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae nynh mih mit te</para>
  <para style="q2">a muih khyh nawlan hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">mih nakaring te a thae khyh nawlan hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thinlung te</para>
  <para style="q2">a nythya khyh nawlan hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">maeleihkute a dan khyh nawlan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thinlung kha ngaeesah hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih nawpansah hae lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih mit kha masisah hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh kae nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">hohsemou aro cih?” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Khuapi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">roh hae zah khuaccaaw hae um leite</para>
  <para style="q1">accawnghan makhia cia,</para>
  <para style="q2">te inn hae tuh ccungccaw um leite</para>
  <para style="q1">accawnghan hae makhia cia,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram tuh ccungccaw phe adae makhia cia,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccungccaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw lang saw hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram lungkhu kya kharouh accawnghan</para>
  <para style="q2">makhia cia tuh-e ccyh tuh aro cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram lungkhu ccungccaw pum haw kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">pum kheit a la lae ung ze heize,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e a laepaw tuh ro athua ung cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e a laepaw tuh maeccaw ku te</para>
  <para style="q1">phaesi ku kha nge thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccungmuing tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thadyn hawte athua cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q2">Athyaapaw ccacii tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e ccungmuing tuh nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahaz Siapharan kalan Isaiah Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah siapharan Uzziah ccapaw Jotham, Jotham ccapaw Ahaz siapharan ccyh lyakhe, Siria Siapharan Rezin te Israel siapharan Remaliah ccapaw Pekah Siapharan nynh Jerusalem kha rhawtuk khylan a ccianua thung hae, thuasalama lah kho khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:5">2Si 16.5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:5-6">2Sh 28.5-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Siria ram tuh Efraim ryte a hokheih vae hae cipaw David phin hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, Ahaz thinlung te a ccungccaw hae thinlung tuh khisan nynh a hysahpaw ramkaw e thingku hae hawte a thyngkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Isaiah kha hynhte a hopya, Na ccapaw Shear Jashub<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shear Jashub </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh ccungccaw beihtaraw kyalya a kithui cih hae cinawpaw nynh thua. Byaria 10.12-22 kya mah do hin.</char></note> ryte cceih oh lah, boeikua hae paw nynh rya a lawnaw hae hmin kalan a cceihpaw laanpi kya, palung lang e tuili nynh a luanaw tuizy athangnaw kyakhe Ahaz siapharan khate la tungkuh oh, <verse number="4" style="v" />te amaw kha, Raeringkuh lah, lungdaete um, rih nan; Siria Siapharan Rezin te Remaliah ccapaw tuh myarya mih thinria zemah na lungthawthah nan sah, cite na hopah cih; minmin tuh maee a u cciamangpaw ccungmuing ccangning nynh thua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Siria ram, Efraim ram hae te Remaliah ccapaw nynh nang kha rawsete hoyleinaw kha paccyn hae zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah kha ccianua oh sih lah, Jerusalem kha rote tae oh sih, te tuin kyakhe Tabeel ccapaw kha siapharan lang nung oh sih, a ciku hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e paccynkunaw tuh tyn lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhte cyihkuh lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize Siria lu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Damaskas khua thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Damaskas khua a lu tuh Rezin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">(Sung taruh kum pangaw lungkhu Efraim tuh zoihtatae lan a koi cih, ccungccaw um vae lan khyh.)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Efraim lu tuh Samaria thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Samaria lu tuh Remaliah ccapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Zynnaw kya tynkaring lan na thadyn khyh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">papinmaw na tyn lan khyh, a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Immanuel Muihsahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Ahaz kha bua hopah zah, <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kya-e muihsahnaw kha ngiatua; michi khua hawte akhupaw kyate thuasah, tuhkhyhze vaawram hawte ahangpaw kyate thuasah ngiatua, a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahaz nynh, ka ngia lan khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka syntawtua lan khyh, a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Isaiah nynh, “Pou David ciihan hae, ngaetua oh, ccungccaw hae kha lungro ngaemyng te na nung oh paw hynh eih azya ung keiccu tou, ka Pachia kha mah lungro ngaemyng te na nung oh? <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw ccaccei nynh nanning kha muihsahnaw ae pya cih oh. Dotua oh, liaccady nynh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw a saah cih, a min tuh Immanuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Immanuel asuilan tuh Pachia kaening ryte a um cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> cite a phu cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:23">Mat 1.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Aning nynh ahoypaw te ahoy leipaw kha he a laesah thya ccyh kyacia a looh tuh samateitui ahaawpaw te khoitui athua cih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e imua nynh ahoy leipaw kha vua te ahoypaw kha pokupaw a ny mawkhe, nang nynh na ripaw siapharan lu ning hae ram tuh poutaw athua cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah phin kyate Efraim phin he a pou nin te a la um boi leipaw vawsawnaw ccyh kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang te na ccungccaw hae te na puizia hae tungvaw kya a thuakhae cih—Assiria siapharan nynh a thuakhae cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin ccyh vae tuh Izip ram e vawkhu vanaw hae kya umpaw myn hae te Assiria ram e khoi hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ko cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh oun thua cih hae zah akhupaw akarung hae te lungkarung hae te hinpawbu miakaw te sahiin paeekunaw miakaw kya a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin ccyh vae tuh Vawpi khuraw lang umpaw hohpaw sang ngonawpaw athuapaw Assiria siapharan kha mangte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na sang te na ccuming kha a ngo cih, na khawming kha mah a ngo cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin ccyh vae tuh ccungccaw lu kheit nynh vaetua tohlaw sa kheit te tuu sa ning kha a kuakuh cih zah, <verse number="22" style="v" />tuh-e hae kyate mateitui patae a mue keiccuze samateitui ahaawpaw kha a ae cih; pawccecize tuh-e ram kya a umhypaw miakaw nynh samateitui ahaawpaw te khoitui kha a ae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuin ccyh vae tuh misu ku thong kheit ze ngunphua shekel thong kheit a meepaw misu khokhu miakaw tuh thabu te hinpawbu lang a tang cih. <verse number="24" style="v" />The te li ccyngkute rou nynh tuh-e hmin langkhe a cceih ngan cih hae, pawccecize ram pynpi tuh thabu te hinpawbu te phe abeih; <verse number="25" style="v" />pohpia te looh la ccounaw hae mua hae kalan khe thabu te hinpawbu keiccuze na cceih ngan vae lan khyh oh; vaetua sawnuapaw hmin te tuu nynh a sydepaw hmin lang a tang vae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Isaiah nynh Ccapaw A Saah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, Ccaw zeinawpaw lungphe alepaw phe kheit kha lawkuh lah, a vawlan khe ccungccaw miakaw nynh thaethya lante, “Arangte luade, palou lah,” cite asuilan a umpaw “Maher-shalal-hash-baz,” kha zeitua, <verse number="2" style="v" />ka hanlan alungzipaw ccaekia lu ning, ranpibawi Uriah te Jeberekhiah ccapaw Zekhariah kha ko hae, yn cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te ka zu kalan ka naeku keiccuze aning tuh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw a saah. Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh imua kha Maher-shalal-hash-baz cite min na phu cih, yn cipya; <verse number="4" style="v" />pawccecize imua nynh “Anung, Apang” cite a kothya mawkhe Damaskas kya-e sisua te Samaria khua e luadepaw uccaw kha Assiria siapharan nynh ccaring a cciakhae cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bua yn hopah zah: <verse number="6" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae nynh daebabi lan a luapaw Shiloah vawkhu e tui kha ry leite, Rezin te Ramaliah ccapaw malang khe rawrite a thyngku hae keiccuze, <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a thawsaepaw Zufrates Vaw tui alepaw kha mih tungvaw a luasah thin cih, tuh-e tuh Assiria siapharan te a phu-enaw balyn kha nynh thua; tuh-e Vawpi kya-e tuizy te vawkhurae balyn tuh tui aleikuh cih, <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah ram lungkhu langkhe tui alepaw hawte a luathin cih zah, a nging kyacia a vu cih; a dawpaw a sake nynh na ram balyn kha pong a bong cih, pou Immanuel, yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nanning, thinphangte</para>
  <para style="q2">um oh lah, pynkheihlan sueluakuh tua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">laansawpi um hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning balyn, ka bya ngaetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuk lan paccynkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinphangte um oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuk lan paccynkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinphangte um oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuanaw pyakuh kalang oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama tuh-e tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw lang a tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">khuakhankuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama tyn lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening kya a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae laanpi kha ka zui khyh nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh athungpaw a huhan khate raeringnaw yn pya zah yn hopyapaw tuh: <verse number="12" style="v" />E ccungccaw hae nynh aruh lante khuakhan hae paw miakaw kya umbua nan lah, a ri hae paw kha rihbua nan, siikuh nan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14-15">1Pe 3.14-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw rou kha athyaapaw lante na tua cih; amaw raw kha rih lah, siiku tua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning tuh hminthyaa athua cih, thuasalama aning tuh Judah te Israel innbyn hae nynh a thykunaw hae paw lung te a khuliakunaw hae paw lungpi lang a tang cih zah, Jerusalem ccungccaw hae hanlan kaang te taphung lang a tang cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:8">1Pe 2.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Minmin laku e patae tuh a thy a pawkuh cih hae; a khuliakuh cih hae zah a khya cih hae; kaang a kae cih hae zah kyng athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Isaiah Zuitu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka zuitu hae kyakhe hynh-e ccaekiakhannaw hynh khiide lah, e ccangpyanaw hynhte tazeih khiatua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakob ciihan kyate a mae a rekuhpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka doliakuh cih zah, ka ngaehoinaw kha amaw kya ka nung cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Heb 2.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Dotua, kamaw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn pyapaw imua hae tuh Zion Mua a umpaw vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate Israel hae hanlan muisahnaw te syntawnaw lang oun sawpaw nynh kae thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:13">Heb 2.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh, “Kuihdothya hae paw te tarutaru ccohkute chihiinleihthya hae paw kha tuanaw ngiakuh oh; ccungccaw hae nynh mih pachia hae kha thuasah, a hiin hae paw ccelang a chih hae paw kha thuasah ccangpyakunaw te thuiheikunaw kha tuanaw ngiaku lan ccan khyh tou?” cite ae hopah cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thanccingte, tuhcite a ho hae paw tuh khuadaenaw hoi lan khyh hae! <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin tuh ram lungkhu khe vuelaw riathae te a khiakuh cih hae; mih vuelaw vae ze mih thinria cih zah, mih siapharan te mih pachia hae kha thya a law cih hae. Mih mae kha a angthung cih hae, <verse number="22" style="v" />tuhkhyhze laekhu lang a dobung cih hae, thuasalama riathaenaw te mohnaw, thinphang ngaethyanaw kyalya kha a muih cih hae; marae zipingpaw mohnaw lungkhu langkhe nohde athua cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Yn Thua Cih paw Siapharan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuasalama lungriathaete um hae paw hanlan ngaethyanaw um vae lan khyh. Langmawlya tuh Zebulun ram te Naftali ram kya theihryanaw kha a la thuakhae, thuasalama nyalang tuh rili kin a cceihpaw laanpi, Jordan vaw khuraw lang, minphuin ccangpaw hae a umnaw hae Galilee ram kha a phu-epaw lang a rae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:15">Mat 4.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mohnaw kya a cceih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw alepaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a muih vae hae; marae amohnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kya a um hae paw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw tuh a ak vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:16">Mat 4.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luk 1.79</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang nynh minphuin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na pungthungsah vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lung houhouh na tuasah vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">loohrue lya-e lungtuanaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">luadepaw uccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a neeku lya hae mih lungtua hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw malang mih lungtua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize mih phupaw aripaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a puihnaw hae paw ccong,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih raw vawlan e ccong te</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahtu hae kya-e ccungngue kha</para>
  <para style="q1">Midian ccyh lya hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na khyapya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rhawdoutu hae kya-e ccukoh balyn te</para>
  <para style="q2">chii kya ohkuhpaw boeining balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">maeesoinawpaw morei hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">u athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize aening hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">imua lu kheit a pui vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccapaw lu kheit pya ah thua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh uknaw kaw a hoi cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha Ngaeang lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuanaw pyatu, Athungpaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">Zungzae tynpaw Paaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Daenaw Siapharan</para>
  <para style="q2">cite minphu athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A uknaw kaw tuh houhouh a lethung cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">David kya-e bawitungkhung te</para>
  <para style="q1">a peenaw hanlan athangthya leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw a um cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e tuh aning nynh byading te</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw khate atu te</para>
  <para style="q1">malang zungzae cia</para>
  <para style="q2">a tynsah cih zah a uk cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">E hynh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungthote a cyih cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:32-33">Luk 1.32-33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Lysakunaw te Tuaasahkunaw kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jakob ciihan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bya sawnua zah, tuh-e bya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae tungvaw accah;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Efraim ccungccaw hae te Samaria ram</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw ccungccaw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh a ny hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakute lungkhungte a ho hae paw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Anglae inn tuh ating vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama lung inn lante</para>
  <para style="q2">kae sak cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">saikamor thaeku thing hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nge athua vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama tuh-e thing hae umnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">sidar thing hae khate</para>
  <para style="q2">kae sanlae cih,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin a rawsetu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hangthung hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rhaw hae kha a tuhou hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nithua langte Siria hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">niccaw langte Filistin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">mih khalang aw hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel kha a laang hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuinte mah a thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">daelae khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih kha po a dyng ung.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tungvaw de a tahtupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">kalan khe ki khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ccung khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel phin kyate alu te</para>
  <para style="q2">aleihmae kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ungcci ku ange te phaeku kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">nin kheit lungkhu a bae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />lu tuh piccan hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtua lan um hae paw kha thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">leihmae tuh hynbya a ccangpah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">profeh hae kha nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />e ccungccaw hae a cciakhaetu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha cciakhaesei hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha mih lungnuasah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccangvae hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyaumsah khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngawraw hae te nomae hae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">thawccih khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize mih balyn mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia pawlangria lei hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">hoyleinaw a rae hae paw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeepaw bya kha a ho hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuinte mah a thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">daelae khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih kha po a dyng ung.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hoyleinaw tuh maee hawte arua,</para>
  <para style="q2">thabu te hinpawbu kha</para>
  <para style="q1">phe ccung lan a u;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhpi kya-e thing hae kha u zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aku hae tuh maeekhuh ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">a zouthung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ram tuh u zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae tuh maee-unawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">maeelooh lang a tang hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit te lu kheit thawccihkuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mih ranglang kuih te karankute</para>
  <para style="q2">a ae hae zemah, mih vuelaw mamin,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih voilang kuih te a ae hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">bynlae khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih puiziapaw ngesaw toulou kha a ae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Manasseh phin hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">Efraim phin hae tuh a doukuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">e phin ning hae nynh parouhte</para>
  <para style="q2">Judah phin kha a dou hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuinte mah a thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">daelae khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih kha po a dyng ung.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" />A hobou hae paw kha ahme lei lante</para>
  <para style="q2">byapia khylan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae laku e</para>
  <para style="q2">ryachi hae nynh mue lan</para>
  <para style="q1">accanpaw kha luade khylan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nomae hae te ngawraw hae</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw kha luade khylan thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">ahme leipaw byapianaw a rae hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuaasahkunawpaw phungbya a zeitu hae</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning hanlan ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Detah nin kya thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw langte yn thua cih paw</para>
  <para style="q1">shethya ccyh kya thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning nynh pawmou na cyih cih oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Bawmnaw mue khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">hum kalan mou na ccue cih oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Nae sisua kha teimou na cciataw cih oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rhawtukkunaw kya na chih cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">athua khyhze thongccah hae paw hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaring ae sue cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuinte mah a thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">daelae khyh zah, a kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">po a dyng ung.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Assiria kha A Mang</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thin yn riasah hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">detah nawlan ccungngue lang</para>
  <para style="q1">ka mangpaw Assiria hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih kuih kya umpaw tungbang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw kya ka mangpaw nynh thua!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5-34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:24-27">Isa 14.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Nah 1.1—3.19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Zef 2.13-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pachia pawlangria leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin kalan khe Assiria kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sawnua, ka thin yn riasahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha luade lan,</para>
  <para style="q1">kyngde lan te, laanpi e</para>
  <para style="q2">tuiccua hawte syde lan,</para>
  <para style="q2">Assiaria kha kaw ka pya vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama e hynh aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a paccynpaw thua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinlung kya a nungpaw mah thua khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">ro rynaw te minphuin patae</para>
  <para style="q2">syro rynaw kha a thinlung kya a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Ka rhawbawi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balynte siapharan hae khaw athua hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalno khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Karkhemish khua hawte khaw athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hamath khua tuh Arpad khua hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">khaw athua? Samaria khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Damaskas khua hawte khaw athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem te Samaria laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh alunghua a hoipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">peenaw hae kha detah khylan ka kuih</para>
  <para style="q2">ka dyngnua hae hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Samaria te a zohtuh hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cyi hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem te a zohtuh hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cyih lan khyh tou?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Zion Mua te Jerusalem kya a ryalaw he a thangsah te, Assiria siapharan a pookunaw te a lysakunaw kha de a tah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Assiria siapharan nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka thawzung te e hynh ka cyi vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hawnaw te ka thaethya vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae ramri kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nuepah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih sisua kha ka luade vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">bawitungkhung kya a haung hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tangnuapaw hawte ka suebung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pavaw bu kha muih hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih nynh ccungccaw hae sisua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a muih vae; vuapaw pavaw tui hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">suelua hawte laephi pynpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka suelua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a sake yn bianua nganpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a khalang yn awnua nganpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">yn sianua nganpaw lu kheit san</para>
  <para style="q2">um khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hae nynh a mangtupaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lehua cite a ho kho tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Thing-aw nynh a awnahpaw ccungccaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">abyapi huapaw lang a riakuh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungngue nynh amaw a hangtupaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">a hangsakuh cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hoitang nynh amaw a hangthungtupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a hangthung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Alesaepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuh-e siapharan kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">athawsaepaw rhawkaw hae laku khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ngethyasahnawpaw ccinaw kha a saw cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a phu-enaw kyakhe maee aruapaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a ruasah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel awnaw tuh maee lang a tang cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">a kya-e Athyaapaw Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">maeesoi lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hinpaw hae te thabu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nin kheit lungkhu marya a u cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhpi phu-enaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">athae umpaw loo phu-enaw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pyn te muisaw kha parouh mawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a roh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccinaw nynh ccungccaw a ro hawkhate a roh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhpi kya-e alaepaw thingku hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">imua nynh ria kho lan ciate</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya azya vae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">A Ngaesikuhpaw Israel hae Beihtaraw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh a laehypaw Israel hae te ahiinhypaw Jakob ciihan hae nynh minmin a la rohtu hae kha doliaku vae leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia Athyaapaw kha thanccingte a doliakuh vae cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />A laehypaw Jakob ciihan hae tuh athungpaw Pachia kalan a kithui cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pou Israel, na ccungccaw Israel hae tuh rili kya-e laesia zeih cih hae salamah a laehy hae paw rou nynh a kithui cih hae. Khah-e ccungccaw hae nynh dingrarih lan byapianaw te phe beihpaw athangnaw kha a tung ccaccing cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22-23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:27">Rom 9.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Vaaw Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ho vae thyhte laephi pynpi kya ronaw a thuakhae cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaaw Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Zion kya um hae paw, pou ka ccungccaw hae, Izip hae nynh ae la cyi oh hawte, Assiria hae nynh ccungngue te ae bua oh zah, mih hoitang kha ae hangnua oh ze, minmin kha rih nan oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Sosoh aro te nae tungvaw ka thinrianaw tuh adae cih zah, ka thinrianaw khate minmin kha ka roh cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Oreb lungpi kya Midian hae kha rhaw a tuk hae hawte, minmin kha a ccungngue te a bua cih hae; a hoitang tuh rili vawlan a hang cih zah, Izip ram kya a la cyi hawte hoitang kha a hangthung cih. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Assiria hae kya-e phupaw ripaw kha na raw kyate lawpya athua cih zah, mih puihnawpaw ccong kha na nging kyakhate khyapya athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Ngesaw thonaw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">nanrui kha pae athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Rhaw hae tuh Aiath khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a thua vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Migron khua kha po a lue vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih uccaw kha Mikmash khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a nungku hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />mua hae laku po cceih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Geba khe a rya hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Ramah khuaccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thyngkuh vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Saul siapharan khua</para>
  <para style="q2">Gibeah khuaccaaw hae tuh a ccue vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pou Gallim khuaccaaw hae, siatua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Laishah khuaccaaw hae, ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Anathoth khuaccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Gallim khuaccaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a sia hae paw kha khungru tua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Madmenah khuaccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a nuekuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Gebim khuaccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khyn khylan a ccue hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rhaw hae tuh atunin ccaccei khe</para>
  <para style="q2">Nob khua kya um hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Zion ccanung Mua, Jerusalem khua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuihlung a lungnua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Alesaepaw, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan umpaw huhan khate</para>
  <para style="q1">thingkaran bae hawte a bae cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ahang huaccepaw thingku hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a nge cih hae zah, ahang hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">akaw a sangsah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuhpi kya-e thingku hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hae te a nge cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Lebanon mua tuh a thing hoypaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">rykhate a pu cih.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Adaepaw Peenaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jessi ccungmuing kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">thingno thawpaw yn toih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a tharui kyate akaran tuh yn lethung cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:5">Bya 5.5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:16">22.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a tungvaw a um cih, hawnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">nythyanaw muisaw, tuanaw pyakunaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">thungnaw muisaw, nynaw muisaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tungvaw a um cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungrythuakhaekuh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">A mit nynh a muih thyhte</para>
  <para style="q2">byapia lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a naw nynh a thae thyhte mah</para>
  <para style="q2">byapae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ryachi hae kha dingnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a piapah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi vaw e a nyaa hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ahmete bya a paepah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a mung kya-e a bya ccungngue khate</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha a bua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a khalang kya-e hy khate</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a theih cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:8">2Th 2.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dingnaw tuh a tae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">taeccia athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lungzinaw tuh a tae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">voikupaw taeccia athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suizaw tuh tuu te a umkheih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">kaesing tuh miaa ataw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryakheih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaetuataw, chindeih taw te</para>
  <para style="q2">athopaw sahiin taw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a aekheih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">imua taraw nynh a cciakhae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.6-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:25">Isa 65.25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaetua te vong tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a aekheih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih taw hae tuh a ryakheih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih nynh tangnuapaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ccatanphue kha a ae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Matei zu ungpaw imua nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">huparepaw pe khe a zue cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">matei phiakuh vae paw imua nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">huparepaw khu kha a kuih te a pu cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh athyaapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsaw pyakunaw te ronaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rae lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize rili tuh tui te phe abia hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">phe abeih cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Israel te Judah Kithuinaw<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:14">Hab 2.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Jessi tharui tuh ccungccaw hae hanlan syntawnaw lante yn thadyn cih; minphuin hae nynh amaw kha akaw-aleih a khia cih hae zah, a umnaw tuh a phu-e cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:12">Rom 15.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a kuih a dyng cih zah, Assiria ram, Izip ram, Pathros ram, Ethiopia ram, Elam ram, Shinar ram, Hamath ram te rili kin e ram hae kyate a laehypaw a ccungccaw hae kha vaeningnaw a kikhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minphuin hae hanlan syntawnawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a hangthung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a zawpui hae paw Israel hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">phiariphiarae um hae paw Judah hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi ki kipali kyate a suelua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Efraim tuh eiungnaw thinlung</para>
  <para style="q2">hoi vae lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah tuh rhawku rynaw thinlung</para>
  <para style="q2">hoi vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Efraim nynh Judah tungvaw eiungnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hoi vae lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah nynh mah Efraim tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw rynaw thinlung hoi vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin nynh niccaw lang e Filistin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tuk cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nithua ccungccaw hae kya-e uccaw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a luade cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Edom hae te Moab hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuih a hangnua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Ammon hae nynh mih kaw a ngae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Izip rili akouleihnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a kangsah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">Vawpi vawlan khe a thawsaepaw khisan ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">a kuih a he cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Vawpi kha vaw vawsari lang a phia cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccu te zua nawlan laanpi kha a rae cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:12">Bya 16.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Izip ram kyate he a pou hae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae hanlan laanpi a um hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">a laehypaw a ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">Assiria ram kyate ccianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">laanluepi a um cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Lungtuabya Honaw te Thehoysahnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin kya na ho lanpaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na the kae hoysah cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tungvaw na thinria zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na thinrianaw tuh dae vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtangnaw nae pya vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pachia tuh ka khumnaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha ka doliakuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rih lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> PACHIA tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thawzung te ka thungnaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tuh yn khumtu nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:2">Exo 15.2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:14">Sam 118.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nanning nynh lungtuate khumnaw tuisung kya-e tui kha na thekuh cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin nin khe na ho lan oh paw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw min kha ko oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a cyipaw kha minphuin hae kya nysah oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">a min tuh hangthung athua cite siakhae oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysahnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hlawsahpah oh, pawccecize alesaepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw hae kha a rae vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh laephi pynpi nynh nyh sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion kya a umpaw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">sia sah lah, hlawsah sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize Athyaapaw Israel Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning laku kya alesae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon kha Rawsete Honaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon te asekuh lante Amoz ccapaw Isaiah nynh Pachia kyate yn thuapaw a thaepaw bya tuh hynhte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.1—14.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:1-15">Isa 47.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1-51:64">Jer 50.1—51.64</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mua otung vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuknaw alan kha sae oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">thawte sia oh; apuathopaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi koikua lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tee khylan nae kuih kha hepah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thyaasahpaw ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw ccaccei nynh kaw ka pya vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinrianaw kha daesah khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lesaenaw liate mih lungtuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rhawkaw hae kha ka pum vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae roi hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">mua vawlan e ngaluin-ngaluin ccaepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">roi tuh ngaetua oh! Peenaw ram hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan a sueluakuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae roi tuh ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh rhawtuknaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw hae kha a paccynsaku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw ryte a thinrianaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zunghe hae tuh ram pynpi kha ro khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">asawnaw ram, vaawlui adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nin anae vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite um oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Athunghuapaw kyate yn thuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw hawte nynh yn thua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:15">Joe 1.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw kuih balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawzya cih zah, ccungccaw miakaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lungthangte a rih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Teingnaw te riathaenaw a tung cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">neitangia a ccihpaw nopi hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">a teing cih hae. Lu kheit te lu kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">rikute a dokuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih maesue tuh maeesoi hawte athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Laephi kha ro khylan te</para>
  <para style="q2">misei hae kha laephi kyate maemih khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">thawccikunaw a um leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thinria bungpaw te yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vaawlang awsi hae te aphuphute</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw awsi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">aw vae lan khyh hae; khuanin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">he a thua vae ze amoh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sawpaw mah aw vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 32:7">Eze 32.7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24.29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-25">Mar 13.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25">Luk 21.25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12-13">Bya 6.12-13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laephipi kha a seinaw keiccu</para>
  <para style="q2">de ka tah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hoylei hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hoyleinaw hanlan de ka tah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a lysakuhpaw kya-e lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka zosah cih zah, a puatho hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">rysawthah hae paw kha ka biabung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw kha sui hoypaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khinsah hua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Ofir sui laeze akhinpaw lang ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a thinria nin khe,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui kha ka hysah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha a umnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nuesakuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawdepaw kyate a ccuepaw sakhi hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a rintu um leipaw tuu hae hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">mimaw minphuin hae kalan a hawi cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw ram lang a ccue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muihpaw ccungccaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi te thuing athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kyngpaw ccungccaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi te a chih cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mih ccaaw hae kha mih muihnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">palae tui lan a noidepah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih inn kha a luade cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih zu hae kha kyngdete a ikhaepah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dotua oh, Babilon hae kha dou khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngun pawlangria lei hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">sui a ry lei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">Media<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Media ccungccaw hae tuh Babilon thahlang-nithua kya a umpaw minphuin thua hae zah, Persia accozah peenaw lungkhu a um buapaw nynh thua hae.</char></note> ccungccaw hae kha ka tuhou cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih the hae nynh ccangvae hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a theih cih hae; nosi hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thawccinaw hoi lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih mit nynh imua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyaumsah lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ram hae kyaze a puithya huapaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon hae kya-e huhan te</para>
  <para style="q1">lunglekhaekuh lan umpaw Babilon tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh a ro hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">Sodom te Gomorrah hawte athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Gen 19.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babilon tuh ccungccaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouh a umnaw leipaw, she takyh</para>
  <para style="q2">a umnaw lei vae hae paw athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Arab hae nynh tuin kya bu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sakkuh lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuurin hae nynh mih tuuphu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya tuukhia raepah lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe loramsaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a um cih hae, mih inn tuh asiathyapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ahysuepaw hae te phe abeih cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">kalauh pavaw hae tuh tuin kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a um cih hae zah, sathaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya a law cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:14">Isa 34.14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:14">Zef 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:2">Bya 18.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ram-ui hae tuh rhawviainn kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a sia cih hae zah, suizaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">um ry a umnaw siapharan hae</para>
  <para style="q2">inn kya a sia cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Babilon ccyh tuh myarya nae vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a she sae vae lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah Kithuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jakob kha ngaethya a umsah cih zah Israel kha bua a po cih, te minmin kha mimaw ram kya a umsah cih hae; ramccang hae nynh minmin ryte a mungkuh cih hae zah Jakob ciihan te a umkheih cih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Minphuin hae nynh minmin kha mimaw umnaw kalan a cciakhae cih hae, te Israel ciihan hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ram kyakhe ramccang hae kha seenung te seepaw lang a hoi cih hae; minmin a la kyngtu hae kha a kyng cih hae zah, minmin a la tuaasahtu hae kha a uk cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Babilon Siapharan Shungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha ccinaw, teingnaw te nangsekute nawkupaw ryalaw rupaw kyate haeungnaw he ae pya oh te, <verse number="4" style="v" />Babilon siapharan kha hynhte na sarya cih oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Yn tuaa yn sahtupaw tuh phe chih vae hynhsa!</para>
  <para style="q2">A puathonaw tuh phe adae vae hynhsa!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccungccaw hoylei</para>
  <para style="q2">hae paw kya-e hoitang kha a khyapya vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ccungccaw hae kha thindynte, apaekuh lei lan</para>
  <para style="q2">thung hae zah, ram hae kha tuaasahnawte</para>
  <para style="q1">thindynte a uk hae paw kya-e ccoi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a khyapya vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh laephi pynpi tuh daenaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengannaw te um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate hlaw a sah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lebanon ram e maeccaw ku hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">sidar ku hae tuh mih lungtua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh na khuliakuh vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening kha nge khylan hum sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thua vae khyh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang he nae thua vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang te tungku khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">akawlan e michi khua tuh a paccynkuh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha cciadue khylan michi hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi cciakhaetu hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a thosah hae; ram hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih bawitungkhung kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a thosahku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mih balynte nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae hopah cih hae zah:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang mah kaening hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na thawzyabua vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Kaening hawte na thuabua vae!”</para>
  <para style="q2">ae cipah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lesaenaw te na tintang hae roi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">michi khua lang sawbung athua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">zanpaw vawlan na ih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na thykupaw boei mah</para>
  <para style="q1">tangkaria nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou awkhua ccapaw, Nizy Awsi,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh vaawlui kyate na ccah vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae kha a la taepaw nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kya khuliasaku na thua vae!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 8:10">Bya 8.10</ref>, <ref loc="REV 9:1">9.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thinlung kyakhe nang nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Vaawlang ka kae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bawitungkhung hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia awsi hae</para>
  <para style="q2">luki lang ka hangthung cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">palung lang e a pumkunaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">mua vawlan khe ka haung cih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.13-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:23">Mat 11.23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:15">Luk 10.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />maeking dung lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kaethung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahang Huaccepaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka um cih,” na ciku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Hunghua akhunaw lang,</para>
  <para style="q2">Michi khua lang sawbung na thua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang ae muih hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha riri dote</para>
  <para style="q1">na konglang a tua cih hae zah:</para>
  <para style="q2">“E ccungccapaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi a thyngsakuhpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram hae kha a siisakuh hae paw athua tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Laephi kha laesia ram lang tangsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi hae a rohtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw nynh thong a saw hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih inn lang a kisah lei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">athua tou?” cite a ho cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Laephi vaw e siapharan balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">alypaw mih shaw raveih kya a ih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />thuasalama nang tuh anungsikuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">sathuhpaw hawte na shawku te</para>
  <para style="q1">asawkunaw langkhe ccaring ae vua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">michi rhua te thuasah, thaloi te</para>
  <para style="q1">thuingpaw michi khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Hunghua lungkhu e lung vawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccahpaw michi khate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha bong na thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccu te sydepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">michi rhua hawte nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ming hae ryte uukheih na thua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize na ram kha na roh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na chia vae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Hoyleinaw a rae hae paw ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="q2">mih min tuh papinmaw um nan vae sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mih minpaaw hae seinaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan ccapaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">chianaw kha paccyn oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh laephi uk khylan te</para>
  <para style="q2">laephipi kya khuapi raeku khylan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">papinmaw thokuh nan vae hae sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, minmin kha ka thonuakuh cih hae zah, Babilon min te a laehy hae paw kha thuasah, ciihan te ccaawno hae kha thuasah ka roh cih hae cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="23" style="v" />Babilon kha sazi umnaw, tui a ynku nawlan ka rae cih, ronaw innphi te ka phi cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Assiria Konglang Hotypaw Bya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh byakinkute a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Khua ka khan thyhte acyihkuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka paccyn thyhte cyi athua cih:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:5-34">Isa 10.5-34</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:1-3:19">Nah 1.1—3.19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:13-15">Zef 2.13-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka ram kyakhe Assiria hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka theih cih hae zah, ka mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">ccu te ka syde cih hae; Assiria hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">puihnawpaw ccong tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae kyate vua athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Assiria kya-e phupaw aripaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae raw kyate khah athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />E hynh laephi pynpi te asekuh lante</para>
  <para style="q2">a paccynpaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">e hynh minphuin balyn tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a dyngpaw a kuih nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a paccyn vae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a roh kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">A dyngpaw a kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a khingsah kho cih?</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Filistin Konglang Hotynaw</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahaz Siapharan a chi kum khe e bya hynh a hoty:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:20">2Si 16.20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:27">2Sh 28.27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pou Filistin hae balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning buanawpaw ccungngue</para>
  <para style="q1">akhya keiccuze nae lungtua nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khah-e hupaw phin kyate huparepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">yn langkuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e huparepaw a taw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">azouthyapaw hupaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">maeesoi tahawpaw athua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.29-31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eze 25.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Zef 2.4-7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:5-7">Zek 9.5-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ryachi hae lakuze</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryachihua hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a ae cih hae, ahobou hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khyndadyh lan a ih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama na ciihan hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccakannaw te ka chisah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na kya-e a laehy hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka theih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pou koikua, rawtua;</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou khuapi, rawte siaruatua;</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Filistin, nae balynte rawrite um oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize thahlang te</para>
  <para style="q2">maeekhuh yn pou zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e aphu kyatuin a rawthahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Filistin ram kyate oun thua hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">locceihtu hae kha pawtemou</para>
  <para style="q1">byakhung lan hae?</para>
  <para style="q2">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Zion khua kha a rae vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryachi hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e khua kya khynnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a muihkuh cih hae,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite byakhung lan hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Moab Konglang Hotypaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Moab konglang hotypaw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Ar khua tuh zi kheit lungkhu aro keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">Moab ram tuh aroh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Kir khua tuh zi kheit lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">aro keiccuze Moab ram tuh aroh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.1—16.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:10-12">Isa 25.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jer 48.1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Eze 25.8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Zef 2.8-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dibon khuaccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hminthyaa kya raw khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">ahangnaw hmin lang a kae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Moab hae tuh Nebo khua te</para>
  <para style="q1">Medeba khua khe a rah hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih lu kha okuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih khawming kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe thyaa lan a ngoku hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />laanpi khe buriboei kha zingkute,</para>
  <para style="q2">innccukaly kya te laanluepi kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw miakaw rah hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih mitphi alua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heshbon khua te Elealeh khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rah hae zah, mih rawnaw roi tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Jahaz khua cia accae;</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze Moab rhawkaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rawthyate a thyngkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moab hanlan ka thinlung myarya ccih;</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae tuh Zoar khua te</para>
  <para style="q1">Eglath-shelishiyah khua lang a ccue hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Luhith kaethung khe</para>
  <para style="q1">raw biate a kae hae; Horonaim lang</para>
  <para style="q2">cceihpaw laanpi khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw roi a saw hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimrim vaw tuh kan zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua tuh arou,</para>
  <para style="q1">apo thawpaw lonua mah a chih,</para>
  <para style="q2">hinlalyhpaw aku kukheit sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoi hae paw uccaw patae te</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccakhungku hae paw uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Su ku Accya langkhe a ccyngku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize Moab ram pepan kya</para>
  <para style="q2">rawnaw roi accae;</para>
  <para style="q1">rawkhuinaw roi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Eglaim khua te Beerelim khua cia accae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize Dibon khua e</para>
  <para style="q2">tui tuh chiise te phe abeih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah Dibon khua langkhe</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e laeze aru huapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">vawsawnaw kha ka thuasah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lue khylan a ccue hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">Moab hae hanlan te</para>
  <para style="q1">tuin ram kya a laehy hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih kha ka thuasah ung cih.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ram uktu kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">tuutaw hae kha ky oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">laesia ram a umpaw Sela khua kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion ccanung mua langkhe mah ky oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A bu kyate zousahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pavaw taw hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab ccanung hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Arnon vaw zuanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vaw kin khe a um hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tuanaw yn pyatua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahmete bya yn pia oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ninthu khuaninso kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi hawte nae mynlyh kha</para>
  <para style="q1">yn raepah oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">a dee hae paw ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thuruh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccue hae paw kha langsakuh nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Moab ram kyate a dee hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae kya umsah bua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">rohtu hae kyate minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thungkhaw oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Tuaasahtu um vae leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw tuh dae vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kyate syrotu hae he adae tetuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David bu kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">atynpaw sungsakunaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">bawitungkhung kha tynsah athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahmepaw kha arangte cyih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">byading a ccungpaw uktupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">lungzinaw te phe beih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e bawitungkhung</para>
  <para style="q2">vawlan khe a haung cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moab nynh a lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe kae thae vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh myaryamaw a lysakuh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Lysakunaw, tansakunaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">rysawthyanaw hoi zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw pookunaw bya kha a ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Moab hae tuh rah hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">milu takyhte Moab ram hanlan rah hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Vawsaw a tung raria hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite um oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Kir-hareseth khua kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">misu thae aroupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">liathuite rah oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Heshbon khua e loo hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">Sibmah khua e</para>
  <para style="q1">misu ku hae tuh a nyaabung vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaekheih lyaze tuh-e misu ange hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin uktu bawi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a la ruisah hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh lyaze tuh-e ange hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Jazer khua cia phe la phah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw lang cia phe la thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">misu ku atoih thawpaw hae tuh po lo zah</para>
  <para style="q2">rili khuraw lang phe la thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jazer khua hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka raw hawte Sibmah khua e</para>
  <para style="q2">misu ku hae hanlan ka rah;</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Heshbon khua te Elealeh khua,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kha ka mitphi te</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ciasah cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize na thingthae rue lya te</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccathae rue lya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtua siaruanaw tuh zya adae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thingthae athaenaw loo kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw te lungpawnaw kha phe zo vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">misu khokhu kya hlawsah vae khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtua siaruanaw mah um vae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">misu thae nonnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">athae a nontu mah non vae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">misu thae lo ccyh lya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">siaruanaw mah zya dae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka bung tuh Moab hanlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka vue ka ring tuh Kir-heres hanlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">tintang hawte accae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moab nynh ahangnaw hmin kya amaw toulou kha a thawbangsakuh zah, a beikinnthyaa kalan sawsang lan a ccia zemah a laan a sui ua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />E bya hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moab konglang a la hopaw bya nynh thua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te atu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Vaeluatu riapyanawpaw kum thyhte, kum thum lungkhu Moab phu-enaw tuh a ccungccaw hae patae ryte theihrya athua cih; a hiinhypaw myarya azya cih zah mih thawzya cih,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Damaskas Konglang Hotypaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Damaskas konglang Pachia nynh a hotypaw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Dotua, Damaskas khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi thua vae lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">arohpaw apumkuhpaw lang a tang cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.1-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Jer 49.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1">Zek 9.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siria ram e khua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae hanlan ccuetawsya athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuu te vaetua a paeenaw hmin lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung nynh mah dee leite a rya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Efraim tuh thungkhawtu</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawlungrua hoi vae lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Damaskas tuh ukkunaw kaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hoi vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a laehypaw Siria hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae phu-enaw</para>
  <para style="q1">anaanpaw hawte athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Jakob phu-enaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">azyabung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tho leite a ngethah vae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te tuh-e tuh loohruetu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thadynpaw ccathae hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">suelua hae zah mih kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">a rue hae hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Refaim Accya kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccamua rue hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Oliv ku kha hy vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">aku dungpaccy umpaw ange kya</para>
  <para style="q1">athae ccangning ccangthum laehy zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athae alungnaw akaran kyaze</para>
  <para style="q1">athae ccangpali ccangpangaw a laehy hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccamua a laehy cih, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuin nin khe ccungccaw hae nynh minmin a Raetupaw kha a peki cih hae zah, mih mit nynh Israel Pachia Athyaapaw kha a do cih; <verse number="8" style="v" />mih kuih te a raeku hae paw silawhang kha pawlangria vae lan khyh hae, mih kuihdung te a raeku hae paw Asherah zohtuh te amynkhuhpaw silawhang kha pawlangria vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh sihkakinpaw mih khuapi hae tuh Israel hae keiccuze Hiv hae te Amor hae nynh a ccuetaw hae paw hmin hae hawte athua cih hae zah, ccungccaw phe adae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize nang ae khumtu</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia kha na ning zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na khynnaw Lungpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe na ning vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze ramccang pachia kha</para>
  <para style="q2">beik khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">aku hoypaw kha na linku,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na lin nin khe na lethungsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na lin awkhua khe</para>
  <para style="q1">apaw na pawsah zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">rue ccyh kya athae tuh phe azo cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethya ccyh te dan kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccinaw rou kha nynh a um cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rili roi accae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw patae nynh a siarua hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">Tui alepaw nynh accae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae nynh a siarua hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuileih alepaw roi accae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae nynh a siarua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama Pachia nynh pe hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaring a ccue hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mua vawlan khisan nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a mungpaw vaekang hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khiccung nynh a zoukhaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha dee athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zete ccyh kya rikawte um hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">awkhualan awkhua athua maw</para>
  <para style="q2">phe zo vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">E hynh aening vawsaw oun pya hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw oun luade hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a tung hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ethiopia Konglang Hotypaw Bya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ethiopia ram e vaw hae khuraw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a umpaw ram kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">sake abiakuhpaw roi accae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.1-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:12">Zef 2.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e ram kyate locceihtu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phaeku te araekuhpaw kohlung khate</para>
  <para style="q2">Nal vawpi kyate a saw hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou athyrangpaw locceihtu hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a pyn hang zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a ngesaw ahoypaw minphuin,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi pynpi nynh a ripyapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawsaepaw te a taepaw minphuin,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaw hae nynh a phia hae paw ram kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a umpaw minphuin kalan khe cceih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Laephi vawlan a um hae paw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">mua vawlan syntawnaw alan</para>
  <para style="q1">he a sae vae hae ze, do oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Mungkae he a tu vae hae ze, ngae oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn hopyapaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaninpaw kya ccaerarih lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a aw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">loohrue lya aso ccyh kya dantui te</para>
  <para style="q2">phe beihpaw maeking hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka umnaw kyate zya ka do cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Misu thae lo azaw maw,</para>
  <para style="q2">apaw tuh khuakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">athae he avoi cciamang lyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">atoih thawpaw kha rungkou te</para>
  <para style="q1">a awpah cih zah phiariphiarae umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran hae kha a baepah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin tuh mua vawlan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">saw a aepaw pavaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi vaw e sarangpaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">cciataw athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Te saw a aepaw pavaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnin ccyh vae ze</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tungvaw a um cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vaw e sarangpaw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaccih ccyh vae ze minmin tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuin ccyh vae tuh, a pyn hang zah a ngesaw ahoypaw, laephi pynpi nynh a ripyapaw, a thawsaepaw te a taepaw, vaw hae nynh a phia hae paw ram kya a umpaw minphuin nynh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min a umnaw Zion Mua langkhe vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan lasung hae kha oun ccyng cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip Konglang Hotypaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Izip konglang Pachia nynh a hotypaw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Dotua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">arangpaw maeking ccikute</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip ram lang yn thua vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip ram e zohtuh hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw malang a thyngkuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip hae tuh mih rawthah vae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.1-25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 46:2-26">Jer 46.2-26</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:1-32:32">Eze 29.1—32.32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izip hae kha mimaw te mimaw</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawku lan ka tuhou cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit te lu kheit a doukuh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">innpaw te innpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">khua kheit te khua kheit,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram kheit te ram kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">a doukuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izip hae thinlung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka zosah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih khuakhannaw kha ka roh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh zohtuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">michi hae muisaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">naawthya hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">muisaw hae kha tuanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngiakuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izip hae kha a puathopaw bawi kuih kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ap cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a rysawthahpaw siapharan nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a uk cih hae cite</para>
  <para style="q1">Alesaepaw, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nal vawkhu e tui tuh akan cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">arou cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vawpi kyate tuizypi a zy hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip kya-e Nal vawpi kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a phiakuh hae paw vaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">adih cih hae zah arou cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">phaeku hae te thabu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">anaan cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nal vaw kin tuh aku a um leinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hmin lang a tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Nal vawkhu pe ccoupaw aku balyn tuh arou cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">khisan nynh a mung cih zah azo cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngasaw kyngte vue a kuakuh hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyate a rah a khui cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Nal vaw kya ngasaw bawtu balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ngaethah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tui vawlan paih a rawtu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungthawthang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Buri law te boeikuathya hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungthang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thanenaw azyabung vae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Boeikuathya hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungroh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaeluapaw balyn tuh mih ngaethah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zoan khua e cciakhaetu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mingaee hae nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Faro siapharan kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">tuanaw pyatu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaeepaw tuanaw kha a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">“Kae tuh a hawpaw lu kheit,</para>
  <para style="q1">te langmawlya e siapharan ciihan nynh ka thua,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite pawtemou Faro kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na hopya ngan oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na mihaw hae tuh atu teimou a um hae?</para>
  <para style="q2">Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Izip kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rawsete pawtemou a paccyn cipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh ae hopah hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ae nysah hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zoan khua e cciakhaetu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaee vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Memfis khua e cciakhaetu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mihyn hae nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip cciakhaetu hae nynh Izip kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhaesei vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh cciakhaetu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thinlung a muasah vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">aruipaw nynh amaw a lua toulou kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a thei hawte, minmin nynh Izip kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a cyipaw miakaw kya a cyiseisah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izip a lu nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a leihmae nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ungcci ku akaran nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">phaeku nynh thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip hanlan pawpaw mah cyih kho lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Izip hae tuh nopi hawte athua cih hae zah, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin tungvaw a hangnua hae paw a kuih malang khe rawrite a thyngkuh cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Izip hae hanlan a paccynpaw keiccuze Judah ram tuh Izip hae hanlan ri lan umpaw lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Izip, Assiria te Israel Hythua Ccounaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Izip ram e khuapi khuapangaw nynh Kanaan bya a ho cih hae zah, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te thyalawkute bya a kinkuh cih hae. Tuh-e khuapi kya-e khua kheit tuh Khuanin Khuapi cite a ko cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Izip ram angaelung kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang ccangkheit a um cih; Izip ramri khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan lungbing a um cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Izip ram kya vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan muihsahnaw te ccaekia athua cih; tuaasahtu hae keiccuze minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan he a sia hae ze, aning nynh khumtu a sawpah cih hae, te tuh-e khumtu nynh a thungkhaw cih hae zah a khum cih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha Izip hae kya a nysakuh cih hae; tuin nin khe Izip hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a nyh cih hae zah, silawnawpaw te maee-ute silawnaw khate a beik cih hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan byakinnaw a rae cih hae zah, bya a kinku hae thyhte a cyih cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Izip kha de a tah cih, thuasalama bua a dansah cih; minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a maeleihkuh cih hae zah, a ngia hae paw kha a thaepah cih hae zah a dansah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuin ccyh khe Izip ram te Assiria lang laanpi a um cih, te Assiria hae nynh Izip ram lang a cceih cih hae zah, Izip hae nynh Assiria ram lang a cceih cih hae, te Izip hae tuh Assiria hae ryte a beikkheih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuin ccyh khe Izip te Assiria ryte Israel tuh ram thumnaw athua cih zah, laephi pynpi hanlan hythuanaw athua cih, <verse number="25" style="v" />vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha hythuapya hae zah, “Ka ccungccaw Izip, ka raepaw Assiria te ka rho Israel tungvaw hythuanaw um sah,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sasete Umpaw Profeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Assiria siapharan Sargon nynh a sawpaw rhawbawi ale huapaw nynh Ashdod khua kha tuk zah a law kum— <verse number="2" style="v" />tuh ccyh lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Amoz ccapaw Isaiah kyakhe, “La cceih, na tae kya-e buriboei te na phanah kha khahkuh,” a cipya thyhte aning nynh khahkuh zah, a sasete phanah leite a cceih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ka ryalahtu Isaiah nynh Izip ram te Ethiopia ram kya yn cyihkuh cih paw muihsahnaw kha langsah khylan, kum thum lungkhu a sasete phanah leite a cceih, <verse number="4" style="v" />Izip hae kha maethyalaw khylan, Assiria siapharan nynh Izip hae te Ethiopia hae kha adih ale laesah leite sasete, phanah leite, leihkung san bongku leite a cciakhae cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ashdod khuaccaaw hae tuh a ngaehoiku hae paw Ethiopia ram te a pookunaw hae paw Izip ram keiccuze siikute mih lungmuakhaekuh cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin nin khe rili kin kya um hae paw nynh, ‘Dotua, Assiria siapharan kyate lue khylan ah ngaehoiku oh paw te bawmnaw mue khylan ah ccuenua oh paw kya hynhte rei phe cyiku vae! Pawtemou ah lue kho vae cih oh?’ cite a hokuh cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon, Adom te Arabia Konglang Hotypaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rili nynh avupaw ramkaw konglang Pachia nynh a hotypaw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Negeb kya akhiapaw khiccung hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan umpaw ram, ramkaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">shethya yn thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ri lan umpaw vizin kha ka muih;</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungzi leipaw nynh a lungzi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">te a rohtupaw nynh a ro.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Elam hae, cciathung tua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Media hae, khuapi kha koihlu oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon nynh a thuakhaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">teingnaw balyn kha ka thangsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka tae myarya ccih;</para>
  <para style="q2">neitangia a ccihpaw nopi hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">teingnaw nynh yn thuanua vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nawthae lei lan ciate ka teing,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngawmuih lei lan ciate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lungmuakhaekuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thinlung azo, ri lan umpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn siisaku; ka ngaepaw zete ccyh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hanlan thyngkunaw lang nynh a tang vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh loohdangkunaw poi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a paccyn hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">haung nawlan boei kha a phae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a neih hae, a ae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou rhawbawi hae, thokuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khawriaphua kha chitui thuhtua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize Bawipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn hopah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“La cceih lah, rhawviatu lu kheit la nung,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh a muihpaw kha ho sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abuabuate oun thua hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">marang ccikuh hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">lann ccikuh hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">kalauh ccikuh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">he a muih ze, aning nynh hoyte,</para>
  <para style="q2">pekite nawngae sah,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te rhawviatu nynh, “Pou Bawipaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawviainn kya khuadae ccyh kya</para>
  <para style="q2">po ka thadyn, zidae rhaw po ka via.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Marang ccikuh hae paw tuh abuabuate</para>
  <para style="q2">khuing kya oun thua hae!” cite a sia.</para>
  <para style="q1">Te tuh-e paw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Babilon a khuliakuh vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a pachia hae, a zohtuh hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kya kaheikalah a koi vae hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:8">Bya 14.8</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:2">18.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccatan tin hawte tin athua hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou ka ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thaepaw kha nae kalan kae thaesah oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dumah konglang Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hotypaw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Lukheitpaw nynh Seir mua kyate yn ko zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pou rhawviatu, khuazi ccyh hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">pawtemou athua cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou rhawviatu, khuazi ccyh hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawtemou athua cih?” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rhawviatu nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Awkhua ccyh yn thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zete ccyh mah yn thua. Nae khia ry ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn cceih lah bua yn khia,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arabia konglang Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hotypaw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Pou khuaccong hae paw Dedan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Arabia ramkaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi na rya cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou Tema ram kya um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuihaw hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">tui ccyngpah oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccue hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sanlou te cciadue oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi rhaw kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">poh thuaakuhpaw thaloi kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akoikuhpaw li kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuk keiccu lungriathaenaw kyate thuasah a ccue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Bawipaw nynh yn hopyapaw tuh: vaeluatu riapyanawpaw kum thyhte, kum kheit lungkhu khe Kedar minphuin a phu-enaw balyn tuh azo cih; <verse number="17" style="v" />a laehypaw Kedar rhawkaw thekawthya hae paw tuh azya vae cih hae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh a ho vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Ronaw Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vizin accya konglang hotypaw bya:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">Nae balynte innccukaly lang</para>
  <para style="q1">na kae oh paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">paw rynaw mou athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapi tuh siaruanaw te phe abeih,</para>
  <para style="q2">nawpankeilae umpaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q1">a lungtuapaw khuapi nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Achihpaw na ccungccaw hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi keiccu chih khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuknaw kya mah</para>
  <para style="q2">chih khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kya-e uktu hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan a ccue vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih li kaw mang leite phe kyng hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Asawnaw lang a ccue vae hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">muih athuapaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kyng athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka kyate ccanglang hawitua,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka sungsahpaw ka ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ro keiccu hae ze</para>
  <para style="q1">thawmawte ka rah cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae hynh soihbia lan zuakuh nan.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaw vaaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vizin accya kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">siaruanaw, sydenaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">lungmuanaw ccyh kha a thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khualungrua hae kha tingsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">bawmnaw mue khylan siaruanaw roi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae kya accae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elam hae tuh the te</para>
  <para style="q2">li bawng ccyngkuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">marangle hae te marang rhawkaw hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih hae, Kir hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">khawriaphua kha a thuaaku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kya-e ahoy huaccepaw accya hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">marangle te phe beih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">marang rhawkaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">koikua malang a thadyn hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah rhawlungrua tuh pong ating.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">Tuin nin khe zunghe na ccakhungnaw Ramkaw e Inn kha na do zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />David khuapi kya aronahpaw patae kha na muih, te akawlan e tuikua kyate apoupaw tui kha na suelua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem e inn hae kha na ria zah, khualungrua koih nawlan inn hae kha na phou hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui tungnawpaw tuikua arynpaw kyate apoupaw tui kha tung nawlan tuikuapi kha khualungrua ccangning laku khe na rae. Thuasalama e uccaw a raetu kha na tuabia khyh, langmawlya te hynh-e uccaw a la paccyntupaw kha pawlang na ria khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Bawipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">rawkhuite hawkhaeku lan,</para>
  <para style="q2">lu-oku lan te buriboei</para>
  <para style="q2">zingku lan ae ko oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />thuasalama lungtua lungpawnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">poi tuakute, vaetua te tuu chiate</para>
  <para style="q2">saw na ae oh zah misutui na nia oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ae oh sih lah, neih oh sih,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize awkhualan</para>
  <para style="q2">ah chih cih oh,” na ciku oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1Ko 15.32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nakaring kya yn hopyapaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Thanccingte e nae hoyleinaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na chi makhia oh</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethya thua lan khyh, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shebna kha Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawipaw vaaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Synriatu athuapaw, siapharan inn uktu Shebna kalan cceih lah: <verse number="16" style="v" />E kya pawmou na se? Ahangnaw hmin kya shawku raekute, lungpi kya umnaw na karynkuh zah, shawku raeku lan ciate hein kya na puizia a um tou? <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha asawnaw lang ae vua vae cih, ka ban. Nang kha phang ae kyng cih zah, <verse number="18" style="v" />miabung miathung ae mia cih, te ram akonaw langkhe bawlung hawte ae vua cih; tuin kyakhe na chih cih, myarya lypaw na marangle hae tuh tuin kya a um cih hae, na bawipaw inn kha the na thyasah! <verse number="19" style="v" />Na ryalaw kae phoh cih zah, na ryalawnaw hmin kyate kae ccawsah bung cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Hilkiah ccapaw ka ryalahtu Eliakim kha ka ko cih, <verse number="21" style="v" />te na angkiccua kha ka kisakuh cih zah, na taeccia kha ka cciasakuh cih. Na kya-e kawhoinaw kha ka pya cih zah, aning tuh Jerusalem um hae paw te Judah phin hae hanlan paaw athua cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />David ciihan kya-e toh kha a raw vawlan ka khang cih; aning nynh a hung cih zah, hum nynh sanmah khaw lan khyh; aning nynh a khaw cih zah, hum nynh sanmah hung lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:7">Bya 3.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning kha akhynnaw hmin khe pang reihnawpaw ccong hawte ka tynsah cih zah, a minpaaw hae ciihan kyaze sawtua lan umpaw bawitungkhung lang a tang cih. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te a minpaaw inn kya-e phu-enaw aphuinphuin, ciihan te ccaawno, adihpaw angphe miakaw, banang hae te ccekoh hae balyn kyacia a tungvaw khe a baw cih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin nin khe vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Akhynnaw kya tynkaring lan a umpaw uccaw bawnawpaw ccong tuh a nuekuh cih; bae athua cih zah a ccah cih, a tungvaw bawkuhpaw uccaw miakaw tuh aroh cih, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tair Konglang Hotypaw Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tair konglang Pachia nynh a hotypaw bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Tarsih ccingbaw hae, rawkhuite um oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize khua tuh innloo</para>
  <para style="q1">a um lei lan ciate aroh vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Nae ccingbaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Saipras langte he oun tee hae te,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e kong tuh a thae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.1-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:19">Eze 26.1—28.19</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:1-4">Zek 9.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10.13-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou rili kin kya um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Sidon khua e kungku hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">hawkhaeku tua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">rili vawlan kungku hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Sidon khua kha a hoirumsah hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuh-e khua nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a muepaw ngunto tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Nal vawpi kya-e rue athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Sihor ccathae kha thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e khua tuh ram takyh kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">kungkunaw hae hmin nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pou Sidon, na maethah sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize rili athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">rili khuapi nynh a ho hae paw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ccaaw ka poi boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaaw mah ka saah boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">liaccaw te ccangvae mah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kua boi khyh hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Izip hae nynh Tair khua kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">he a thae hae tuh, mih thinphang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tarsih khua langkhe cceih oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou rili kin um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuite um oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Langmawlya te a la um vae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungtuanaw khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">e hynh tou athua?</para>
  <para style="q2">Asawnaw lang khuasah khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccu nynh a cciakhaenaw khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh tou athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tair khua tuh bawilukhung</para>
  <para style="q2">a pyatupaw khua nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">khua kya-e kungku hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">bawi hae thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw a zua bungthungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuaccaaw hae tuh laephi nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">saw a tua hae paw nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e Tair khua kha rawse lan ciate,</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a paccyn?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">khah-e kha a paccyn—</para>
  <para style="q1">a lysakunawpaw a phu-enaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thethyasah khylan te</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi nynh saw a tua hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyalaw khylan a paccyn.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pou Tarsih khua e ccingbaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae umnaw um vae khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ram langkhe cceih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rili vawlan dyng zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">peenaw hae kha a thyngsaku hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Kanaan te</para>
  <para style="q1">asekuh lante Kanaan khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ro lan kaw a pya vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou tuaasahkunaw a teingpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Sidon ccanung liaccady,</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungtua vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">thoku tua, Saipras langkhe cciatua,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya mah na lungdae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Babilon ram hynh dotua oh! E hae tuh Assiria hae thua leite Babilon hae nynh thua hae. Tair khua kha loramsaw hae hanlan a tangsah, rhawvianawpaw innhangpaw hae kha sak zah, Tair khua e siapharan inn hae kha a ro hae, khua kha khua rohpaw lang a tangsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou Tarsih ccingbaw hae, rawkhuite um oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize nae khua tuh phe roh vae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin nin kyate Tair khua kha siapharan she shekheit athuapaw kum sung sari lungkhu ning athua cih. Kum sung sari aro te, ohhuanung kong hlaw kya a um hawte, Tair khua kya acyihkuh cih:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ning vae hae paw ohhuanung, nang,</para>
  <para style="q2">Tintang kha ccyngkuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi lungkhu khiavuikuh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang kha ae liathui ccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">roi hoypaw saw lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hlaw patae sahtua.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sung sari he aro te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Tair khua kha a paebua cih, te Tair nynh a ryalaw rynpaw kalan a kithui cih zah, laephi vaw ram takyh kya ohhuakunaw kha a rae cih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Kungkunaw kyate a muepaw phua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pya athua cih; a phua kha ccakhung lan khyh zah tungkuh lan khyh, thuasalama kung a kunaw kya-e a phua tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a um hae paw hanlan looh patae te boeining hoypaw repya nawlan a mang cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Laephi vawlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a roh mamia cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">daetedae lan a nung cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">a mia bungthung cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha phiariphiarae</para>
  <para style="q2">a nung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tetuh ranpibawi tuh zapi hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">a bawipaw tuh a seepaw hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">a bawinung tuh a seenung hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">a zuatu tuh a retu hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">a hohsakuhtu tuh a hohtu hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">laebah a umsahtu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laebah a umtu hawte athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Laephi tuh khaleih aroh cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">khaleih akoi cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize e bya hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe a ho vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Laephi tuh karae arou,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephipi tuh a thawzya zah arou;</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw te lae tuh aroh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Laephi tuh ccungccaw hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kawbya kha a ei hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">phungbya kha zui khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw a byakinnaw kha a ro hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze thyalawnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha po laang zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih cyiseinaw keiccuze a teing hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze laephi vawlan a um hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">houhouh zyabung hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw beihtaraw kyalya alae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misutui tuh rou zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">misu ku tuh a thawzya,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungtuanaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyate a hawkhaekuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tyng taraw hae roi tuh adae vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungpawnaw roi mah adae vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">tang-oi roi mah adae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hlawsah biate misutui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">neih vae khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ruithyapaw atui a neihthya hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e atui tuh akhah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keisukeilae umpaw khuapi tuh aroh vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh sanmah</para>
  <para style="q1">a tee kho khyh ccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q2">inn miakaw kha a khaw hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Misutui a um khyh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi kya a sia a rua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtuanaw balyn tuh azo vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi lungpawnaw tuh azo vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuapi tuh daetedae vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">koikua hae kha phe roh lan a bua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laephi vawlan minphuin hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhcite acyihkuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">oliv ku kha hybia koute aku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a laehypaw athae hawte athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">misu thae lo koute aku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a laehypaw athae hawte athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e a laehy hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih roi a saw cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtuanaw hlaw a sah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Niccaw langte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> lesaenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a siakhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nithua langkhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-enaw a pya cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">rili kin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia kha a thehoysah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adingpaw Pachia hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-e thehoysahnaw hlaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a sahpya hae paw kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi adianaw kyate kae thae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaehoinaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaehoinaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Myaryamaw ka ngaethah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize mih lungzi lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ming hae tungvaw mih lungzi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungzi lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ming hae tungvaw papinmaw</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungzi khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou laephi ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning tuh ri lan umpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">hunghua te kaang kya nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na um vae oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ri lan umpaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccuepaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hunghua lungkhu lang a ccah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">hunghua lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q1">a poupaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kaang a kae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize vaawlui thanlan-aw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hung thua zah, laephi ccusy tuh ahy.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laephi tuh pong koi zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh zoihtatae lan akoi,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh thawmawte ahy.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Laephi tuh samaw ruipaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">vyavya khuliakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">bu taraw hawte hebung hethung a hekuh;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh a seinaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">rikalae lan phang ne zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh, bua thokuh vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vaaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawram khe de a tah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi siapharan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan khe de a tah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin tuh thongccah hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">hunghua lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q1">pynkheihlan suelua athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha thong lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q1">khawsung athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kum patae aro koute</para>
  <para style="q2">detahnaw a ing cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tetuh sawpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a maesue aroh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuanin tuh a maethah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Zion Mua vawlan te</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem khua kyakhe a uk cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a phu-enaw tuh a piccan hae</para>
  <para style="q2">malang khe a langsakuh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thehoysahnaw Hlaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Pachia nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha kae hangthung cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">na min kha kae thehoysah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ngaeang lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw hae kha na rae vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya te na la paccynpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lungzite na ccingsah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuapi kha aronahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">athupaw apumkuhpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">na tangsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khualungrua akoihkuhpaw khuapi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">arohpaw lang na tangsah;</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang hae kya-e siapharan inn</para>
  <para style="q2">a umnaw khuapi tuh phe zo vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">raethui ci um vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze athawsaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae thehoysah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a rysawthahpaw minphuin hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi hae nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae rih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawccecize nang tuh ryachi hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khynnaw na thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">anyaa hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih vawsaw lya khynnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">khise kyate luenawpaw rekunaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">khuaninso kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">luenawpaw mynlyh nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Rysawthah hae paw thinrianaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaccihsaw lya-e khise hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">atho vae ze thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ramccang hae siaruanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ram rounaw kya khuaninso hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">athua vae ze thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking mynlyh khate</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaninso kha na tae;</para>
  <para style="q2">rysawthah hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">hlawsah hae paw roi kha na daesah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e mua vawlan hin</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw balyn hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">loohdangkunaw poi te</para>
  <para style="q2">misutui poi kha a rae cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e poi tuh looh athua huapaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">misutui athua huapaw khate a rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">bong athuapaw boei kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin balyn tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">adawkhawkuhpaw kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh e mua vawlan hin a roh cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh chinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae po a laang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw balyn mae kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">mitphi kha a hupah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae thethyanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi pynpi kyate a lah cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:54">1Ko 15.54</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">Bya 7.17</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:4">21.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin nin khe hynhte a ho cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning tuh kae Pachia nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening oun khum ccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha kae ngaehoi.</para>
  <para style="q1">Aning tuh kae ngaehoipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">a khumnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtua lungpawte um oh sih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">e mua vawlan hin a um cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Ccatanphue kha vaetua ia te</para>
  <para style="q2">tuiccua kya syde athua hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab hae kha mih umnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">syde athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.10-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 15:1-16:14">Isa 15.1—16.14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 48:1-47">Jer 48.1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:8-11">Eze 25.8-11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:1-3">Amo 2.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:8-11">Zef 2.8-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui a zeihkuhpaw nynh a kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">dyng zah a zeihku hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">Moab hae nynh mih ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuih a dyng hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lysakunaw te mih zuakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nyaasah bung athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Moab a rhawlungrua myarya</para>
  <para style="q2">hangpaw kha a tingsah bung cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">laekhu kyacia a nesah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping kya a khuliakuh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah kya-e Taenaw Hlaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Judah ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">e hlaw hynh a sah cih hae:</para>
  <para style="q1">Atynpaw khuapi kae hoi;</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawlungrua te koihkhawpaw hawkhate</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh oun taepya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungzi zah adingpaw minphuin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a tee ccaw koikua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hungtua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atynpaw thinlung a hoi hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae doliaku hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw na pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha zungzae doliakuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> PACHIA tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw na lungpi nynh thua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahangnaw kya a um hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a nyaasah bung hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">alypaw khuapi kha a nyaasah bung,</para>
  <para style="q2">laekhu kyacia nesah bung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping kyakhe a vua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khah-e khuapi kha ccu te a syde hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ryachi hae te ahobou hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a syde hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Miding laanpi tuh ngingrarih lan acih;</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou adingpaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">miding hae laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">naebabing lan na raepya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">na laanpi kha kae zui zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae ngaehoiku;</para>
  <para style="q1">na min te na minthaannaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinlung nynh a ry.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khuazi ccyh kya ka thinlung nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ae ngae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka lungkhu e ka thinlung nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha thawmawte ae ccung.</para>
  <para style="q1">Laephi kha bya na pia vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephipi kya a um hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw kha a ccangku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maehoynaw na pya zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">dingnaw kha ccangkuh khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw ram khe hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> lesaenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlangria khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na kuih</para>
  <para style="q2">na hangthung zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh muih khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Na ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">na lungthawsaenaw kha muih hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih maethah sah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Maee nynh na rhaw hae kha u hae sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:27">Heb 10.27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kaening hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw nae pya cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize accaccingte,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae la cyi kho vae paw balyn hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">nae cyipyapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw holeite ccangpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">bawipaw hae nynh oun la uk vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama nang na min rou kha nynh kae ny.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e bawipaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">chih vae hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">hiinthui vae lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih muisaw tuh thoothui lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">de na tah hae zah na ro vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">te minmin liathuinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lanpaw balyn kha na ro vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae minphuin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae pungzaesah vae, kae minphuin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nae pungzaesah vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-esah na thua vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae ram kha po lekuh lan na kosah vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsaw a tung vae hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha ae ccung hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na thuihei vae hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan saw a sang hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccaaw a poipaw nopi nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a sawkyh zah a pui dyn vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">neitangia teing zah a sia hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang na keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhawte nynh kae teing,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kaening tuh neitangia kae teing zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw rou kha nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaaw lang kae saah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Laephi vawlan kae taepaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephipi kya khuasah khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw lu kheit sanmah kae saah khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na michi hae tuh a hiinthui cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rhua tuh a thoothui cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou laenoi kya um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae inaw kyate thaekuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtuate hlawsah oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Na dangtui nynh laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hinlalyh lan a hinsah thui hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi nynh a chih vae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a hiinsah thui cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae, rang oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae innkhaan lungkhu lang tee oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuakaw khawsungkuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">thinrianaw ccyh athang mawlaezung</para>
  <para style="q2">sosoh rekuh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pawccecize laephi ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hoyleinaw keiccuze detah khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a umnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">yn toikuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tetuh laephi nynh a vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">aluapaw chiise kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a langsakuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan a chia hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thuruh vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel kha Sawkhawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh arysawthahpaw, alesaepaw te athungpaw a thaloi khate a ccuepaw Leviathan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leviathan hupi cipaw tuh phungpaw kya a umpaw hupaw min thua zah, asuilan tuh Israel a tuaa a sah hae paw ccungccaw hae ram cipaw nynh thua. </char></note> hupi, a kuekuhpaw Leviathan hupi kha de a tah cih zah, rili lungkhu umpaw nakaa-hupi kha a theih cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:1">Job 41.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Sam 74.14</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 104:26">104.26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin nin khe lungpaw lan a umnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">misu khokhu kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hynhte hlawsah oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">misu khokhu a ngawtu nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">khokhu kha atu te atu tui ka bu.</para>
  <para style="q2">Humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q1">a ro kho khyh nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi khuadae phang ka rin.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thinria vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Khah-e khokhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">hinpaw phin a um hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">ro lan ka ccianua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te ka u cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhkhyhze thungkhawnaw mue khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kalan beekuh hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw te ccawkunaw rae hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw te ccawkunaw rae hae sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Jakob nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a tharui a saw cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel tuh apaw paw cih zah a thae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">te laephi pynpi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">athae te phe a biasah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a zia a buapaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a zia a bua hae hawte athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel a theihtupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">chia athua hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel kha chia athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang lang deenaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">de a tah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Nithua lang e khise khate</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha a mungsah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lung rawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ditaraw lan koi athua hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">silawhang kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">lung balyn kha koi zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw tungpi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mynkhuh unawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">silawhang kha he a khulia hae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob a cyiseinaw kha a ngaethya cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh a seinaw thyaasah</para>
  <para style="q2">athuanawpaw athae nynh thua:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khualungrua te koihlukuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi tuh daetedae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw hawte cciataw te</para>
  <para style="q2">vuasyapaw ahmin lang nynh a tang vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuin kyakhe vaetuataw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a paeekuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuin kya rya hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">atoih thawpaw kha a bouku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Akaran hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">he arou hae te a khya hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hae nynh thuanua hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">maeething lang a mang hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hawnaw a hoi leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze minmin a raetupaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha ngaethyaumsah</para>
  <para style="q1">lan khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thawccih lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou Israel ccungccaw hae, tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Zufrates vawpi kyate Izip ramri cia ccahyn te ccangphaw phia hawte ae phia cih oh zah, nanning tuh lu kheit koute lu kheit suelua na thua cih oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh, mungkae pipi kha tuu athua cih, te Assiria ram kya a zo hae paw te Izip ram lang dee athua hae paw tuh oun thua cih hae zah, Jerusalem khua athyaapaw mua vawlan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thahlang Peenaw kha Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Misutui a rui hae paw, looh patae te</para>
  <para style="q2">a thokhaekuh hae paw mih lu kya a umpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">Efraim phin aruithya hae paw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakunawpaw haetapawsi te</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kya-e aphu-e zah apuithyapaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">anaanthyapaw haetapaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dotua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh athawsaepaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">athungpaw ccungccaw kha a hoi;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hya a ccawbiapaw khise,</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw arosah thyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khise hawte athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">athawsaepaw khise, paepae leikuh lan</para>
  <para style="q2">alepaw tui hawte athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e paw nynh a kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha laekhu khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a deihnah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Efraim phin aruithya hae paw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">lysakunawpaw haetapawsi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccu te syde athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Looh patae te a thokhaekuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lu kya a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">aphu-e zah apuithyapaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">anaanthyapaw haetapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hawnin azaw maw athae typaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thaeku thae hawte athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e athae a muihpaw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a kuih kya he athua te palou a ae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuin nin kya vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a laehypaw a ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">aphu-epaw haetapawsi,</para>
  <para style="q2">apuithyapaw bawilukhung athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />byapianaw kya a haung hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw thinlung a pya cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khua koikua kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw hae a kisahtu hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung a pya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />E hae zemah misutui keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">vyavya khuliakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ruithyapaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">tangkitangkae lante a cceih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ranpibawi hae te profeh hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ruithyapaw niapaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">vyavya a khuliakuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">misutui keiccuze mih lungzo,</para>
  <para style="q1">ruithyapaw niapaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">tangkitangkae lante a cceih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh a muih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">vizin tuh phe sei zah, mimaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">bya a piapya hae paw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">a thy a pawkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih ccaboi balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw lua te phe beih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">accikankunaw hmin um khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aning nynh hum kha mou</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw a ccangpah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hum kha mou phungbya kha a hopah cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Mateitui kyate phiapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nung matei kyate phiapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phunglang ccangkheit vawlan ccangkheit,</para>
  <para style="q2">aring ring kheit vawlan ring kheit,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangku lanpaw kha ccangkheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit te nynh athua,” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thanccingte, a kawccae leipaw mung te</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccangpaw munglae khate</para>
  <para style="q1">e ccungccaw hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh a hopah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:21">1Ko 14.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“E hynh haeungnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih riathae hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengannaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh thawdangnaw nynh thua,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite a hopya hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh thaepah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh a ccia hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang khuliakute, khyate,</para>
  <para style="q1">kaangkae te, kyng athua nawlan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh minmin hanlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Phunglang ccangkheit vawlan ccangkheit,</para>
  <para style="q2">aring ring kheit vawlan ring kheit,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangku lanpaw kha ccangkheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit,” cite a um.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jerusalem kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">e ccungccaw hae a uktu nanning</para>
  <para style="q1">a puatho hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Chinaw te byakinnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ah rae vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Michi khua te nawccawnaw phe ah hoi vae oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsawnaw he yn thua ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">aening kalan thua vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize lingnaw kha khynnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">phe ah thuruhkuh vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya kyakhe phe ah thuruh vae oh,” na ci oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hynhte a ho,</para>
  <para style="q1">Zion kyakhe athonaw aleihpaw lung,</para>
  <para style="q2">syntawtuapaw lung, aphutepaw apaki lang e</para>
  <para style="q1">abyapi huapaw lung,</para>
  <para style="q2">atynpaw athonaw aleihpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangkheit kha ka bing cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e lung kyakhe, “A zynpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">siikuh lan khyh,” cite a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Sam 118.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Rom 9.33</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 10:11">10.11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1Pe 2.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Byading kha aphae lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tounawpaw arui lang ka rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">dingnaw kha akaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tounawpaw arui lang ka rae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">hya nynh khynnawpaw hynbya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe zo lan a ccawphu cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui alepaw nynh rekunawpaw kha avu cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh chinaw te na raekheih oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinnaw tuh aroh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Michi khua te na raekheih oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nawccawnaw tuh azo cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">vawsawnaw he yn thua te,</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kha ae khulia cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuh-e vawsawnaw nynh atu te atu</para>
  <para style="q2">ae thuanua cih oh zah, ae lah cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize tuh-e vawsawnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">awkhua takyhte, khuazi khuadae</para>
  <para style="q1">ae thuanua cih oh; tuh-e konglang</para>
  <para style="q2">thae kyalya mawte rinaw a um cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ikhung tuh a dyngku nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">myaryamaw dyn zah, boei tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a thyku lan myaryamaw abypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccapaw hawte na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a la cyimaepaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">alokuh leipaw kha cyi khylan te,</para>
  <para style="q1">a la lawmaepaw a ryalaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">alokuh leipaw a ryalaw kha law khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">Perazim Mua vawlan a thoku hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thokuh cih zah, Gibeon accya kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinria hawte aria cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:10-12">Jos 10.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:20">2Sa 5.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 14:11">1Sh 14.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu puasakuh nan vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhkhyhze tuh houh accih lante</para>
  <para style="q1">ae heede cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize ram pynpi mawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ronaw a um cih cipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate ka thae vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngae oh lah, ka roi hynh thaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hopaw bya hynh hoyte thaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leithuepaw nynh ccacii lin nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">thue kyalya po thue zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a laephi kha thyhleih kyalya</para>
  <para style="q2">po a thyhleih zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lei kya-e laephi kha he a nginsah koute,</para>
  <para style="q2">pucinan te khanmuin kha lin khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Chanvuih kha atantante, barli kha</para>
  <para style="q2">angaekunaw hmin khe ccou zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">loori kyakhe ccangpaw ccacii hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccou khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize a Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ryalawthyanaw kha hoyte a ccangpya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pucinan amung kha khua nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">thingphe kha mang khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">khanmuin amung khua nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">vaetuale ccu kha mang khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama pucinan amung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungngue taraw te khua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khanmuin kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungngue te nynh a khua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chanvuih vui kha a tin hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama khah-e kha</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae po tin khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">leccu te marang khate miasah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aphaw kha palae tui lan mia khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />E hawnaw hynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate nynh yn thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">a tuanaw pyapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeangthua lan um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a hawnaw tuh myarya ahang.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Koihlunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ariel khua, David a umnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Ariel khuapi hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethya lan a um baban!</para>
  <para style="q2">Kum kheit koute kum kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">poi hae kha tua hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuhzemah Ariel khua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ria ka thaesah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rawkhuinaw te ngaethyanaw a um cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">te Jerusalem tuh kae ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">Ariel khua hawte athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te David hawte nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw phu kae nungnua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawviainn hae khate nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae koihlu cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laekarung thaenuakute kae rawse cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh laephi akaw langte</para>
  <para style="q2">bya na ho cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">laenoi lungkhu te zyazyate</para>
  <para style="q2">accaepaw na roi tuh yn ccae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na roi tuh laephi lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q2">khozi roi hawte accae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">bya na hopaw tuh laenoi lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q2">zyazyate accae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama na rhaw hae patae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ditarawpaw vuiping hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rysawthah hae paw patae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">azoupaw vaekang hawte athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Te arangte, vaekheitmawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kholung te</para>
  <para style="q2">innry te myarya ccaepaw roi te thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khiccung te khise te arua cciamangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">maeesoi te thuasah na kalan yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ariel khua a dou hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin patae balyn, Ariel khua te</para>
  <para style="q1">Ariel khua e lungrua te</para>
  <para style="q2">akoihkhawkuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a dou hae paw balyn, te Ariel khua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">riathaenaw a pya hae paw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">maan hawte athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi kya-e vizin hawte athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion Mua a dou hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae patae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a vuelawpaw nynh a maan kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a ae zemah he yn thaekuh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a vuelaw mamin hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a tuihawpaw nynh a maan kya</para>
  <para style="q2">tui a nia zemah he yn thaekuh tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a tuihaw mamin hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Naemaw toulou kha ngaeesakuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaee ccaleih oh, naemaw toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nae mit mohsakuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae mit tuh moh ccaleih sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Misutui nia leite rui ccaleih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">ruithyapaw atui nia leite</para>
  <para style="q2">vyavya khuliaku tua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae i ae thuasah oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae mit ae masisah vae oh, profeh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae piccan hae, beidin sazae hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih mit phang a hu vae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:8">Rom 11.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />E vizin hae balyn hynh nanning hanlan tazeih khiapaw ccaw te nynh aloku. A riathyapaw kha pya lan zah, “E hynh riatua,” ci lanze, aning nynh, “Tazeih a khiaku keiccuze ka ria kho khyh,” a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te a riathya leipaw kha pya lan zah, “E hynh riatua,” ci lanze, aning nynh, “Ka ria kho khyh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“E ccungccaw hae nynh mih khalang te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kalan naekuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih munglae te saw oun tua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thinlung tuh ka kyate asawkuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh kae yn beiknaw hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ciakute a ccangku hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw kawbya kha nynh thua;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:8-9">Mat 15.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 7:6-7">Mar 7.6-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tukeiccuze e ccungccaw hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">siiku lan umpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaeangthua lan umpaw uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bua ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kya-e a haw hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw tuh aroh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a nyhthya hae paw kya-e nythyanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thuruh athua cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:19">1Ko 1.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Akhupaw mih paccynkunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nyh nan sah cite</para>
  <para style="q1">thuruh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw kya ryalah hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hum nynh mou aening hynh oun muih cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Hum nynh mou oun nyh cih?” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">a ho hae paw nanning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nanning nynh uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe na buleih oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Ang a raetupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">anglae lang ria lan accan zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Raepaw uccaw nynh amaw a raetupaw kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Aning nynh kae yn rae khyh,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">a ho cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhkhyhze, “Aning tuh hawnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hoi khyh,” cite a ho cih tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa 45.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Malang hanlan Ngaehoinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccyh sosoh kya, Lebanon tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">looh avoipaw loo lang tang lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Looh avoipaw loo tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw lang tang lan khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuin nin kya tuh mih nawpanpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">akuekuhpaw ccaw kya-e bya hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a thae cih hae zah, ngaethyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw lungkhu a um hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">mitmoh hae nynh ngaw a muih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zakawsangsakuh hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya lungtuanaw thawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a mue cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahobou huacce hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungpaw cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize rysawthah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">um vae lan khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw a sarya hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">azo vae cih hae; hoyleinaw rae lan</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lungzuapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maemih athua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kaethekunaw kya phe shungsah cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw tungvaw rya a lahpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">byapianaw koikua kya hopiatu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaang a syakhawtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">adingpaw ccungccaw kha byading te</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a piapah lei hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">maemih athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Abraham a shawkhawtupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jakob ciihan te</para>
  <para style="q1">asekuh lante a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob phin tuh a maethah vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a maesue roh vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin nynh mih ccaaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ryalawnaw kha he a muih hae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka min kha saw a tua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob Pachia Athyaapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">saw a tua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia kha a rih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mingaee hae nynh nythyanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoi cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">bo a mang hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thuiheinaw kha a ngae ry cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip Doliakunaw Ccungkia Leinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae yn dou hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh ka khuakhannaw</para>
  <para style="q2">athua leipaw kha a cyi hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka rynaw te arawsekuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nawccawkheihnaw kha rae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">seinaw vawlan ccangpaw seinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a biachih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tuanaw kha khiaty leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">Faro siapharan thungkhawnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">um khylan te Izip mynlyh kya</para>
  <para style="q2">reku khylan, Izip ram lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceihbung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Faro kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">thungkhawnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae maethyanaw lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip mynlyh kya rekunaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thethyanaw lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mih bawi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Zoan khua um vae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih locceihtu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Hanes khua a thua vae hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah hae tungvaw thanenaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a pya kho lei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">bawmnaw te thanenaw thuakhae leite</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw te thethyanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a thuakhaepaw ccungccaw hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw ccarou a mue hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Alia lang e laesia ram kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">sarangpaw hae te asekuhpaw Pachia bya tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Vawsawnaw te riathaenaw ram,</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih pinung te chindeih nopaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">huparepaw te azouthyapaw hupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a umnaw hae ram kya po a cceih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh mih uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lann hae tungvaw kya,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih sisua kha kalauh tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">khang hae zah, minmin hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">a thane kho lei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kalan khe a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawccecize Izip kya-e bawmnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungkia leipaw te accakaepaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze Izip kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Daebabi lan a haungpaw Rahab,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite min ka phu vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Kawngae leipaw Minphuin</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu cceih lah, minmin malang</para>
  <para style="q2">lungphe vawlan zeitua,</para>
  <para style="q1">yn thua cih paw ccyh kya zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaekia lang a tang nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccauh kya zeitua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia a doupaw minphuin,</para>
  <para style="q1">a lungzi leipaw ccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thuiheinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngae ry leipaw ccaaw hae nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />minmin nynh muihdaetu hae kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Muihdae nan oh,” cipah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">profeh hae kha, “Kaening kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">akyhpaw profehbya kha</para>
  <para style="q1">oun hopah nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nawpalyapaw bya kha</para>
  <para style="q1">oun hopah oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lingkunaw bya kha oun hopah oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />e laanpi hynh cciataw oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccanglang maekuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thaesah nan vae oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel Pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">Athyaapaw nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nanning nynh e bya hynh na ei oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahkunaw te hynhunaw kha doliakute</para>
  <para style="q2">khah-e hae kha na reihpeku oh keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />e hoyleinaw hynh nanning hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lungrua ahangnaw kya um zah</para>
  <para style="q2">adohhypaw, vyavya atingpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lungrua hawte athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e lungrua tuh vaekheitmawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">palou atinthya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh ang akoipaw hawte akoi cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ang tuh koi zah maeephu lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q1">maee-e law nawlan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuisung kya-e tui the nawlan thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">akoinahpaw tuh mang lan asy lei lan ciate</para>
  <para style="q2">dy leite palae tui lan koi athua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel Pachia Athyaapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nanning nynh na kithui oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">daebabi lan na um oh ze,</para>
  <para style="q1">khum na thua cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">daebabi lan na um oh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">na doliaku oh ze, thawzung na hoi cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Thuasalama na ei oh zah,</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />nanning nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kae ry khyh! Marang ccikute</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ccue cih,” na ci oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze na ccue cih oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">“Myarya rangpaw marang tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">kae ccikuh cih,” na ci oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze nanning ae deehui oh paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya arang cih hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nanning tuh mua dung kya</para>
  <para style="q2">bingkuhpaw alan tung hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mua sangpyng vawlan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">syntawnawpaw hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">na thua mawlaezung oh, lu kheit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kha ae sii oh ze</para>
  <para style="q1">milu thong kheit na ccue cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lu pangaw nynh ae sii oh ze</para>
  <para style="q1">pong na ccue cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Zion hanlan Pachia Byakinpyakunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawcci khylan phang ae ngaw oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">nae tungvaw ngaethyaumsahnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">langsaku khylan aning tuh yn thokuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw Pachia nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw a ngaehoikupaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuapaw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thanccingte, pou Jerusalem a um hae paw Zion ccungccaw hae, rawkhuite na um vae lan khyh oh. Na siarua oh paw kha thae zah, nanning kha thaw ae ccih ccaccing cih oh; aning nynh he a thae te, ae leih cih oh. <verse number="20" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nanning kha vawsawnaw looh te riathaenaw tui kha ae pya oh zemah, nae Sazaepaw nynh ae retawkuh vae lan khyh oh, nae mit te nae Sazaepaw kha na muih vae cih oh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Nanning nynh ranglang khyhze voilang he na maeku oh ze, “E hynh akyhpaw laanpi nynh thua, e laanpi hynh zui oh,” cite a hopaw nae nulang e bya kha nae nakaring te na thae cih oh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh ngun atheikuhpaw zohtuh hae te sui atheikuhpaw zohtuh hae kha anungsikuhpaw lang na ria vae cih oh. Anungsikuhpaw boeipue hawte ccaring na vua cih oh zah, “Kae muih ry vae khyh oh!” na cipah vae cih oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Laephi kya na ccoupaw ccacii hanlan khuaa kha a rawsah cih, te laephi nynh a pousahpaw looh tuh myarya avoi cih. Tuin nin kya tuh na sahiin hae tuh akopaw hmin kya ram a paeekuh cih hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei a thue hae paw tangnua hae te lann hae nynh paraw te ccangkung khate cciccaepaw sahiin looh kha a ae cih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Rhaw hae patae kha na theih oh zah rhawviainn hae kha he na tingsah oh te, ahangpaw mua miakaw te ahangpaw sangpyng miakaw kya tui aluapaw vaw hae a um cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuhpiaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae vaemaw kha heepah hae zah, minmin nynh a mue hae paw vaemaw kha he a dansah hae nin khe, sawpaw awnaw tuh khuanin awnaw hawte athua cih, te khuanin awnaw tuh nin sari lungkhu e awnaw hawte, leit sari a aw cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Assiria tungvaw Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dotua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw kyate yn thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinrianaw tuh maee lang rua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">maeekhuh lang akhuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a munglae tuh thinrianaw te phe beih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lae tuh arua cciamangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te nynh aloku;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a hysue tuh nging kyacia phe avu lan ciate</para>
  <para style="q2">tui myarya alepaw vaw te nynh aloku,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e a hy tuh minphuin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ronaw pasaryh te ryh khylan te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kha a cciasah sei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">rangtei rui kha mih mung kya</para>
  <para style="q1">teisah khylan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Athyaapaw poi tua lya khuazi hawte, nanning nynh hlaw na sah cih oh; Israel Lungpi, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mua langkhe phyly tubiakute ccia hawte nae lungpaw cih. <verse number="30" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh alesaepaw a roi kha a thaesah cih hae zah a kuih thawzung kha a muihsah cih hae, myaryamaw thinrianaw te arua cciamangpaw maeesoi kha khise te khuaa te ria rykhate a langsakuh cih. <verse number="31" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Assiria hae kha a ccoi te he a tuk hae te, a roi keiccuze minmin tuh rikawte a thyngkuh cih hae. <verse number="32" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha detahnawpaw hoitang te a bua takyh hae te, tintang te phyly roi mah accaebua cih; Assiria kha thawmawte a tuk cih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Pawccecize Assiria siapharan kha maee te unaw lanpaw ahmin kha langmawlya mawte paccyn ty athua vae; thanccingte tuh-e hmin tuh siapharan hanlan paccyn ty athua vae, maee-unaw hmin tuh ko zah akhu lante maeething patae rykhate rae athua vae, kemaee atui alopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hy nynh maeething kha a u cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Izip te Nawccawkheih tuh Alakaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawmnaw ngiaku khylan Izip ram lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceihbung hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q2">Minmin nynh marang hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a doliaku hae, myarya lungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">marangle hae te myarya thungpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">marang rhawkaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a doliaku hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama Israel Pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">Athyaapaw kha doliakuh khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuanaw ngiakuh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuhzemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myaryamaw haw zah</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tungvaw vawsawnaw a thuakhae;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh a bya kha ro leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">hoyleinaw a rae hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy leipaw rya a lah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">a bawmtu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsete a thonuakuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Izip hae tuh Pachia thua khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih marang hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">muisaw thua khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngesaw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a kuih he a dyng te,</para>
  <para style="q1">a bawmtu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thy a pawkuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a bawm hae paw ccungccaw hae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a khuliakuh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte a rohkheih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae yn hopyapaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">A teikupaw saw vawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">a umpaw chindeih khyhze</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih taraw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuurin hae nynh a o hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a sia a rua hae paw roi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rih khyh zah siikuh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhawte vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Zion Mua vawlan te</para>
  <para style="q2">a mua sangpyng vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuk khylan yn rungbung cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pavaw nynh a taw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thungkhaw khylan a bu luki</para>
  <para style="q1">a zou bungthung hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem kha a thungkhaw cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem kha a thungkhaw cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a luesah cih, a haang cih zah a khum cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pou Israel ccungccaw hae, thawte na la dou oh paw Pachia kalan kithui ccavae oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuin nin khe nanning balyn nynh seibupite nae kuih te na la raeku oh paw nae sui zohtuh hae te nae ngun zohtuh hae kha ccaring na vua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Assiria hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw thaloi athua leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi khate a khuliakuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw thaloi athua leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi nynh minmin kha a roh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi kyate a ccue cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ccangvae hae kha nangsete</para>
  <para style="q2">ryalawsah athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mih siapharan tuh rikawte a ccue cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">a rhawbawi hae tuh siikute</para>
  <para style="q1">mih alan kha heize a ccuetaw cih hae,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">a maee tuh Zion kya um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a maeephupi tuh Jerusalem kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Adingpaw Siapharan</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dotua, dingnaw te a ukpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan lu kheit yn um cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">byading te a uk cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minmin tuh khisan kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">rekunaw hmin hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khise kyate khynnaw hmin hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ramrou kya a luapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">vawkhu hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">asonaw ram kya umpaw myarya lepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lungpi mynlyh hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngawmuih hae paw mit nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaerarih lan a muih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nawthae hae paw nakaring nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">naw a ngae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tueruamaerua a cyihthya hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlung nynh tuasethyanaw a hoi cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lae-ah hae paw munglae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">arangte ccaepapeih lan bya a hothya cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mingaee kha asung-epaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw cite ko vae lan khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hoyleipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtua lan umpaw cite ko vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize mingaee nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeenaw bya kha ho zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinlung te ahoy leipaw kha a paccyn:</para>
  <para style="q2">A cyisahnaw kya Pachia rawrinaw um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> konglang akyh leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">bya kha a ho, looh kanmawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">looh dang boi khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tui kanmawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tui pya lan a kang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy leipaw kha a cyi;</para>
  <para style="q1">ahobou hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hanpaw kha hmerarih lante</para>
  <para style="q1">a ngiaku hae heize, ryachi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya te ro khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy leipaw kha a paccyn hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama asung-epaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw nynh tuh asung-epaw</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw hae kha paccyn zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">asung-epaw uccaw hae liate</para>
  <para style="q1">tynkaring lan a thadyn.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Nopi hae kha Raeringnaw Pyanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thawdangte a um hae paw nopi hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thokuh oh lah, ka roi hynh ngaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a sawphahkuhpaw nopi taraw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hopaw hynh ngaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungdaete a um hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">kum kheit lae ccapyh aro te,</para>
  <para style="q1">thinphangte na um cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize misu thae loo lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">na hoi lan khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccathae rue ccyh um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thawdangte a um hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hae, thyngku tua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a sawphahkuh hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinphangte umtua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae boeining khahkute nae sasete um oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae tae kya buriboei kha voiku tua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungrythua lan umpaw loo hanlan te</para>
  <para style="q2">patae athaepaw misu ku hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyate nae by kha tukuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />pawccecize ka ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungpawpaw khuapi kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a lungtuapaw innbyn hae balyn kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">hinpaw te thabu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">pong a zithin hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siapharan inn kha vuasya athua cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">milu alungpaw khuapi kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw phe adae cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">inn hae te rhawviainn hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">sarangpaw umnaw akarung lang</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw e lann hae mih lungpawnaw hmin,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuu hae a paeenaw hae hmin lang a tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />te Pachia nynh a muisaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening tungvaw oun sawpah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw tuh athae alungpaw loo lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tang zah, athae alungpaw loo tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw lante tua athua mawlaezung</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhcite acyihkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Uknaw kya Daenaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh byading tuh ramkaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a um cih zah, dingnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athae alungpaw loo kya a um cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dingnaw athae tuh daenaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw athanenawpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae daenaw te khynnaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">adaenaw, akhynnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">adaepaw haeungnaw hmin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hya accaw keiccuze ramkaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">marya azo cih zah, khuapi tuh laephi te</para>
  <para style="q2">phe nging lan khaleih ating cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui a umnaw miakaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccacii ccou hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaetua te lann hae kha rythyte</para>
  <para style="q2">a saw hae paw nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtua hae paw nynh na thua oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rhaw kyate Luenaw hanlan Profehbya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ming hae nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae roh lei hae pite, a rohtupaw nang,</para>
  <para style="q1">ming hae nynh nang kha ae luade lei hae pite,</para>
  <para style="q2">a luadetupaw nang,</para>
  <para style="q1">na hanlan ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang nynh ming hae tungvaw ronaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">luadenaw kha he na umtaw te,</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw tungvaw ronaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">luadenaw nynh ae thuanua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kaening hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thaw beih oun ccitua;</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening nynh nang kha kae ngaehoiku.</para>
  <para style="q2">Awkhua takyh kaening hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung oun pyatua,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae vawsaw ccyh lya oun khumtua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Myarya ccaepaw roi keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae tuh a ccue hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na huhan keiccuze minphuin hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">phiariphiarae a um hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ripaw hae a sueluaku hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">luadepaw uccaw hae tuh suelua athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tungkhipaw hae nynh a thohku hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh tuh-e uccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">vawlan khe a thohkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh hangthung thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahangnaw kya a um; Zion kha</para>
  <para style="q2">byading te dingnaw khate phe a biasah;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na ccyh atynpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">khumnaw phe beihpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">hawnaw te nynaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion sisua nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngaetua! Mih rawthung hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi hae kyakhe a sia hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">daenaw hanlan locceihtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thawmawte a raw hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Laanluepi kya ccungccaw phe adae,</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi kya a cceih bungthungpaw um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nawccawthungkupaw byakinnaw kha roh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinkunaw kha a vua,</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung kha mah pawlangria khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram tuh a ngaethah zah a thawzya;</para>
  <para style="q2">Lebanon loram tuh maethyate karae rou;</para>
  <para style="q1">Sharon accya tuh laesia ram hawte thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Bashan ram te Karmel mua kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">thingnaw hae tuh a khuakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Atu ka thokuh vae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">atu ka thungnaw kha ka langsakuh vae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaekang kha ccaaw lang poite</para>
  <para style="q2">athupaw kha ccaaw lang na saah oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">nae tuanaw tuh naemaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ae u cih oh paw maee nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh thuunglung lang</para>
  <para style="q2">rae khylan maee te a u hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">lung hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te soi khylan a bae hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">hinpaw hawte thuasah athua cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asawnaw kya um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cyipaw hynh nytua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">anaenaw kya um hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thungnaw hynh nytua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zion khua e misei hae tuh a rih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia pawlangria lei hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thyngkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Aening lakuze aruapaw maee lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q1">hummou a hiin kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Aening lakuze zungzae aruapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">maeephu kya hummou a hiin kho cih?” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dingrarih lan hiin zah</para>
  <para style="q2">hmerarih lan bya a hopaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuaasahkunaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">muepaw uccaw kha hua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pyaruh kha a lawkuh leipaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw chia lanpaw bya</para>
  <para style="q1">a thae ry leipaw te hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a do leipaw tuh ahangnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a um cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning tuh rhawlungrua te</para>
  <para style="q2">koihlupaw khua kyakhe a khyn cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">looh kha tyty pya athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui mah apaekuh lei lan pya athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Alesaepaw Siapharan Ram</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Siapharan a sung-enaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na mit te na muih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya akopaw ram kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">na muih cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ri lan umpaw konglang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkaw na tua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ccazing a lahtupaw kha teimou a um vae?</para>
  <para style="q2">Ngunto a khoitupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">teimou a um vae?</para>
  <para style="q2">Rhawviainn a riatupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">dophitu hae kha teimou</para>
  <para style="q2">a um vae hae?” na ci cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Alysakuhpaw ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">na thaethya kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">byakhupaw a ho lei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">na nythya kho leipaw bya</para>
  <para style="q1">a ho hae paw mih lae-ah hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na muih vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beiknaw lante poi ah la tuanaw oh</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion khuapi khuh dotua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">A tung hae kha phoh kho um khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a rui hae kha pae kho a um leipaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nue kho a um leipaw bu athuapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">daetedae lan umnawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem khua kha na mit te na muih cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuin khua kyakhe alesaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh aening hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">akopaw vawpi te vaw taraw hae athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuin kyakhe ah rhaw hae kohlung te</para>
  <para style="q2">athungpaw ccingbaw cceih lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening byapiatu nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh aening oun uktu nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh aening siapharan thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh aening kha oun khum cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kohlung kya zopaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na boei rui hae tuh a phoukuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e arui nynh kohlung boei atung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tynkaring lan kyng kho khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">kohlung kya azokuhpaw boei kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">dawsakuh kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Tetuh myarya lungpaw rhaw hae uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">luadete neeku athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccukhoupaw nynh heize</para>
  <para style="q2">luadepaw uccaw kha a luakuh bua kho cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khua kya um hae paw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Kae tuh ka ccih,” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">a hopaw um lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya a um hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya athua cih.</para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Minphuin hae kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou minphuin hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nawthae khylan oun naeku tua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou ccungccaw hae, hoyte ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Laephi te laephi kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a umpaw balyn nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephipi te laephipi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a umpaw balyn nynh thuasah thae hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh minphuin hae</para>
  <para style="q2">balyn tungvaw a thinria zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih rhawkaw hae balyn tungvaw kya mah</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a thinria;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha phe a maemih vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">chianaw kalan a ap vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mih rhua kha ccaring vua athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih rhua tuh athuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih chiise te mua hae tuh tui lang alua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaawlui kya a um hae paw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pong akoi cih hae zah, vaawlui tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaw akuekuhpaw hawte akuekuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Vaawlui kya a umpaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">misu ku kya baleih anaanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">misu naw hawte anaan cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">thaeku ku kya karae aroupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thaeku thae hawte arou cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:29">Mat 24.29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:25">Mar 13.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:26">Luk 21.26</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13-14">Bya 6.13-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thaloi tuh vaawlui kya</para>
  <para style="q2">he ka paccyn koute,</para>
  <para style="q2">Edom ram vawlan te</para>
  <para style="q1">byapia khylan ka nungdae vae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae tungvaw kya accah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.5-17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Isa 63.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49.7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eze 25.12-14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1.2-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thaloi tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">chiise te phe byn vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">atho khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuutaw chii te miaa chii khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuutepaw akin kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">atho khate thuasah phe a byn vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Bozrah khua kya silawnaw kha rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Edom ram kya myarya lepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">chianaw kha a rae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh kuarang hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">tangnua taraw hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">a chih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih ram tuh chiise kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a ciakuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih laephi tuh atho te phe abeih cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />E ccyh tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion kha luesah zah</para>
  <para style="q1">Zion a rhaw hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phu a law ccyh athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Edom ram e vawkhu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kahtaza lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a laephi tuh kemaee lang a tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">a ram tuh maee a u cciamangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kahtaza lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuazi khuadae maee chih lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">a maeekhuh tuh zungzae akhuhthung cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ram tuh she kheit koute she kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungkia vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ram lungkhu a cceih bungthungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hum sanmah po um vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:11">Bya 14.11</ref>, <ref loc="REV 19:3">19.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e ram tuh mosi te</para>
  <para style="q2">sazi hae ram lang a tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">nawnia te va-aw tuh tuin ram kya a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuin ram kya</para>
  <para style="q1">keisukeilaenaw te accakaepaw thuanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">arui kha a raw cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram a uktu siapharan um lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhaetu hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">um vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Siapharan inn hae kya te</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawlungrua hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">hinpaw aphuinphuin a po cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">suizaw te kalauh pavaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">umnaw lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin kyakhe samaaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">ram-ui hae tuh a tungkuh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">sathaw hae tuh sa kheit te sa kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">a kokuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuin kyakhe Lilih pavaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a haeung cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">haeungnaw hmin kha a muihkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nawnia nynh bu a luakuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">a tui kha a tui cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccong koute yn keipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a taw hae kha a do-oih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">lantaw hae nynh mah tuin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a sueluakuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">api te atepaw ccarou a mungkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccauh lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ccung oh lah, riatua oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e sarangpaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">sa kheit sanmah zo lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ruiban a hoi leipaw sa kheit sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">um lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kawpya zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a muisaw nynh khah-e hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a suelua vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungthydungnaw raepah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih khate mih hanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">arui rawkhawpyate a neethung hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh tuh-e ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae a pee cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">she kheit koute she kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin ram kya a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zion lang Kithuinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ramkaw te ram roupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungtua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">laesia ram tuh a lungpaw cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">karokas haetapaw hawte apaw cih.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Haetapaw patae apaw cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtua hlawsahte</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungpawkhaekuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Lebanon mua hawte a phu-e cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Karmel mua te Sharon bialae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtuanaw huhan a hoi cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ah Pachia lesaenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a muih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Athawzyapaw kuih hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung pya oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">athyngkuhpaw ccukharu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tynsah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:12">Heb 12.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rinaw thinlung a hoi hae paw kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Nae thawsae sah, rih nan oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">E kya nae Pachia phang um.</para>
  <para style="q2">Nae rhaw hae kha phulaw khylan te</para>
  <para style="q1">detah khylan yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning nynh yn thua cih zah</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha ae khum cih oh,” cite hopah oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitmoh hae nynh ngaw a muih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih nawpan hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">naw a thae cih hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat 11.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luk 7.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ccukhou hae nynh sazuh hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a thohkuh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">byahothya lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate hlaw a sah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize ramkaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">tuidy apou cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia ram kya vaw alua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Phaephae ak lan asopaw laesia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuili lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aroupaw laephi tuh tuidy lang a tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">suizaw a umthyanaw hmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuinoh lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lonua hae tuh phaeku hae te tuinoh kya</para>
  <para style="q2">apopaw lonua hae lang a tang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin kya laanluepi a um cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Athyaapaw Laanpi cite ko athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaa lei hae paw nynh tuh-e laanpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">cceih lan khyh hae, tuh-e laanpi tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia ccungccaw hae hanlan athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">mingaee nynh heize laanpi vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin kya chindeih um lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sarepaw mah cceihthung lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e hae tuh tuin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">muih thua lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama shawkhaw athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae rou nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e laanpi tuh a zui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a shawkhaw hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ki cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hlawsah biate Zion a thua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw lungtuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lu kya a khungkuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw te lungpawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a mue cih hae zah, ngaethyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">hawkhaekunaw tuh azo vae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sennakherib nynh Jerusalem A Rawse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 18:13-27">2Si 18.13-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:1-19">2Sh 32.1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan nynh Judah ram a uknaw kum haw lae palinaw kum khe, Assiria siapharan Sennakherib nynh Judah ram e rhawlungrua te akoihlukuhpaw khuapi hae balyn kha ccianua thung zah a law hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Assiria siapharan nynh Rabshakeh kha rhawkaw patae ryte Lakhish khua kyate Jerusalem umpaw Hezekiah Siapharan kalan ­a saw. Rabshakeh tuh Boeikuatu hae Loo lang cceihpaw laanluepi pe umpaw palung tuili kya-e tuizypi pe khe a thadyn. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Hilkiah ccapaw, siapharan inn do-oihtu Eliakim, ryaccinkhan Shebnah te Asaf ccapaw ccawzeitu Joah tuh amaw kalan oun cceih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Rabshakeh nynh minmin kyakhe, “Hezekiah kha hynhte la hopah oh: Alesaepaw siapharan, Assiria siapharan nynh hynhte a ho: E na zynkunaw hynh paw tungvaw kya mou na tynsah? <verse number="5" style="v" />Bya maesae hynh rhawtuknaw hanlan thyanaw te thungnaw nynh thua cite vosi na tua? Kae kha dou lan ciate hummou na doliaku? <verse number="6" style="v" />Akhyapaw phaeku hoitang te alokuhpaw Izip ram kha na doliaku, khah-e phaeku a doliakuhpaw miakaw tuh khah-e phaeku nynh a kuih kha po zua lan a thuing cih. Izip siapharan Faro tungvaw a doliakuhpaw balyn kyakhe Faro nynh tuhcite a cyi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 29:6-7">Eze 29.6-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama nanning nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia kha kae doliaku,’ na ci oh ze, aning tuh Hezekiah nynh Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha, ‘E silawhang malang hin na beik cih oh,’ cite hopah hae zah, a hmin hangpaw hae te a silawhang hae a ropyapaw pachia kha thua khyh tou? <verse number="8" style="v" />Te atu ka bawipaw Assiria siapharan kyakhe byakinkuh oh: Nanning nynh marang a ccikuh khopaw na mue oh ze, marang thong ning kae pya cih oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning nynh marangle te marang rhawkaw hae kha mue khylan Izip ram kha doliakute, ka bawipaw kya-e ryalahtu adihhua hae paw laku e rhawbawi lu kheit sankaw kha pawtemou na dou kho cih oh? <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, e ram ro khylan kae ccianua thungpaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bawmnaw leite athua zawtou? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, E ram hynh ccianua thung lah, rotua, yn cipya,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh Eliakim, Shebna te Joah nynh Rabshakeh kyakhe, “Thawccinawte na ryalahtu hae hynh Aramaik bya te beih oun hopah, pawccecize mang kae thae; khualungrua vawlan a um hae paw nynh a thae lan hae te, Judah bya te oun hopah nan,” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Rabshakeh nynh, “Ka bawipaw nynh e bya hynh nae bawipaw te nanning kalan ho lan yn saw zawtou? Khualungrua vawlan haung hae zah, nanning ryte mih ia kha aete mih zuin a neih cih hae paw kalan yn saw khyh tou?” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Rabshakeh nynh thadyn zah Judah bya te thawte sia zah, “Alesaepaw siapharan, Assiria siapharan bya hynh ngaetua oh! <verse number="14" style="v" />Siapharan nynh hynhte a ho: ‘Hezekiah kha lingsakuh nan oh, pawccecize aning nynh nanning kha ae luesah kho lan khyh oh. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hynh oun luesah ccaccing cih; e khuapi hynh Assiria siapharan kuih kalan pya lan khyh, cite hopyate Hezekiah nynh nanning kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw ae doliasakuh nan oh sah,’ a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />Hezekiah bya kha ngae nan oh; pawccecize Assiria siapharan nynh hynhte a ho: ‘Kae te ccawkunaw rae oh lah, ka kalan oun cceih oh; tetuh nae misu ku te nae thaeku raveih kya-e kha na ae cih oh zah, naemaw tuisung kya-e tui kha na neih cih oh, <verse number="17" style="v" />nae ram te alokuhpaw ram, ccathae te misutui apounaw ram, sanlou te misu khokhu a umnaw ram lang nanning kha cciakhae khylan kae thua mawlaezung tuhcite la cyih oh. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh oun khum cih, cite hopyakute Hezekiah kha cciakhae seisakuh nan oh. Minphuin hae kya-e pachia hae nynh mih ram kha Assiria siapharan kuih kyate a khum hae tou? <verse number="19" style="v" />Hamath khua te Arpad khua kya-e pachia hae tuh teimou a um hae? Sefarvaim khua a pachia hae tuh teimou a um hae? Tuh-e pachia hae nynh Samaria ram kha ka kuih kyate a luesah hae tou? <verse number="20" style="v" />E ram hae kya-e mih pachia hae balyn nynh mih ram hae kha ka kuih kyate a khum boi paw pachia a um tou? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka kuih kyate Jerusalem kha pawtemou a khum kho cih?’ a ci,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh bya kaw kheit san khungru leite yccae leite a um hae, pawccecize Hezekiah siapharan nynh, “La khungru nan oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan inn do-oihtu Hilkiah ccapaw Eliakim, ryaccinkhan Shebna te Asaf ccapaw ccawzeitu Joah nynh mih boeining seiikute Hezekiah kalan oun thua hae zah, Rabshakeh nynh a hopaw bya kha a hopya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah nynh Isaiah Tuanaw A Ngia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:1-7">2Si 19.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan nynh tuh-e bya kha he a thae te, a boeining kha seii zah buriboei kha a zingku, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lang a cceih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Siapharan inn do-oihtu Eliakim, ryaccinkhan Shebna te buriboei a zingkuh hae paw ranpibawi piccanhua hae kha Amoz ccapaw profeh Isaiah kalan a saw hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh Isaiah kyakhe, “Hezekiah nynh a hopaw bya tuh: Atunin tuh ngaethya nin, thuihei nin te thethya nin nynh thua; imua pui zaw zah a pui nawlan thawzung um khyh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahiinpaw Pachia kha sarya khylan Assiria siapharan nynh yn sawpaw a ryalahtu Rabshakeh bya kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh la thae vae sah, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a thaepaw bya kha detah vae sah; tukeiccuze a laehypaw ccungccaw hae hanlan saw la sang,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hezekiah Siapharan a ryalahtu hae nynh Isaiah kya he a thua hae te, <verse number="6" style="v" />Isaiah nynh minmin kyakhe, “ ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Assiria siapharan a ryalahtu hae nynh ka thethya yn ho hae paw bya kha na thae keiccuze rih nan. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh laanbya kha thae zah a ram lang a ki nawlan, a thinlung kya ka sang cih; a ram kyakhe thaloi te ka chisah cih a ci,’ cite nae bawipaw kha la hopah oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rabshakeh tuh yn ki zah, Assiria siapharan nynh Libnah khua a tuk cciamangpaw kha a muih; pawccecize siapharan tuh Lakhish khua kyate a pou vae cipaw kha a thae vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Ethiopia Siapharan Tirhakah tuh Assiria rhawkaw kha dou khylan yn thokuh vae cipaw kha Assiria siapharan nynh he a thae te, locceihtu hae kha Hezekiah kalan saw hae zah, <verse number="10" style="v" />“Judah Siapharan Hezekiah kha hynhte na hopah cih oh: Jerusalem tuh Assiria siapharan kuih kalan pya thua lan khyh, cite ae kinpyakupaw bya khate na Pachia kha lingsakuh nan. <verse number="11" style="v" />Assiria siapharan hae nynh ram hae balyn kha khaleih roh hae zah pawtemou a cyi hae cipaw kha phe na thae vae. Na lue cih zawtou? <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka minpaaw hae nynh a la ro hae paw Gozan, Haran, Rezef khua hae te Telassar khua a um hae paw Eden ccungccaw hae kha mih pachia hae nynh a khum hae zawtou? <verse number="13" style="v" />Hamath siapharan, Arpad siapharan, Sefarvaim khuapi e siapharan, Hena siapharan te Ivvah siapharan kha teimou a um hae?” cite ccaw a ky.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah A Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh tuh-e ccaw tuh locceihtu hae kuih kyakhate lawkuh zah a ria; oute Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lang cceihthung zah, tuh-e ccaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a daw. <verse number="15" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang zah a hopaw tuh: <verse number="16" style="v" />“Cherubim vawlan a haungpaw, pou vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, nang tuh Pachia nynh na thua, laephi vaw e peenaw balyn kyaze nang rou nynh Pachia na thua; vaaw te lae kha na rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Exo 25.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na nakaring kha beih yn tuakuh lah thaetua; pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na mit kha dae lah beih muihtua; Sennakherib nynh ahiinpaw Pachia kha sarya khylan ccungccaw sawte a hosah hae paw bya balyn kha thaetua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thanccingte, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Assiria siapharan hae nynh minphuin hae te mih ram hae balyn kha roh hae zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />mih pachia hae kha maee lungkhu a phungpya hae, tuh-e pachia hae tuh pachia thua khyh hae, ccungccaw kuih te raepaw thing te lung athua hae keiccuze ro athua vae hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia, kaening hynh Assiria siapharan kuih kyate oun khumtua, tuhteze nynh laephi vaw e peenaw balyn nynh, nang rou nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na thua cipaw kha a nyh cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan kalan Isaiah Byatawnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 19:20-37">2Si 19.20-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh Amoz ccapaw Isaiah nynh Hezekiah kalan ccungccaw saw hae zah, “Israel Pachia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Assiria Siapharan Sennakherib te asekuh lante ka kalan saw na sang keiccuze, <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aning te asekuh lante bya a hopaw tuh hynhte nynh thua:</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Ccanung liaccady Zion nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha pawlang ae ria khyh zah ae nuinse;</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem ccanung nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na nulangte a lu ae henua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Nang nynh hummou nuinsete</para>
  <para style="q2">na ruin na san?</para>
  <para style="q1">Na sianua zah lysakunaw mit te</para>
  <para style="q2">na dopaw kha hum cite mou na tua?</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw lakha na rawse!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ryalahtu hae kha mangte</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw kha na sarya zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka marangle patae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">mua ahangnaw kalan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahang huapaw Lebanon mua dung hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kaethung vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ahang huaccepaw a sidar ku hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy huaccepaw a maeccaw ku hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka nge hae; ahang huaccenaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">thing athaaw huaccenaw ramkaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuisung ka thae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">tui ka neih,</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip ram e vawkhu balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccukaw te ka rousah,” na ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘E hynh langmawlya te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka la paccynku vae cipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na thae boi khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Lungrua te koihlupaw khuapi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">aronahpaw apumkuhpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">na rae nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">khawlya te ka la paccynpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">atu tuh ka ccingsah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuin kya a um hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawzya, siikuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lung pong muakhaekuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh loo lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q2">aku hae hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nebaleihpaw lonua hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">innccukaly umpaw lonua hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ale kheccung mawze</para>
  <para style="q1">baleih anaanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">aku hawte thuasah athua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />‘Na thokunaw te na haungnaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">na pounaw te na teenaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">te ka tungvaw na thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka ny.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka tungvaw na thinria zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thae vae keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">na napaw kae tho cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na mung kha rangtei kae teisah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thuanaw laanpi kyakhate</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kisah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“ ‘Nang na hanlan muihsahnaw tuh hynhcite athua cih: Atu kum tuh amaw le lan alethungpaw ccathae kha ae oh, khuavae kya mah tuhcite alethungpaw kha ae oh; hankum kya tuh ccathae kha ccoukuh oh lah, rue oh, misu khokhu kya lin oh lah, misu thae kha ae oh. <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahiinhy hae paw Judah phin hae tuh akawlan mih tharui a sawthui cih zah, avawlan khe mih thae athae cih; <verse number="32" style="v" />pawccecize ahiinhy hae paw tuh Jerusalem kyate oun pou cih hae zah, ahiin hae paw phu tuh Zion Mua kyate oun pou cih hae. E hynh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh lungthote a cyih cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“ ‘Tukeiccuze Assiria siapharan te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Aning nynh e khua lungkhu lang tee lan khyh, khuapi lungkhu kya the ccangkheit san kaw lan khyh, khawriaphua ccyngkute khuapi malang langkuh lan khyh, khuapi kha rawsete po voilu lan laephi adohpaw kha pumnua lan khyh hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Oun thuanaw laanpi kyakhate a kithui cih; aning nynh e khuapi lungkhu lang tee lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="35" style="v" />Kamaw hanlan te ka ryalahtu David hanlan, e khua hynh khum khylan ka thungkhaw cih,’ a ci,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Sennakherib A Shungnaw te A Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh yn langkuh zah, Assiria rhawkaw ryahmin kya-e milu cciing kheit sung tarya thong pangaw kha a chia hae; awkhua takaw khua he yn dae tuh, michi rhua lang pong a tang vae hae. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tetuh Assiria Siapharan Sennakherib tuh toikuh zah, inn lang ki zah Nineveh khua kya a um vae. <verse number="38" style="v" />A pachia Nisrok kha beikinn kya a beik cciamang lyakhe a ccapaw hae Adrammelek te Sharezer nynh amaw kha thaloi te phe a chia hae, minmin tuh Ararat ram lungkhu lang po a ccue hae. A ccapaw Esar-haddon nynh a paaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang vae.</para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekiah Ccinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:1-11">2Si 20.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:24-26">2Sh 32.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh lyatuin Hezekiah tuh ccih zah vyavya a chih vae. Amoz ccapaw profeh Isaiah nynh a kalan cceih zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Na inn ryalaw kha hoyte synriasya, pawccecize na chih vae cih; na dan vae lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tetuh Hezekiah nynh pang kalan khe a mae kha hawi zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw a sang: <verse number="3" style="v" />“Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, ka thinlung balyn te lungzite na malang ka hiin zah, na muihnaw kya ahoypaw uccaw ka cyipaw kha atu beih liathuitua, namaw kha kae ngiaku,” ci zah, thawte a rah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Isaiah kya yn thua zah: <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hezekiah kalan cceih lah, ‘Na minpaaw David Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Na sawsangnaw kha ka thae vae, na mitphi kha ka muih vae; na hiinshe kha kum haw lae pangaw ka saesah chih cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Assiria siapharan kuih kyate nang te e khuapi hynh kae luesah cih oh zah, e khuapi hynh ka thungkhaw cih, a ci,’ cite la hopah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isaiah nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya a kinku vae thyhte a cyi lanpaw uccaw, nang na hanlan muihsahnaw tuh hynhcite nynh athua: <verse number="8" style="v" />Dotua, Ahaz kya-e khuanin tounawpaw vawlan anuekuhpaw mynlyh kha nulang khe kaw haw ka kisah cih,” a ci. Tetuh phe anuekuh vae paw khuanin tounawpaw tuh nulang kaw haw a kithui.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah Siapharan Hezekiah tuh ccih zah a ccinaw kyate a dan koute a zeipaw ccaw tuh: <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hiinshe ka ryku cciamang lya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cceih vae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccyh a laehy ungpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">michi khua koikua kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ap athua vae, ka la ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahiinpaw ccungccaw hae ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka muih vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi kya a um hae paw laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka muih vae lan khyh hae, ka la ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuurinpaw bu hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka umnaw inn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">phou thua zah, ka kyate nue athua;</para>
  <para style="q1">boeikuatu nynh boeikua a kue hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hiinnaw kha ka kue vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">boeikuatu nynh boeikua kya arawkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">laaw a pae hawte Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thoh yn pae vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nin kheit lungkhu ka hiinnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phe nae thangsah, ka la ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azi zidae bawmnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">mue khylan ka sia;</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih hawte aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ru balyn kha pong yn khya;</para>
  <para style="q1">nin kheit lungkhu kya ka hiinnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phe nae thangsah cite ka la tua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccipae khyhze cocia pavaw hawte ka sia zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vahu hawte ka hawkhaekuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka mit tuh ka dothungnaw a thawbang vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Bawipaw, kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuaasahkunaw ka teing;</para>
  <para style="q2">khynnaw beih yn pyatua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama pawmou ka ho kho ung cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize kae kha yn hopya vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">e hynh amaw ccaccei nynh phe a cyi vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka thinlung a cci keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">kharouh ka ih kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw, e uccaw hae liate</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae tuh a hiin hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka muisaw hiinnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">e uccaw hae balyn kyahin a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka ccinaw beih yn dan sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn hiin sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thanccingte ka teingpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccinaw alepaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw hoynaw hanlan nynh athua;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka hiinnaw kha ronaw hunghua kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">poh nae thuaa vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ka seinaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na nulang na vua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Michi khua nynh na tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuabya ho kho khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">chinaw nynh na the ae hoysah kho khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">Hunghua lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccah hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungzinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaehoi kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Atunin kae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thehoysah hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ahiin hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahiin hae paw rou nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ae thehoysah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">paaw hae nynh ccaaw hae kya</para>
  <para style="q1">na lungzinaw kha a nysah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn khum cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening nynh kae hiin lungkhu balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">tintang khuakute hlaw kae sah cih, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isaiah nynh, “Thaeku athae hae kha lah hae sah lah, a nonde kou hae te, accinaw kha thuhpah hae sah, tetuh siapharan tuh a dan cih,” a ci. <verse number="22" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh mah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lang cciathung khonawpaw pawcihawpaw muihsahnaw mou a um?” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon Ram kyate Locceihtu hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2KI 20:12-19">2Si 20.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Baladan ccapaw, Babilon Siapharan Merodak Baladan nynh Hezekiah tuh ccih zah a dan vae cipaw a thae keiccuze ccaw te lasung phusahpyate locceihtu hae kha Hezekiah kalan a saw hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Hezekiah nynh minmin kha hoyte ccuepe hae zah, a sisuainn, ngun, sui, amynkhuhpaw, aphutepaw chitui, a zunghe inn abalyn, a uccaw ccakhungnaw inn kya a umpaw balyn kha a dosah hae. A inn kya te a uknaw ram kya a umpaw balyn kha Hezekiah nynh a dosah lei hae paw ccangkheit san um khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh profeh Isaiah tuh Hezekiah Siapharan kalan yn thua zah, “E ccungccaw hae nynh pawtemou a ho hae? Paw kyate mou na kalan oun thua hae?” a cipya. Hezekiah nynh, “Myarya asawnaw Babilon ram kyate nynh ka kalan oun thua hae,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Isaiah nynh, “Na inn kya pawmou a muih hae?” a cipya. Hezekiah nynh, “Ka inn umpaw miakaw pong a muih hae; ka uccaw ccakhungnaw inn kyaze minmin ka dosah lei hae paw ccangkheit san um khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Isaiah nynh Hezekiah kha, “Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngaetua: <verse number="6" style="v" />Na inn kya a umpaw balyn te na minpaaw hae nynh atunin cia a ccakhung hae paw balyn kha Babilon khua lang cciakhaenaw ccyh yn thua cih; pawpaw sanmah cciataw thua lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Na saahku hae paw na ccapaw hae abang tuh ccaring a cciakhae cih hae zah, Babilon siapharan inn kya ryalaw khylan mih tin a reih cih hae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:1-7">Dan 1.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2Si 24.10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sh 36.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh Hezekiah nynh Isaiah kha, “Na hopaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ahoy,” a cipya. Pawccecize aning nynh, “Ka she lungkhu daenaw te khynnaw a um cih,” cite a tua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Ccungccaw hae Lungtangnaw Mue hae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungtangnaw pya oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtangnaw pya oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">cite nae Pachia nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ryalaw ccyh tuh phe a thangsah vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a seinaw mee kha pyaru athua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a seinaw balyn hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">leit ning a teing vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">cite Jerusalem kha byanepaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">hopah oh lah, siatua oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Roi roikheit ccae zah:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ramkaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi kha paccynpah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ah Pachia hanlan laesia ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi kha lawbabin lan raepah oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:3">Mat 3.3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:3">Mar 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Joh 1.23</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.3-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:4-6">Luk 3.4-6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Akhupaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bia athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mua te sangpyng miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuphae athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">akoupaw laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">lawbabin lan rae athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">karynkare a umpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nginsah athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">alangkuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan a muih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> munglae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">phe a ho vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Roi roikheit nynh, “Siakhae oh!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae nynh, “Pawmou ka siakhae cih?” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw balyn hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih phu-enaw tuh ramkaw e</para>
  <para style="q2">haetapaw hawte nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.6-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:10-11">Jam 1.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24-25">1Pe 1.24-25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hy nynh he a mung vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua tuh naan zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">haetapaw tuh akhuakuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">accaccingte ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lonua nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lonua tuh naan zah</para>
  <para style="q2">haetapaw tuh akhuakuh;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama ah Pachia bya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae atyn cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thehoypaw yn phutu, pou Zion,</para>
  <para style="q2">mua ahangpaw kalan kaetua;</para>
  <para style="q1">thehoypaw yn phutu, pou Jerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte na roisawtua, ri leite siatua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah khuapi hae kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“E kya nae Pachia phang um!”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite hopah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dotua, Bawipaw PACHIA tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thungnaw te yn thua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawzung te a uk cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a ryalaw mee tuh amaw kya um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lasung tuh amaw malang a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:11">Isa 62.11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Bya 22.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuurinpaw hawte a tuuphu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">looh a dang cih; tuutaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih te a dua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a by kya a pompae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a taw umpaw tuupinung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zyazyate a cciakhae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:15">Eze 34.15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Joh 10.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tui kha a kuihphe te a tou khopaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kha a khaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">a khaw khopaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping kha tounawpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">a ruin khopaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae te sangpyng hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">zawccu te a khin khopaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou a um?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hynhte cyih cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Muisaw kha tuanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopah khopaw a um tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">A ccangpah khotu te</para>
  <para style="q2">tuanaw a pya khotu a um tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:34">Rom 11.34</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:16">1Ko 2.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hum te mou tuanaw a suelua hae?</para>
  <para style="q2">Hum nynh mou dingnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi kha a ccangpah?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hum nynh mou hawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nythyanaw laanpi kha a muihsah?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minphuin hae heize bangting kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccawpaw tui hawte thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zawccu vawlan a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping hawte nynh tua athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuikoih hae tuh zawbahaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping hawte nynh athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon ramkaw kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">sarangpaw hae tuh maee-ute silawnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lang zaw khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Lebanon ramkaw e thing hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maeetua nawlan zaw khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Minphuin balyn hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw malang tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">paw sanmah thua khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh accakaepaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">pawpaw san a um leipaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">azya huapaw lang nynh a ria hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pachia kha hum te mou</para>
  <para style="q2">na touse kho cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">pawcihawpaw muinsan te mou</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha na khinkhia kho cih?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40.18-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:29">Loc 17.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zohtuh khate tou? Zohtuh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a kuihhae hoypaw nynh rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">sui alaeethyapaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">sui te a thei koute, ngun rui kha a sui.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sui te ngun ahlu a taening leipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amawe cih leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thing hoypaw kha a poku;</para>
  <para style="q1">te akhuliakuh cih leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh kha thadynsah khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuihhae hoypaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw kha a ccungku.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na nyh khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Na thae khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Langmawlya te ae hopah khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Laephi athotakaw lya mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na thaethya khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aning tuh laephi apyngnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">luki khe a haung,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi vawlan a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tungkhipaw hawte nynh athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kha boei hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">tharae daw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">umnawpaw bu hawte a daw;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Athungpaw uktu bawi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sahbung hae zah, laephi uktu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw lang a tangsah hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin tuh ccou sasaw kyalya te</para>
  <para style="q2">hung ccoukupaw aku,</para>
  <para style="q2">lin sasaw kyalya te</para>
  <para style="q1">hung linkupaw aku taraw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">atharui tuh laephi kya tee sasaw kyalya te</para>
  <para style="q1">hung a teepaw aku nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">he a mung hae tuh, karae rou hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khise nynh ccatanphue hawte a mung hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae kha hum te mou</para>
  <para style="q2">nae khinkhia cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae te alokuhpaw hummou a um? cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Athyaapaw Pachia nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahangnaw langkhe dothung oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">muihtua oh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Khuh-e hae khuh hummou a rae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih phupi kha a cciakhaetu hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha accanlu phe ria hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih min te pong a ko hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a thungnaw tuh myaryamaw le zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">huhan te phe abia keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit sanmah zo khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pou Jakob, Pou Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka laanpi kha nyh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka Pachia nynh mue lan ka ccanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlang yn riapah khyh,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou na ho?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na nyh khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Na thae khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi adianaw cia Raetu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning tuh a thawbang khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawzya khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">a hawnaw tuh nythya kho thua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih thawbangpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung pya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawzyapaw kha thungnaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zawthaw hae heize mih thawthang cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a bang cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangvae hae tuh mih thawbang;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaehoikuh hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung thawpaw a hoi cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mosipi hawte mih sake te</para>
  <para style="q2">a zouthung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccue hae ze bang lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccia hae zemah mih thawthang lan khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel hae Byakinpyaku hae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou rili khunglang e ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">daebabi lan um oh lah, ka bya hynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaetua oh; minphuin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung thawpaw hoi hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">naekuh hae sah lah, ho hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">byapianaw hmin kya</para>
  <para style="q1">pynkheihlan tungkuh oh sih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hum nynh mou taetu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nithua langte yn langsakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw rya kha lawsaku khylan a kokuh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning nynh minphuin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kalan ap hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan hae kha a uksah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a thaloi khate rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping lang tangsah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a li khate khisan nynh a mungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccatanphue lang a tangsah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin kha deehui hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">khyndadyh lante laan po a thoih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccu nynh laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccadyhte kyalya nynh a nae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />E hae hynh hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q2">rae zah a cyih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Athotakawnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw she miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a umsahtu tuh hummou athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">masaty a umpaw ka thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nyathyakou a umpaw mah ka thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rili khunglang e ram hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">muih hae zah a rih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi adianaw e</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae tuh thyngkute</para>
  <para style="q1">oun naekuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a sueluakuh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lu kheit te lu kheit bawmkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Na rawthung sah!” cite mimaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw a hoku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lehccama nynh suitheithyapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung a pya, khynlyng te</para>
  <para style="q1">a tudethyapaw nynh lungde vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">naebabing lan atudethyapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung pya zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Sivaw na piadepaw ahoy,” a cipya;</para>
  <para style="q1">te minmin nynh tuh-e tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">anueku khyh nawlan thingkhia te</para>
  <para style="q2">a khiade hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama ka ryalahtu Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka po vae paw Jakob,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh ka banpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Abraham ciihan nynh na thua;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:7">2Sh 20.7</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:23">Jam 2.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nang tuh laephi adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">kae cciakhaepaw na thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang tuh ka ryalahtu nynh na thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae pokuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">kae vua khyh!” cite hopyate</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya asawnaw laephi apaki kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kopaw nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kae tuh na kya ka um keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">na thinphang nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh na Pachia</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thua keiccuze rih nan;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha thawzung kae pya cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae bawm cih, taenaw a hoipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ranglang kuih te nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kae thungkhaw cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tungvaw a thinriapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw te thethyanaw a mue cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae rawse hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw hawte athua cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang ae rawsepaw kha na ccung zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">na muih lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha rawsete rhaw a tho hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw lang marya a tang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na ranglang kuih kha phang kae kyng;</para>
  <para style="q1">“Na thinphang nan sah, nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae bawm cih,” cite ae hopahtupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pou tangkaria Jakob,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin dihpaw Israel,</para>
  <para style="q1">na thinphang nan sah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae bawm cih cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae shawkhawtupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang kha haw hoi zah ahepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccatan tinnawpaw seh athawpaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">kae rae cih; mua hae kha ccatan tin hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na tin cih hae zah na miade cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">sangpyng hae kha vaekang lang</para>
  <para style="q2">na tangsah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin kha na zaw cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">khisan nynh a mung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">khise nynh kaheikalah a nung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungtua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">the na hoysah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ryachi hae te ahobou hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tui kha ccung hae zah, muihku leite</para>
  <para style="q1">tui kanmawte mih dang he arou vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih bya kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thaepah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia, kae nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka vua lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mua roupaw vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">vawpi ka luasah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">accya khe tuidy ka phyhsah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw kha tuili lang ka rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ramrou kha tuisung lang ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ramkaw khe sidar ku,</para>
  <para style="q2">eri ku, mura ku te</para>
  <para style="q1">oliv ku kha ka posah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">te laesia ram kya maeccaw ku te</para>
  <para style="q1">plane ku te tumaeccaw ku kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan ka posah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuhteze nynh, e hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh cyih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a rae cipaw kha ccungccaw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a muih cih hae zah a nyh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a tua cih hae zah a thaethya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh Ccungkia Leinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nae byathan kha oun poukhae oh, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci;</para>
  <para style="q1">atynpaw nae ccaekia hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thuakhae oh, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob phin hae Siapharan nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mih zohtuh hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cciakhae hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn cyihkuh cih paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening oun hopah hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Acyihkuh vae paw kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawte nynh acyiku cipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">oun hopah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhteze nynh kaening nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kong kha kae tuase cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ccungkianaw hae kha kae nyh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhkhyhze yn cyihkuh cih paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening oun hopah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nanning tuh pachia hae</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua oh paw kha kae ny nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">atu koute yn cyihkuh cih paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun hopya tua oh; kaening nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kae rih zah kae siiku nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw khyhze</para>
  <para style="q2">athahpaw kha raetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nanning tuh accakaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua ccaccing oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ryalaw mah accakaepaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning ae pokuh oh paw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">anungsikuhpaw nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thahlang umpaw kha lungthobya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hopah zah yn thua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuanin a thuanaw langte yn thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka min kha yn ko cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ang raetu nynh anglae kha a syde hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh uktu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">anglae hawkhate a syde cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kaening nynh kae ny kho nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi athotakawnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a la ho?</para>
  <para style="q1">“Aning nynh a hopaw tuh akyh,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ho kho nawlan, langmawlya te</para>
  <para style="q1">hum nynh mou a la ho?</para>
  <para style="q2">A hopaw lu kheit san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thaesahtu lu kheit san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae bya a thaepaw lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />E kong hynh kae nynh Zion kya</para>
  <para style="q2">masaty ka hopya,</para>
  <para style="q1">thehoypaw a phutu kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem lang kae nynh ka saw.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuasalama he ka do hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">bya he ka khia hae tuh, minmin laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">bya yn khungpaw tuanaw pyatu</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin tuh accakaepaw cci nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ryalaw tuh alakawpaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih zohtuh hae tuh accakaepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khivae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Minphuin hae hanlan Awnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka bawmpaw ka ryalahtu,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka popaw, a tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka lungrythuapaw tuh hein kya a um;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka muisaw kha a tungvaw ka biasah vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh byading kha</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kalan a thuakhae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17.5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:35">9.35</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.1-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:18-21">Mat 12.18-21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh sia lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a roi mah saw lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi kya a roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thaesah lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a vaemaw umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phaeku kha khya lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thyhthyhte aruapaw maeekhua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">the lan khyh; byading kha lungzite</para>
  <para style="q2">a thuakhae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Laephi vawlan byading</para>
  <para style="q2">a tynsah mawlaezung,</para>
  <para style="q1">a lungthawzya lan khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungroh lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">rili khunglang e ram hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccangpyanaw kha a ngaehoi hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaawlui kha rae zah tharae a dawtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi te laephi kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thuapaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a pazaesakuhtupaw, laephi vaw e</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hiinnaw hy a pyatupaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan a cceihthya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">muisaw a pyatupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh a hopaw tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:24-25">Loc 17.24-25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha dingnaw hanlan kae ko vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na kuih te kae kyng cih zah kae rin cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang na liate minphuin hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q1">byakinnaw ka rae cih zah awnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a umsah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isa 49.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luk 2.32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Loc 13.47</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amohpaw mit hae kha na awsah cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">thongccah hae paw kha thonginn kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">na luesah cih hae zah, mohnaw lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">a haung hae paw kha thonginn kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">na pousah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh ka min nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka phu-enaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ming hae kalan ka pya khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thehoynaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh hae kalan ka pya khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Langmawlya ka la hoty hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccing vae, atu tuh athawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw hae kha ka ho cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e hae a langku mawze,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha kae hopah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Thehoysahnaw Hlaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">hlaw thawpaw sah oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw thehoysahnaw hlaw kha sah oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">rili vawlan cceih hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">rili kya a umpaw balyn nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rili khunglang e ram hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya a um hae paw nynh thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoysahnaw hlawsah hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laesia ram te tuin kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khua hae nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Kedar ccungccaw hae a umnaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">khua hae nynh thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Sela khua a um hae paw nynh thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate hlawsah hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mua dung hae kyate sia hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-enaw pya hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rili khunglang e ram hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha thehoysah hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh rhawkawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hawte toikuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a rawthungpaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw te amaw kha a thinriasaku;</para>
  <para style="q1">thawte sia zah, a rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsete a thungnaw kha a langsaku.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Daebabi lan khaw cia ka um vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw te kamaw phang ka synkuh ung;</para>
  <para style="q1">atu tuh neitangia accihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopi hawte ka sia vae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cyih ccaccing vae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mua hae te sangpyng hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka roh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih kya-e aku hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rousah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaw hae kha laelung lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tangsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuili hae kha ka rousah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mitmoh hae kha mimaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ny lei hae paw laanpi te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cciakhae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mimaw nynh a la ny boi lei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi khate laandy ka hoei cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih malang khe mohnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw lang ka tangsah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">karynkare a umpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nginsah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">E hae hynh ka cyi lanpaw thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha ka vua lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Raekupaw zohtuh hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">doliakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a laeeku hae paw zohtuh hae kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Nang tuh kae pachia nynh na thua,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite a ho hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nulang maeleihsaku athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a mue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nawpan hae paw nanning, thaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih mitmoh hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">do oh lah muihtua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu holeite hummou a mitmoh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka sawpaw ka locceihtu hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">hummou a nawpan?</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka thyaasahpaw ccungccaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">hummou a mitmoh?</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a ryalahtu hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou a mitmoh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning nynh uccaw patae a muih zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyte tuabia thya khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">naw a ngae zemah thae khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel nynh Kaw-einaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh amaw a dingnaw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungrythua, a ccangpyanaw kosah lanpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e a ccangpyanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-esah lanpaw kha a lungrythua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama e minphuin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ming hae nynh a luade hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih balyn mawte akhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">kaangkae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thonginn lungkhu thuruh athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a luesahtu lu kheit san um leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">teipaw saw hawte nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thua vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">luadenaw a um vae ze, “Pyathui!” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nanning lakuze hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q2">e bya hynh a peki cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hum nynh mou malang ccyh hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">pekite a ngae cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hum nynh mou Jakob kha</para>
  <para style="q2">luadetu kalan ap zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel kha damiah hae kalan a pya?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kaening nynh a tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kae seipaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a pyapaw thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh a laanpi kha zui ry khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccangpyanaw kha zui khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze maee lang ruapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinrianaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawtuk thinrianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tungvaw a ccawsah;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih pepan balyn khe maee a soi zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh thaethya khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">maee nynh a u hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thinlung kya pawlangria khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh A Ccungccaw hae A Poukhae hae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Jakob, pou Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae raetupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha kae shawkhaw vae keiccuze rih nan;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha na min te kae ko vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh ka kya-e nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tui alepaw kha he na ke vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya ka um cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">vawpi hae kha he na ke vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">ae vu lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">maee lungkhu he na ccia vae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">ae u lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">maeephu nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae u kho lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae Khumtu Israel Pachia</para>
  <para style="q1">Athyaapaw nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang kha shawkhaw khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">Izip hae kha ka vua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Ethiopia te Seba kha mah ka vua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang tuh ka muihnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">aphutepaw na thua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">sawtuanaw kae pya zah kae sungsah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze nang kha khum khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kha ka vua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang na hiinnaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae kha ka vua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rih nan, na kya phang ka um;</para>
  <para style="q2">nithua langte na ciihan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka cciakhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">niccaw langte nang kha kae suelua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Palung lang hae kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Minmin kha saw oh,” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">ka hopah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">alia lang hae kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kang nan oh; ka ccapaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw kyate cciakhae oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccanung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi adianaw kyate cciakhae oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />minmin tuh ka min te</para>
  <para style="q2">ko athua hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka phu-enaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka raeku hae paw nynh thua hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mit a hoi zemah ngawmuih leipaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">nakaring a hoi zemah nawthae leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha cciakhae oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minphuin balyn tuh pynkheihlan</para>
  <para style="q2">sueluakuh hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae tuh pumkuh hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q2">Minmin laku e hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q1">atu acyihkuhpaw e hynh la hoty zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a la cyihkuh vae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">aening kya oun la hopah ty?</para>
  <para style="q2">Minmin nynh a sei khyhnaw hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">langsaku khylan mih ccaekia hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thuakhae hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh thae hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“E tuh ahme,” cite ho hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae tuh Pachia ka thuapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nae nyh oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">nae zyn nawlan oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning tuh ka ccaekia hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">kae po oh paw ka ryalahtu nynh na thua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae ka mawze pachia um boi khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ka koute mah um vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae kyalya nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw laelan khumtu um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka la hodaety thyhte kae khum oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh phe ka la hoty vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh lyaze nanning laku kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw pachia um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning tuh ka ccaekia hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae tuh Pachia ka thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia ka thua zungzae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kuih kyate a lue khopaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pawpaw mah um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ryalaw kha hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q2">yn khee kho cih?</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nanning ae shawkhawtu oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">Athyaapaw nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nanning hanlan Babilon lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka saw cih zah, khua koihnawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">accaw hae kha pong ka khya cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">Khaldi hae nynh lungtuate</para>
  <para style="q1">a siaruanaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuinaw roi lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Athyaapaw na Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Raetu, na Siapharan nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh rili lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi a raetupaw te tuileih lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi a raetupaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />marangle te marang, rhawkaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawthungpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a thuakhaetupaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh khuliakuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">thokuh kho khyh hae, minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maeekhua the hawte zosah athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Langmaw lyaze acyihkuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">liathui nan vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">khawlyaze acyihkuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tua nan vae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uccaw thawpaw kha ka cyih cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh atu yn langkuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na muih cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ramkaw kya laanpi ka rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia ram kya vaw ka luasah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sarangpaw hae, suizaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">kalauh pavaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kha saw yn tua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize ka popaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a nia lan hae cite,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramkaw kya tui ka pya hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">laesia ram kya vaw ka luasahpya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kamaw hanlan ka raekupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e minphuin nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw thehoysahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a siakhae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama, pou Jakob,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang nynh ka kalan saw na sang khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Israel, na tungvaw ka lungthang vae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maee-ute silawnaw lang na mangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na tuu kha ka kalan nae cciakhae khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">silawnaw raete saw nae tua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahlu yn pya, cite na phupaw kae risah khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">mynkhuhpaw kha yn pya, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">na thaw kae bangsah khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A-epaw ccazung kha phua te</para>
  <para style="q2">nae repah khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">silawnawpaw athopaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka byn lan nae dang khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na seinaw khate ka phupaw na risah;</para>
  <para style="q2">na hoyleinaw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thaw nae bangsah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kae tuh kamaw hanlan athua keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">na cyiseimenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ae thyaasahpaw Pachia ka thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae seinaw kha ka liathui vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kae hynh sei yn betua,</para>
  <para style="q2">byapiazung lang cceih sih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na sei leinaw kha na langsaku nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">na byathan kha yn thuakhae tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Masaty lya-e na minpaaw nynh a la sei,</para>
  <para style="q2">na sazae hae nynh ka tungvaw a la mesei hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze beikinnthyaa kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">bawi hae tungvaw ka lua ka aethua,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob kha ronaw kalan ka ap zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel kha thethya ka ccousah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel tungvaw Pachia Hythuanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu Pou Jakob,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka popaw Israel, atu ngaetua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang ae raetupaw, vue lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae raetupaw te ae bawm cih paw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka ryalahtu pou Jakob,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka popaw Jeshurun, rih nan.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize tui ahawpaw ram kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tui ka bu cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aroupaw laephi kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">vaw ka luasah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">na ciihan hae tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ka muisaw kha ka bu cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccaaw na no hae tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hythuanaw kha ka bu cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin tuh hinlalyhpaw lonua hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a toih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">vawkhu kin e su ku hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a toih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lu kheit nynh, “Kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q1">nynh ka thua,” cite a ho cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw lu kheit nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob min kha a phukuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw lu kheit nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite azeikuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel min kha a phukuh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel Siapharan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a Shawkhawtu,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh masaty te</para>
  <para style="q2">nyathyakou nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw laelan</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw pachia um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:12">Isa 48.12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Bya 1.17</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:13">22.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kae yn lopaw hummou a um?</para>
  <para style="q2">Aning nynh hotua sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">langsakuh tua sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka malang nungtua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Langmaw acyihkuh vae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">malang yn cyihkuh cih paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hummou a ho?</para>
  <para style="q1">Yn cyihkuh cih paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening oun hopya tua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rih nan oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thinphang nan sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">kae hopah khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Nanning tuh ka ccaekia hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Kamaw laelan ccangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia a um tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccangpaw Lungpi um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit sanmah ka nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Athane leipaw Zohtuh Beiknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zohtuh a raetu hae balyn tuh accakaepaw nynh thua hae, minmin nynh mih lungrythuapaw uccaw hae tuh thanenaw um khyh; mih ccaekia hae tuh ngawmuih khyh hae zah thaethya khyh hae. Tukeiccuze minmin tuh maethyanaw a mue cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Hoynaw a rae kho leipaw zohtuh khyhze pachia kha hum nynh mou a rae? <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuh-e zohtuh a beik hae paw balyn tuh maethyanaw a mue cih hae; tuh-e a raetu hae tuh ccungccaw maw kha nynh hung athua hae. Mih balyn te sueluakuh hae sah lah, thadyn hae sah; thinphang bungzoute a um cih hae zah maethyanaw a mue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sivasuhpaw nynh hae kha suh khylan, maeephu lungkhu uing zah, a kuih thawzung thuate, khynlyng te a deih, a vuelaw zah a thawzyabung, tui neih khyh zah a thawbang. <verse number="13" style="v" />Lehccama nynh aring ring zah syntawnawpaw te a syntaw, te a zunghe khate rae zah, kompa khate syntawnaw a rae; hminthyaa kya nung khylan ccungccaw muinsan lante ccungccaw puithya hawkhate a rae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh ramkaw e sidar ku khyhze ahoypaw phaesi ku khyhze maeccaw ku kha nge zah a mang. Sidar ku kha lin zah, tuh-e aku tuh khuaatui nynh a lesah thung. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh tuh-e aku tuh maeething lang mang kho athua. Tuh-e aku kya-e abang kha lah zah amaw maee eku nawlan a mang, maeetua zah sanlou kha a thou. Te pachia kha raekuh zah a beik, zohtuh lang suekuh zah, tuh-e zohtuh malang khe a bakhung. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e thing angankuh kha maeetua nawlan a mang; tuhlaepaw angankuh khate sawthungkuh zah phe byn lan a ae. Maee eku nawlan mang zah, “Alei, kae tuh ka khualung vae, maee ka ekuh kho vae!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw thing khate pachia, a zohtuh kha raekuh zah, bakhungnua zah a beik; tuh-e kalan khe sawsang zah, “Ka pachia na thua keiccuze beih yn khumtua!” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh nyh khyh zah thaethya khyh; pawccecize a muih kho khyh nawlan a mit kha masisah zah, a thaethya khyh nawlan a thinlung kha marae a ping. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Thing angankuh kha maeething lang ka mang zah sanlou ka thounaw, saw ka thungnah zah ka ae. Te alaepaw thing kha anungsikuhpaw lang ka rae cih tou? Thingtung malang khe ka bakhung lan accan tou?” cipaw tuasethyanaw, hawnaw te nythyanaw hoi khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning nynh buhhaw kha a ae; angaeepaw thinlung nynh amaw kha a cciakhaesei vae, amaw te amaw kha khumkuh kho khyh, “Ka ranglang kuih kya umpaw e uccaw hynh lingkunaw thua khyh tou?” cipaw nyh kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Israel kha Ning Khyh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pou Jakob, pou Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2">e uccaw hae hynh ning nan,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ryalahtu nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha kae raeku, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ryalahtu nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Israel, nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ning lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na cyiseimenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maeking hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ka zosah vae zah, na seinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tuihu hawte ka zosah vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kalan yn ki ccavae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae shawkhaw vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pou vaawlui hae, hlawsah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e tuh phe a rae vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi akhunaw hmin hae, siatua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou mua hae, pou tuhpi hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">thingku miakaw, hlawsahte roisawtua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob kha phe shawkhaw vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel liate amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">thehoysah athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang ae Shawkhawtu,</para>
  <para style="q2">vue lungkhu kya nang ae raetupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh atyn-are a raetu</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui kha ka makhaete tharae ka daw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha kamaw ccaccei nynh ka rae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kuihdothya hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya a ho hae paw kha ka roh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">beidin athya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ngaeesah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ahaw hae paw kha ka buleih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih hawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeenaw lang ka tangsah;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:20">1Ko 1.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ka ryalahtupaw bya kha ka tynsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka locceihtu nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a hodaepaw kha ka ccingsah;</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem khua kha, “Na kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw a um cih,” ka cipya,</para>
  <para style="q2">Judah khuapi hae kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nanning kha sakthui na thua cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">arohpaw kha ka thadynsah</para>
  <para style="q2">thui cih,” ka cipya hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />rili kha, “Karae na rou cih—</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya-e vawpi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rousah cih hae,” ka cipya;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sairas kha, “Nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tuurintu na thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka eenaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccingsah cih,” ka cipya;</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem kha, “Nang tuh raethui</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua cih,” ka cipya;</para>
  <para style="q1">beikinn kha, “Na thonaw aleihpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bing athua cih,” ka cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:23">2Sh 36.23</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:2">Ezr 1.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh A Nawpaw Sairas</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Sairas kha</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan lang chitui a thuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae kha tae khylan te</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan hae boeining kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khah khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">koikua hae kha khaw leite</para>
  <para style="q2">thuakaw hae kha hung khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">Sairas a ranglang kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kyng zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopyapaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na malang ka cceih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae kha phe nging lan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tuphae cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">sohin thuakaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zoihtatyh lan ka khya cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaccaw hae kha ka khya cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />mohnaw lungkhu e sisua hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">alang leinaw hmin kya thuruhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">hoirumnaw kha kae pya cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhteze nynh kae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q1">na min te ae kotupaw Israel Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thua cipaw nae nyh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu Jakob te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka popaw Israel hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">na min te kae ko zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ny khyh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">na min thawpaw kha kae phu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">te ccangpaw um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw laelan ccangpaw Pachia um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">kae hynh nae ny khyh zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">thungnaw kae pya,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuhteze nynh nithua lang e hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">niccaw lang e hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw laelan humhung mah</para>
  <para style="q2">um khyh cipaw a nyh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Awnaw kha ka rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw kha mah ka rae,</para>
  <para style="q1">hiin hoynaw kha ka rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyanaw kha mah ka rae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">atyn-are balyn hynh ka rae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou vaawlui hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">avaw langte khuaarawtua,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui hae nynh dingnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">khuaa lang rawsah hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi hungkuh sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khumnaw kha pouthung sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw kha mah yn pothung sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh ka rae vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaw a Raetupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawsepaw hanlan te</para>
  <para style="q1">ang raetupaw kha a rawsepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi ang hanlan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">Anglae nynh amaw a raetupaw kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pawmou na rae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Na raepaw hynh kyngnawpaw um khyh,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite a hopah zawtou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:20">Rom 9.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A paaw kha, “Paw ccungccaw mou</para>
  <para style="q2">na saah?” cite khia zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a nung kha, “Paw ccaaw mou na saah?”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite a khiatupaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya lan kou um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia Athyaapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel a Raetupaw nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccemou ka ccaaw hae kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae khia oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccemou ka ryalawnaw kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaw nae pya oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Laephi kha ka rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw kha ka rae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kuih te vaawlui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tharae ka daw zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui kya a umpaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kaw ka pya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sairas kha dingnaw liate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka langsaku vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">a laanpi balyn kha ka lawsah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh ka khuapi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a rae cih zah, amee khyhze</para>
  <para style="q2">lasung kha lawku leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kyng hae paw ka ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a luesah cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip sisua, Ethiopia ram e kungkunaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">mih pynrua hangpaw Seba hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kungkunaw hae paw uccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">na kalan a thua cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na uccaw lang a tang cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae zui cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">sivawrui te khiikute</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na malang a bakhung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha, “Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw kya rou nynh a um,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e Pachia laelan</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpaw Pachia um khyh,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ae bohkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pou Israel Pachia, Khumtu,</para>
  <para style="q2">thanccingte, nang tuh amaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a rekuhpaw Pachia nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zohtuh a raetu hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw mue hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ngaeangthua,</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan thethyanaw a ccou hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw khumnaw khate a khum;</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning tuh maethyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeangthuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae cia na mue lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaawlui a raetupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha rae zah a tynsahpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha alakaw lan rae leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahysuepaw nynh a um nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a raetupaw Pachia nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw laelan ccangpaw Pachia um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aphiruh lante bya ka ho khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">amohnaw hmin kya ka ho khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kae hynh alakawpaw hmin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ccung oh,” cite Jakob ciihan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hopah khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh byaccing kha ka ho,</para>
  <para style="q2">akyhpaw kha ka ho.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh hae nynh Babilon Khum Kho Khyh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanning nynh sueluakuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan oun cceih oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">a hiinhy hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q1">oun naeku tua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Thing te raekuhpaw mih zohtuh hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">khiakhaekute a khum kho</para>
  <para style="q2">leipaw pachia kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">saw a sang hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hawnaw hoi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nae byathan kha oun thuakhae</para>
  <para style="q2">oh lah, hotua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh mih tuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan hotua hae sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">E byathan hynh langmawlya te</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a la ho?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q2">khawlya te a la hodae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka la ho khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kamaw laelan ccangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae tuh adingpaw Pachia te</para>
  <para style="q2">Khumtu nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw laelan humhung mah um khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Laephi adianaw e ccungccaw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kalan oun maeleihkuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khum na thua cih oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw Pachia um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ccungccaw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka malang ccukharu a tung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih munglae raveihte</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a kinkuh cih hae,” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw ccaccei nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinkute ka ho vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh ka mung kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">dingnaw te toikuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn kithui cih leipaw bya nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:11">Rom 14.11</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:10-11">Fil 2.10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya rou nynh dingnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung a um, cite a ho cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tungvaw mih thinriapaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kalan a cceih cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a mue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> liate Israel ciihan balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">taenaw a mue cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">mih phu-e cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babilon pachia hae tuh a pu vae hae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Nebo tuh a khya vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih zohtuh hae kha loramsaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">sahiin vawlan phusah athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning nynh na la phu oh paw khah-e hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawbangpaw sahiin hae vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">phupaw ripaw hawte phusah athua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zohtuh hae tuh khya hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan a pu vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh mimaw phupaw aripaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khumkuh kho khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mimaw kha heize kyng hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pou Jakob ciihan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel ciihan a laehy hae paw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bya kha ngaetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">na pui takaw oh te kae do-oih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae nung vue kyate kae dua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nae kum tang zah nae sang apaw cia heize</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh nae Pachia ka thua zah</para>
  <para style="q1">kae do-oih cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae raekuh vae oh zah, kae do-oih cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae bawm cih oh zah kae khum cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kae kha hum te mou nae losakuh cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ngansakuh cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Hum te mou nae khinkhia cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae losakuh cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Phuabu kya-e sui kha hysahte</para>
  <para style="q2">patae boh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngun kha zawccu te a khin hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">sui kha pachia lang a raethyapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hoh hae zah a raesah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tetuh minmin nynh bakhungnua hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a beik hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e pachia tuh mih raw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">khangkuh hae zah a puih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">te a umnaw hmin kya nung hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya a thadyn;</para>
  <para style="q1">a umnaw kyate nuekuh kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Lukhakheit nynh tuh-e kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">siaruate a ko zemah oi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsawnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung kha mah khum khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou kaw-ei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh ning nan oh lah, hoyte tua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae thinlung kya syntaw oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />langmawlya acyihkuh vae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw hae kha liathui oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize kae tuh Pachia nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw Pachia um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae tuh Pachia nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae te alokuhpaw ccangpaw Pachia</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangkheit san um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Athotakawnaw kyate athangnaw cia,</para>
  <para style="q2">langmawlya te rae athua loh leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw hae kha hote,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Ka eenaw tuh atyn cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka paccynnaw kha ka ccingsah cih,” ka ci,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nithua langte saw a aethyapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pavaw sa kheit athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka eenaw ccingsah khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">pisepaw lu kheit kha</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw ram kyate ka ko.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka ho vae paw kha ka ccingsah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka paccyn vae paw kha ka cyih cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih lungkhung zah luenaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">asawkuh hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya hynh ngaetua oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka kya-e luenaw kha anaenaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">kae cciakhae vae, saw vae khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka khumnaw tuh accyh ro vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">khumnaw kha Zion khe ka nung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka phu-enaw tuh Israel hanlan athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon A Maethyanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou liaccady Babilon,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn rungbung lah, vuiping kya haungtua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou ccanung Babilon,</para>
  <para style="q2">laekhu khe bawitungkhung leite haungtua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang kha ninccehoynung cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ko na thua vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47.1-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:1-14:23">Isa 13.1—14.23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:1">Jer 50.1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:64">51.64</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungmia kha lawkuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccathae kha miatua,</para>
  <para style="q2">mae bongkupaw kha lyngku tua,</para>
  <para style="q1">na angkiccua kha khahku tua,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccu kya-e kha thyngkuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vawpi kha zuatua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Boeining bongku leite</para>
  <para style="q2">na sasete na um cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na maethyanaw kha muih athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Phu kae lah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit sanmah ka haang lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kaening oun Shawkhawtupaw a min tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pou ccanung Babilon,</para>
  <para style="q2">daebabi lan haung lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mohnaw lungkhu lang teetua!</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ram hae bawinung cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ko vae lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae tungvaw ka thinria,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rho tungvaw ka lua ka aethua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha na kuih kya kae pya hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tungvaw thawccinaw na hoi khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih kum tang hae paw tungvaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phupaw myarya ripaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na phusah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang nynh, “Kae tuh bawinung lang</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae ka tang cih,” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">na tuakuh zah, e uccaw hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thinlung kya na nung khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nyathya yn cyihkuh cih paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na tua khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze hoysahnaw kyalya</para>
  <para style="q2">a rypaw nang, e bya hynh ngaetua,</para>
  <para style="q2">khyndadyh lan na um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kamaw kyalya nynh ka um,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw laelan ming hae</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung mah um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nomaenung hawte ka um lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaaw hae nynh chitawnaw mah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tung lan khyh,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">na thinlung kya na tuaku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:7-8">Bya 18.7-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang nynh naawthya hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">mitleihthya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na mang hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nin kheit lungkhu sosoh kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaaw hae chinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">nomae lang tangnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">e phuin ning hynh nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw ae thuanua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hoyleinaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengante na um;</para>
  <para style="q1">“Humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">yn muih khyh,” na ciku.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na hawnaw te na nynaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae cciakhaesei vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Kamaw kyalya nynh ka um,</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw laelan ming hae</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung mah um khyh,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite na thinlung kya na tuaku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naawthyanaw te dee kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsawnaw nynh ae thuanua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na thungkhawku kho leipaw shethya nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae thuanua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na la tua leipaw ronaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaekheihmawte ae thuanua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ngawphue lya mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte na la zuakupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">mitleihthyanaw te naawthyanaw hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">tynkaring lan thadyntua,</para>
  <para style="q1">taenaw kha mue mah poh na mue kho,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinphang rinaw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">poh na pya kho hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuanaw pyakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">patae na rae oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">phe na bang vae oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui kong ccangkute</para>
  <para style="q2">beidin dothya hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">awsi kong ccangkute</para>
  <para style="q2">beidin dothya hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">na tungvaw acyihkuh lanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sawpaw sah thawpaw takyh kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a hodaethya hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thadyn hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha ae khum oh sah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minmin tuh athupaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">thua hae zah, maee nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ccung lan a u cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">maeephupi kyate mimaw te mimaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khumkuh kho khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">sosakunaw lanpaw maeehue</para>
  <para style="q2">thyhsan um vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">eku lanpaw maee mah</para>
  <para style="q2">um vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang te rya na lahkheih oh paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ngawphue lyate</para>
  <para style="q1">kung na kukheih oh paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw tuhcite nynh athua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih laanpi raveih kya</para>
  <para style="q2">khiavuikuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae khum lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Raetu te Shawkhawtu Pachia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Jakob ciihan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel cite minphu athua hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah tuisung kyate a pou hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh ngaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te bya na kinkuh oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia kha kae beik na ci oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama byaccing te,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahme te na beik khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccecize minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw khuapi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a um hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia kha a doliakuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hae paw nynh kae thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e Pachia min tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua, a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Acyihkuh vae paw uccaw hae kong kha</para>
  <para style="q2">langmawlya mawte phe ka la hodae vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e uccaw hae tuh ka khalang kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">pou zah, ny lante ka la rae vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">te tuh-e hae tuh palou ka cyih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a um vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang tuh a lungkhungpaw na thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na nging tuh sivaw, na terui tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">sohin nynh thua cipaw ka ny keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka zohtuh nynh e hynh a cyih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka suhpaw zohtuh te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka laeepaw zohtuh nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh a cyih,” cite na ho khyh nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">e hae hynh langmawlya mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ka ho vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e a um mawze nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe kae hopya vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />E hae hynh phe na thae vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">e hae balyn hynh atu dotua;</para>
  <para style="q1">ming hae kalan na hopah lan khyh hae tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Atu te malang vae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">uccaw thawpaw, na ny loh leipaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuruhpaw uccaw hae kha kae hopah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />E hae hynh langmawlya te rae leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">atu te rae athua hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">“E hae hynh ka ny vae paw nynh thua,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite na ho kho khyh nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">atunin athua maw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hae kong hynh papin na thae boi khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thae boi khyh zah na nyh boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">langmawlya te na nakaring kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hungpya na thua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize nang tuh kharouhmaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zyn lan na um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">na pui takaw te ccungccaw doutu</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ko na thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kae tuh ka min hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw kha ka ngaesang zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka min thehoysah nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw kha na hanlan ka synku,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhteze nynh nang kha kae vua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang kha akaw-aleih kae syntawtua,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama ngun hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">kae syntawtua khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">teingnaw maeephupi kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">kae syntawtua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka min hanlan nynh ka cyi,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou ka min tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">thethyasah athua cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka phu-enaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ming hae ka pya lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou Jakob, ka kokupaw Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya hynh yn ngaepya tua:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh Pachia nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh masaty ka thua zah</para>
  <para style="q1">nyathyakou mah ka thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Isa 44.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:17">Bya 1.17</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:13">22.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka kuih nynh laephi athonaw</para>
  <para style="q2">aleihpaw kha tynsah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ranglang kuih nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kha tharae a daw;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaaw te lae kha he ka ko hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pekite palou a thadyn hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae balyn te sueluakuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Minmin laku e hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q1">e uccaw hae hynh langmawlya te a la hodae?</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha a sungsah;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh Babilon khua khe</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a eenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccingsah cih zah, a kuih nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Khaldi hae kha a rawse cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamaw ccaccei nynh amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hopah zah ka ko vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kha ka cciakhae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a laanpi kya a laan a sui a ua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kalan yn naekuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">e bya hynh ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Athotakawnaw kyate aruh lante</para>
  <para style="q2">bya ka ho khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e acyiku ccyh lya mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya kae ka um vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Atu tuh Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae te a Muisaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">oun sawkheih vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang ae Shawkhawtu,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">na Pachia nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang na hoynaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ccangpahtupaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">nang nynh zui lan accanpaw laanpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ae cciakhaetupaw nynh ka thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka kawbya hae kha la zui vae ii!</para>
  <para style="q2">Tetuh na hoirumnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">vawpi hawte athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na taenaw tuh rili tuileih hawte athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />na ciihan tuh laesia zeih acih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccaaw na no hae tuh rili kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">lungpyng zeih acih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih min kha papin vua thua lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka malang te ro thua lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Babilon kyate pou oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Khaldi hae kyate ccue oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e kong tuh lungtua siaruate</para>
  <para style="q2">ho oh lah siakhae oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi adianaw cia thaesah oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a ryalahtu Jakob kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a shawkhaw vae!” cite ho oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:4">Bya 18.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin kha laesia ram kya</para>
  <para style="q2">he a cciakhae hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuihaw khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin hanlan lungpi kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">tui a luasah;</para>
  <para style="q2">lungpi kha poh hungsakuh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">tui a pousah.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Ccungccaw hoylei</para>
  <para style="q2">hae paw hanlan daenaw um khyh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:21">Isa 57.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Minphuin hae hanlan Awnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou rili khunglang e ram hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya hynh ngaetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">asawnaw lang e ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyte ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka pui mawze yn ko vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nung vue kya ka um lyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka min yn phu vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 1:5">Jer 1.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka khalang kha thaloi ahepaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">yn rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih mynlyh kyakhe yn thuruh;</para>
  <para style="q2">a akpaw the lang yn rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a the bawng lungkhu khe yn thuruh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Israel, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ryalahtu nynh na thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw liate ka phu yn esah</para>
  <para style="q2">cih hae,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kae nynh, “Accakaepaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka banghan vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thawzung kha accakaepaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">alakawpaw hanlan ka manghan vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah ka byathan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ryalaw mee lasung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Pachia kya a um,” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaw rya a lahtu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tang khylan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob kha amaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">kikhae khylan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel hae nynh amaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a sueluaku nawlan hae thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nung vue kya yn la rae vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtuanaw ka ccou zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Pachia tuh ka thawzung lang a tang vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Jakob phin kha hangthung khylan te</para>
  <para style="q2">ahiinhypaw Israel hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya hawte bua thuasah khylan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ryalahtu lang na tang lanpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">myaryamaw adihpaw ryalaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khumnaw tuh laephi adianaw cia a thua nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha minphuin hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw lang kae rae cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:32">Luk 2.32</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Loc 13.47</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26.23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ming hae nynh dothatheih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae nynh a hua hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">uktu hae seepaw kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Shawkhawtu te</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopyapaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nang ae potupaw Israel Pachia Athyaapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungzipaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> liate</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan hae nynh a muih cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a thadyn cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan ccapaw hae nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a beik cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Zion Ccaaw hae kha Inn lang Kikhaenaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Maehoy pyanaw ccyh kya na bya kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kae thaepya vae, khumnaw nin kya</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae bawm vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha kae thungkhaw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e ram kha tynsah khylan te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw phe adaepaw rho laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">neeku khylan nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinnaw lante kae rae vae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:2">2Ko 6.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thongccah hae paw kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pou oh,” ka cipah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mohnaw lungkhu um hae paw kha,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Oun langkuh oh,” ka cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh laanryng khe</para>
  <para style="q2">aepaw a muihkuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahangnaw otung hae vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ramnonaw hmin kha a muihkuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mih vuelaw lan khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tuihaw lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya sopaw khivae te khuanin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsawnaw pya lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyaumsahnaw a hoitupaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a cciakhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuidy pe langkhe a cciakhae cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:16-17">Bya 7.16-17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mua hae balyn kha laanpi lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tangsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka laanluepi hae kha hangthung athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dotua, minmin tuh asawnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">dotua, palung langte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">niccaw langte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Sai-en<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sai-en: </char><char style="ft">Izip alia lang umpaw khuapi, Jew hae patae a la umnaw hae khua.</char></note> khua kyate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua cih hae, a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pou vaawlui hae, lungtuate hlawsah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou laephi, na lungtua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou mua hae, lungtuate hlawsah oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengannaw pya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a teing hae paw a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethya a umsah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Zion nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn vua vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka Bawipaw nynh yn ning vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nopinung nynh a matei a zusahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw kha a ning kho cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">A saahkupaw a ccaaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyaumsah leite a um kho cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">A nung nynh a ccaaw kha a la ning heize,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae ning lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dotua, ka kuihphe vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae zei vae;</para>
  <para style="q2">khualungrua tuh ka malang po a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na ccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aro maw oun thua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae rohtu hae paw tuh na kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaring a pou cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pepan balyn kha ngawrandotua;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin balyn tuh sueluakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na kalan oun thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh a hiinpaw ka thua thyhte,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q1">apuithyapaw boeining te</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaan hawte na ccaan cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">akaepaw liaccanung hawkhate</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccaan cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Arohpaw te ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">phe adaepaw hmin,</para>
  <para style="q2">arohpaw na ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">khuasahpaw milu alung keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">myaryamaw ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a tuh-eihkuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae laangtu hae kha nang te</para>
  <para style="q2">a sawkuh vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngaethya rawkhuite na um lya</para>
  <para style="q2">a puipaw na ccaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na thaenaw khe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“E hmin kya ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw myaryamaw alung,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae um nawlan hmin oun raepah,”</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ci cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh na thinlung kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Hum nynh mou e ccaaw hae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn saahpah hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh ka ccaaw hae chih vae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw a saahkuh lei vae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang lang a dee hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a nung hae paw nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze hum nynh mou</para>
  <para style="q2">e ccaaw hae hynh yn thuakhae hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka makhae rou nynh ka um vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hae hynh tei kyate mou</para>
  <para style="q1">oun thua hae?” cite na ci cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">aro mawze minphuin hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih ka hangthung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka alan kha ka sae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccapaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih by kya a pom cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccanung hae kha mih raw vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">khangkute a cciakhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Siapharan hae tuh nang ae do-oihtu</para>
  <para style="q2">na paaw hae athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharannung hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae kuakuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na nung hae athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Na malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ae bakhungpah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccu kya-e vuiping kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae pheihpah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tetuh kae hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae nyh vae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae yn ngaehoikuh hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw mue lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Luadepaw uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">athawsaepaw kuih kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">lawde kho athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q2">A kyng hae paw miding hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a rysawthahpaw kuih kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">luesah kho athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">A thawsaepaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a luade hae paw kha heize</para>
  <para style="q2">law athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a rysawthahpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a luadepaw uccaw kha luesah athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize nang ae rawsepaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rawse cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccaaw hae kha ka khum cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang ae tuaa ae sah hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ngesaw toulou kha ka aesakuh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">misutui nia hawte mih chii toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a neih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tetuh ccungccaw balyn nynh kae hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang ae Khumtu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka thuapaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae Shawkhawtu,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob Pachia Athungpaw ka thuapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae nung kha ccanglang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cciasahnawpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">myakunawpaw ccaw kha teimou a um?</para>
  <para style="q2">Laebah ka um keiccuze laebah</para>
  <para style="q1">yn umsahtupaw hum kalan mou</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kha kae zua oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae zua khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Nae seinaw keiccuze nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha zua na thua oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae cyiseimenaw keiccuze nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae nung kha ccanglang ka cciasah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kae he ka thua tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou ccungccaw a um khyh?</para>
  <para style="q1">He ka ko hae tuh pawccemou</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit nynh sanmah yn oi khyh hae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh shawkhaw kho lei lan ciate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih adyn tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhkhyhze luesahnaw lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">huhan ka hoi khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Rili kha kaw ka pya zah karae ka rousah,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaw hae kha laesia ram lang ka tangsah;</para>
  <para style="q1">tui a um khyh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ngasaw hae tuh athuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui kanmawte a chih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaawlui kha amanpaw boeining</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lawsakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">buriboei kha ka bongsaku.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ryalahtu hae Zakawsangsakunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lungthangpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bya te thawzung pyathya nawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpya thyanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">munglae kha yn pya vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Awkhua takyh kya kae kha yn tho,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccawccangkuhpaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">bya ngae khylan yn tho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka nakaring kha yn uasah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae nynh mah kaw-ei leite</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang ka sihtawkuh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae yn zia hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ke ka tuapakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka khawming yn khaee hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka byaki ka tuapyaku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Saryakunaw kyate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuing te thoikunaw kyate thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka mae kha ccanglang ka hawi khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mat 26.67</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mar 14.65</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn bawm keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">thethyanaw ka ccou khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze ka mae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rihlung hawte ka nung zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw ka ccou lan khyh</para>
  <para style="q2">cipaw ka ny;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kae kha thyaa yn ccousahpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka pe a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hum nynh mou yn rawse ngan cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Thadynkhaeku tua oh sih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae yn rawse hae paw tuh hum hae mou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Yn rawsetua hae sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50.8-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:33-34">Rom 8.33-34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kae yn bawmtupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou sei yn be ngan cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih balynte boeining hawte a pue cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">laehaw nynh marya a ae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nanning laku kyaze hummou</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalahtupaw bya kha a ngae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Mohnaw kya cceih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw a hoi leipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha doliakuh sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a Pachia kya reihpekuh sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanning balyn tuh maee a tuatu,</para>
  <para style="q2">maee a ruasahtu nynh na thua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae maeesoi kya te na tua oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">maee lungkhu khe cceih oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuaasahkunaw teingte na toukuh cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">E hynh nanning nynh ka kuih kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">na mue lan oh paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Ccungccaw hae hanlan Hythuanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dingnaw lang a zui hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a ccung hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya hynh ngaetua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nanning nae pounaw oh lungpi te</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning ae thaebianaw oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkarung kha tuatua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nae paaw Abraham te</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning ae saahtu oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">Sarah kha tuatua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">Abraham ka la ko lya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a makhae nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama hythua ka pya zah</para>
  <para style="q2">patae lang ka rae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Zion kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengannaw a pya cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw a um leinaw a hmin balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengannaw a pya cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ramkaw kha Eden hawte a rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a laesia ram kha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khokhu hawte a rae cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion kyakhe lungtua lungpawnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtuabya honaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">hlawsahnaw roi kha a um cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka bya hynh ngaetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka minphuin hae, ka hopaw hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyte ngaetua oh; pawccecize ka kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpyanaw a toikuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka byading tuh ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw lang a tang cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kya-e luenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">arangte kae thuakhae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khumnaw tuh pou vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kuih nynh ccungccaw hae kha a uk cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">rili khunglang e ram hae nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">yn ngaehoikuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih kha a doliaku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaawlui khuh dotua oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akaw lang e laephi kha mah dotua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui tuh maeekhuh hawte a zo cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh boeining hawte a pue cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi vawlan a um hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maseih hawte a chih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama ka khumnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae atyn cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kya-e luenaw tuh thang boi vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dingnaw kha nyh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thinlung kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccangpyanaw a hoi hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bya hynh ngaetua oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">ming hae nynh sei ae be oh ze rih nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ae sarya oh zemah nae lungriathae nan sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize laehaw nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">boeining hawte a ae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ripaw nynh tuuming boei hawte a ae cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama ka kya-e luenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae atyn cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khumnaw tuh she takyh po atyn cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih,</para>
  <para style="q2">thoku tua, thokuh lah thawzung lawku tua!</para>
  <para style="q1">khawlya e langmaw she lya</para>
  <para style="q2">hawte thoku tua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Rahab kha zoihtatyh lan pae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nakaa-hupi kha a thuingtupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw na thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Myarya akhupaw rili kha</para>
  <para style="q2">karae rousah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a shawkhawpaw ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">rili a zua nawlan hae cite</para>
  <para style="q2">akhupaw rili kha</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi lang a raetupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw na thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a luesah hae paw tuh a ki cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hlawsah biate Zion khuapi a thua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw lungtuanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lukhung kha a khungkuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtua lungpawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a mue cih hae zah, ngaethyanaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">riathaenaw tuh azo vae cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning kha ngaengannaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ae pyatu oh paw tuh kamaw nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">a chih cih paw ccungccaw, lonua hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a naanthyapaw ccungccaw maesae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou na ripya?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaawlui kha tharae daw zah</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi thonaw aleihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a bingtu, nang ae Raetupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha phe na ning vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Nang ae tuaasahtupaw a thinrianaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha ro khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">a paccynkuhtupaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh anin ninlang po na rih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama nang ae tuaasahtupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinrianaw tuh teimou a um vae?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaasahkunaw a teing hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">arangte luesah athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh chih lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">Hunghuapi lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q1">ccah lan khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">looh leite um lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize kae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rili tuileih kha thosah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rili roi a ccaesahtupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ka thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw min tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka bya kha na mung kya ka nung zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ka kuih a mynlyh kya</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thuruh vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawlui kha tharae ka daw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi aleihpaw kha ka tynsah,</para>
  <para style="q1">te Zion kha, “Nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka minphuin nynh na thua,” ka cipya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou Jerusalem, thoku tua,</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw te namaw thoku tua,</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw thoku tua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinrianaw banang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe na nia vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ruinawpaw pakekhupaw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">ahaw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a neihtupaw nynh na thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">51.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 14:10">Bya 14.10</ref>, <ref loc="REV 16:19">16.19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amaw nynh a saahku hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaaw hae balyn laku kya</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha a cciakhae lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh a do-oih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaaw hae laku kya</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha a kuih te a kyng lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vawsawnaw phuin ning athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccakanccinaw keiccu ronaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">thaloi rhaw keiccu ronaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw ae thuanua vae,</para>
  <para style="q1">hum nynh mou nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngae ae thyakhae cih?</para>
  <para style="q2">Hum nynh mou lungtangnaw ae pya cih?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ccaaw hae tuh mih thawzya vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">kaang a kaepaw saccung hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">laanpi atungkunaw miakaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a huekuh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">na Pachia thuiheinaw khate</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh phe a beih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaemaw a mue hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">misutui te thua leite</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpaw te a rui hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">e hynh ngaetua oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nanning kya-e Alesae huapaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae byathan kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a pankhawtupaw nae Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Dotua, ruinawpaw pakekhupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na kuih kyate ka law vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinrianaw banang kya-e kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na neih vae lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nae ke kha laephi hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na tuapakuh oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin ccianaw lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi hawte na raepya oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bakhung, na tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kae cceih cih,” cite ae hopah oh paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning ae tuaa ae sah oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">kuih hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e banang kha ka nung cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zion tuh a Lungtua Sah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Zion, thaeku tua, thaekuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na thawzung kha thuaku tua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Jerusalem, athyaapaw khuapi,</para>
  <para style="q2">apuithyapaw na boeining kha lawku tua;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize vingdung a awkuh lei hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaa lei hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungkhu lang tee vae lan khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Bya 21.2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 21:27">27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou a kyng hae paw Jerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2">vuiping kha pheihkuh lah, thoku tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou a kyng hae paw Zion ccanung,</para>
  <para style="q2">na nging kya ae khiinaw hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">arui kha suku tua!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Nanning tuh amee leite zua na thua oh zah, phua pya leite shawkhaw na thua cih oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA nynh hynhte a ho: Langmaw lyaze ka ccungccaw hae tuh Izip ram kya ramccang ccungccaw lante umbua khylan, Izip ram lang a cceihbung hae; Assiria hae nynh mah akonglang um leite minmin kha a tuaa a sah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Ka ccungccaw hae kha akonglang um leite a cciakhae hae, tukeiccuze atu pawtemou ka cyih cih? Minmin a uktu hae tuh lungtuate siarua hae zah, ka min kha nin takyh po yn theihrya hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:24">Rom 2.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ccungccaw hae nynh ka min kha yn nyh cih hae; tuin nin khe, minmin kalan bya a hotu tuh kamaw ka thuapaw kha a nyh cih hae; kae tuh hynh-e kyahin ka um.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Daenaw kong, thehoypaw kong,</para>
  <para style="q2">khumnaw kong te</para>
  <para style="q2">“Zion kha na Pachia nynh a uk,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite a hopaw zeccuetu a ccu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">pawcih baban mou apuithya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 1:15">Nah 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:15">Rom 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:15">Efe 6.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngaetua! Na rhawviatu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih roi kha saw hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate pynkheihlan hlaw a sah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion khua lang bua yn kipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh ccaerarih lan a muih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem khua e arohpaw hmin hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">pynkheihlan hlawsahte siatua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaengannaw pya vae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem kha a luesah vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minphuin hae balyn</para>
  <para style="q2">malang khe athyaapaw a thungnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a langsaku vae; ah Pachia khumnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi adianaw e hae</para>
  <para style="q1">balyn nynh a muih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Poutua oh, poutua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">Babilon kyate pou oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Athyaa leipaw kha ty nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">khe hmin kyakhate pou oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> uccaw a phu hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">naemaw kha thyaasakuh oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:17">2Ko 6.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning tuh rangkhirangkhaete</para>
  <para style="q2">na pou lan khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccue te mah na ccue lan khyh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae malang a cceih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia tuh nae nulang te</para>
  <para style="q1">ae rintu oh paw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">A Teingpaw Ryalahtu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dotua, ka ryalahtu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a laan a sui a ua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha hangthungte</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoysah athua cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a hangkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A maesue tuh myarya roh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw muinsan alo khyhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaeangthuapaw myarya alung,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuhcite minphuin patae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a siisaku hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">52.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:21">Rom 15.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">aning keiccuze siapharan hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih khalang a huhkuh cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ming hae nynh minmin</para>
  <para style="q2">a la dosah boi lei hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh a muih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a la thae boi lei hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a thaethya cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kae hopaw bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a zyn?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hum kalan mou a langku?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:38">Joh 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:16">Rom 10.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ryalahtu tuh amaw malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">thingku anopaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laerou kya atoihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thingtharui hawte thuasah a lethung;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh do ry lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pynrua hoi khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">sawtuaruapaw mah thua khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a muinsan duaaruapaw mah thua khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ming hae nynh amaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">theihrya hae zah a vua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">a teingpaw te a ngedan leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">ming hae nynh ccanglang</para>
  <para style="q2">a hawitaw hae paw ccungccaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha theihrya hae zah, kaening nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawlang kae ria leipaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thanccingte aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening vaemaw kha lah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aening ccinaw kha a phu;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhzemah Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">aning kha detah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a teingsah vae cite ah tua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuasalama aening cyiseimenaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tuh vaemaw mue zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1Pe 2.24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">aening hoyleinaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ziaku buakunaw kha a teing;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tungvaw accahpaw detahnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening kha accingpaw lang oun rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a vaemaw liate aening tuh ah dan oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aening balyn tuh azopaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuu hawte nynh ah thua vae oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:25">1Pe 2.25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">aening balyn tuh ahmaw laanpi raveih kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ah maekuh vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening hoyleinaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tungvaw khe a khang vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning tuh tuaasahkunaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">riathaenaw kha a teing zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">a mung kha a myh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:6">Bya 5.6</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:32-33">Loc 8.32-33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">saw theihtupaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">a cciakhae hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuutaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ming a ngotu malang sia leite</para>
  <para style="q2">a umpaw tuu hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tuh a mung kha a myh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahme lei lante byapaenaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">aning kha a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Amaw a malang ccyh kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh mou a tuase kho?</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize aning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a hiin hae paw ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">vua thua zah, ka ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">seinaw keiccuze a zia a bua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Seinaw rae boi khyh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a mung te hynbya a ho boi khyh zemah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:22">1Pe 2.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw hoylei hae paw ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">shawku raepah kheih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">mihoipaw ryte a uukheih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning tungvaw teingsahte</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsaw pya lanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rynaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">A hiinnaw kha seishawkunaw silawnaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">he na rae te, a ciihan kha a muih cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a she asae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning liate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rynaw tuh accing cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawsawnaw a teing koute</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw kha a muih cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a nynaw liate lungryccingnaw a mue cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka ryalahtu midingpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw patae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">miding lang a rae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a phupah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze a lesae hae paw ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccou lanpaw a hanpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka neethungbua cih,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">53.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:28">Mar 15.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luk 22.37</ref></char></note> luadepaw uccaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">athungpaw ccungccaw hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q1">a neekuh bua cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize amaw toulou kha</para>
  <para style="q1">chinaw kalan pyakuh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">misei hae ryte riakheih athua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhzemah ccungccaw patae</para>
  <para style="q2">seinaw kha phu zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">misei hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ccawkuthuinaw lang</para>
  <para style="q1">saw a sangpya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel A Sungsahnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou ccaawsaah leipaw a tiinnung,</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungtuasah;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:27">Gal 4.27</ref></char></note> neitangia ccinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a teing boi leinung nang,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuate siaruatua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize a lanmenung</para>
  <para style="q2">nopinung ccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">vawpaw a hoipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nopinung ccaaw hae laeze</para>
  <para style="q1">alunghua cih, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na bu kha houh lesah tua,</para>
  <para style="q2">na umnaw kya-e zokhawpaw boei kha</para>
  <para style="q1">tharae dawtua; na sithah nan sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya-e arui kha saesah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na tung hae kha tynkaring lan bing hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">voilang ranglang na pungzae cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">te na ciihan hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin ccangpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rho lang a ccou cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw um leinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">khua hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">khua a sah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thinphang nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize maethyanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na mue lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na thawthah nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize thethyanaw</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccou lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na liaccaw lya-e maethyanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ning cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nomaenung lang na la tang lya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">thethyanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na liathui vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize nang ae Raetupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na vawpaw nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">a min tuh Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a cikuh;</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae Shawkhawtu thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi pynpi a uktu</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia cite a ko hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mya thua zah a ngaethahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zu kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a no lyaze a vawpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a myapaw zu kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">kothui hawkhate</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q1">bua ae kothui vae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">na Pachia nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccyh sosoh kyalya nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae vua zemah myarya lepaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaethyaumsahnaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha kae umkhae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Myaryasankae sosoh ka thinria lyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">ccanglang kae hawitaw zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae tynpaw ka sungsahnaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ngaethya kae umsah cih, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae Shawkhawtu</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />E hynh kae ka hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">Noah she lya hawte nynh thua:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:8-17">Gen 9.8-17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Noah she lya-e tui nynh laephi hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouhmaw bua vu nan vae sah, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">bya ka la kinku hawte, na tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinria vae lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae pe vae lan khyh, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">bya ka kinku vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mua hae tuh sihkuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sangpyng hae tuh a nueku hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae tynpaw ka sungsahnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kyate nuekuh lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kya-e daenaw byakin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kyate nuekuh lan khyh, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ngaethya ae umsahtupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawsawnaw teing zah khise nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thonuapaw te ngaengannaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a mue kho leipaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha aphutepaw lung te</para>
  <para style="q2">kae raethui cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na thonaw aleihpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nilar lung te kae rae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54.11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:18-21">Bya 21.18-21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na rhawviainn ahangpaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">patamia lung te ka sak cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na koikua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">amee rupaw lung te ka rae cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae koihlupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">khualungrua balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">aphutepaw lung te ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ccaaw hae balyn kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccangpah cih hae zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">54.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:45">Joh 6.45</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">na ccaaw hae tuh myarya a hoirum cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dingnaw liate na tyn cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahkunaw te na sawkuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na rih vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">thinphang bungzounaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">asawkuh vae cih zah na pe lang</para>
  <para style="q2">naekuh vae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh rhaw ae tuk ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh kae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">kaw ka uapaw thua khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang te rhaw na tukkuh</para>
  <para style="q1">oh paw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang na keiccuze a shung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maee-e kha mung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">sivaw a suhtupaw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a eenaw te angaekuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zunghe a raetupaw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ro khylan a rohtupaw kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw nynh ka rae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">raepaw zunghe tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungkia lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">byapiazung kya</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kaethenawpaw bya miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a seinaw na langsakuh kho cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">E tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">rho thua zah, ka kyate a mue hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">thyaaccounaw nynh thua, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hiin Hoynaw kalan Konaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou tui a hawpaw miakaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">tui a umnaw lang rangtua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">phua a hoi lei hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">rang oh lah, rekute aetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">Rang oh lah, misutui te mateitui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phua leite, amee leite reku tua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:6">Bya 21.6</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:17">22.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawccemou looh thua leipaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">nae phua kha na mang oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">byn lan a um leipaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ryalaw mee kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na thangsah han oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka bya hynh hoyte</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ngaepah oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoypaw looh kha ae oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">athuapaw aepaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungrythuakhaekuh sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nae nakaring kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun tuakuh oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kalan rang oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na hiin ccaw oh ngaetua oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:34">Loc 13.34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">Nanning ryte zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinnaw kha ka rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">David kya ka kinpyakupaw atynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">sungsahnaw kha kae pya cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dotua oh, David kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaekia lang ka rae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhaetu te kawpyatu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rae vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dotua, na ny leipaw minphuin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ko cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia liate,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae nyh leipaw minphuin hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan oun ccue cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize tuh-e Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha phu-enaw ae pya vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha muih kho</para>
  <para style="q2">a um lyakhe ccung oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">anaenaw a um lyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kalan sawsang oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ccungccaw hoylei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih laanpi kha vua hae sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ding lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tuanaw kha vua hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">naekuh hae sah, tuhteze nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha thaw a ccih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">ah Pachia kalan maekuh hae sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhteze nynh seinaw kha marya</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaethya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tuanaw tuh nae tuanaw te lokuh khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cyisahnaw mah</para>
  <para style="q2">nae cyisahnaw te lokuh khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaawlui tuh laephi laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">ahanghua hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka cyisahnaw tuh nae cyisahnaw laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">hanghua zah, ka tuanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae tuanaw laeze ahanghua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuaa te vuiraw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlang te yn ccahbung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi nynh aku posah zah</para>
  <para style="q2">athae a thaesah nawlan te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccacii a ccoutu kha ccacii pya zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">looh a aetu kha looh a pya nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi kha tui a ciasah</para>
  <para style="q2">mawlaezung ki khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">55.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:10">2Ko 9.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuhawte nynh ka khalang kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a poupaw ka bya tuh athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">alakaw lante kamaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ki lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka eenaw kha a ccingsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka sawnuathepaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccingsah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nanning tuh lungtuate</para>
  <para style="q2">na pou cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">daenaw te kikhae thui</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">mua hae te sangpyng hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae malang khe lungtuate</para>
  <para style="q1">hlaw a sah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">loram kya-e thingku balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuih a bia cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinpaw ku a umnaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">maeccaw ku a poru cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">thabu a umnaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">amynkhuhpaw martal ku a poru cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang</para>
  <para style="q2">liathuinaw athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">azo kho leipaw zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">muihsahnaw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kawngaepaw Balyn hanlan Byakinnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Byading kha ccykekuh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahmepaw kha cyitua,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccyh aro mawze ka khumnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">yn thua cih zah, ka kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">luenaw tuh yn langkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sabbath nin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thusah leite sungkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">hoyleinaw miakaw kha rae leite</para>
  <para style="q2">a sungkuhpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtuapaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">hynh-e hae hynh tynkaring lan</para>
  <para style="q1">a kyngkuhpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya a kyngkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang ccungccaw nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn phia ccaccing cih,” cite ho nan sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">tinriapaw ccungccaw nynh mah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Kae tuh thingku aroupaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thua,” cite ho nan sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka sabbath kha sung zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka lungrypaw uccaw kha pokute</para>
  <para style="q2">ka byakin kha tynkaring lan</para>
  <para style="q1">a kyngkuhpaw tinriapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ccanung ccapaw hae laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">aphute huapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">liathuinawpaw uccaw te min kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka inn te ka khualungrua lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka pya cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">azo kho leipaw zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">min kha ka pya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya kha law khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">a min kha sungsah khylan te</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw ryalahtu lang tang khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya a kyngkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang hae kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sabbath kha thusah leite sung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka byakin kha tynkaring lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a kyngkuhpaw balyn kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />athyaapaw ka mua kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cciakhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">sawsangnawpaw ka inn kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lung ka tuasah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">maee-ute si a law hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">si a lawnaw hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka silawhang vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ccoupya athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka inn tuh ccungccaw balyn hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">sawsangnaw inn cite a ko cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">56.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mat 21.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:17">Mar 11.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luk 19.46</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phiariphiarae um hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel hae kha a suelua hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia nynh hynhte a ho,</para>
  <para style="q1">“A sueluakuh vae hae paw laelan</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw hae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kalan ka sueluabua</para>
  <para style="q2">ung cih hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Uktu hae Ozia Ronaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nanning, loramsaw hae balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw e loramsaw hae balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">tei khylan rang oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel rhawviatu hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih mit amoh, mih balyn mawte</para>
  <para style="q2">nythyanaw hoi khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin balyn tuh ngoh kho leite</para>
  <para style="q2">yccae leipaw ui hae nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ih hae zah maan a sah hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">i kyalya kha a ry hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Myarya ae kho hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a byn kho leipaw ui hae nyn thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuurin hae nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">nythyanaw hoi khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw laanpi langkhe nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">pong a maeku vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih balyn mawte mimaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thanenaw kyalya kha a ccungku hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Rang oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">misutui neih oh sih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ruithyapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phe byn lan neih oh sih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Awkhualan tuh atunin hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">athua cih zah, ho kho um lei lan</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoyhua cih,” a ciku hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungkia leipaw Israel Zohtuh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Miding hae chih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung nynh mah pawlangria khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung nynh mah a nythya khyh lyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">miding hae kha ccaring law athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize miding hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">shethya kyate ccaring law thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />daenaw lungkhu lang a tee hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">hmerarih lan a hiin hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih iphae vawlan a haeung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama naawthyanung</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaaw hae nanning,</para>
  <para style="q1">milae vawpaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a seinung ccaaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">ohhuanung ccaaw hae nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">hynhlang rang oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nanning nynh hummou na sarya oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Hum kha mou nae khalang haehae</para>
  <para style="q1">na awnua oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lae na thuaanua oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Nanning tuh misei hae ccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mihyn hae ciihan na thua khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nanning tuh athyaapaw thing hae laku te</para>
  <para style="q2">hinlalyhpaw thingku hae kaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a umpaw zohtuh hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a ohhuakuh ry hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">na thua khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">Accya kya te lungpi kaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ccaaw hae na theih oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua khyh oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Accya e naebabingpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lung hae laku e abang tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning hanpaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">khah-e hae tuh nanning hanpaw nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e hae kha niapaw silawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na pya oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccathae silawnaw kha mah na pya oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Khah-e hae kha ka lungrythua cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mua hangpaw vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ikhung kha na nung oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">te silawnaw rae khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">na kaenua thung oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nae zohtuh kha thuakaw te thuakawtung</para>
  <para style="q2">nulang khe na nung oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kha nae vua oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae boeining na khahku oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ikhung vawlan na kae oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ikhung kha na kosah oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">te khah-e hae ryte nawccawnaw na rae oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ikhung kha mah na sungsah oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih sasete a um hae paw kha na do oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amynkhuhpaw chitui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccyngkuh oh zah</para>
  <para style="q1">Molek pachia kalan na ccia oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae zimuin kha na thuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw lang na saw oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">michi khua cia heize na saw oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Myarya saw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">na khiavuikuh oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na bang oh zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">“E hynh alakawpaw nynh thua,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite na ho khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae rynaw tuh maee lang</para>
  <para style="q2">bua na ruasah oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae thawzya khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae kha hynpya lan ciate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">phe ning lan ciate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning nynh hum raw mou na ri oh?</para>
  <para style="q2">Yccae leite khaw cia</para>
  <para style="q1">ka um keiccu tou</para>
  <para style="q2">ka raw nae ri khyh oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nae dingnaw te nae cyisahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka langsakuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama zohtuh hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kha ae khum lan khyh oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />He na sia vae oh ze, na ccakhung oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh hae nynh ae luesah vae oh sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">Khisan nynh khah-e hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaring a mung cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaekheit hysawpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaring a thuikhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama ka kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a rekuhpaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ram kha a ccou cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw ka mua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rho lang a ccou cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia Bawmnaw te Dansahnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Laanpi akhunaw kha bia oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi kha bia oh, laanpi kha paccyn oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae laanpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">akhawkuhpaw miakaw kha nue oh,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ho athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawccecize a min tuh Athyaa cikuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae a hiinpaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">a hangpaw te a sung-epaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae tuh ahangpaw te athyaapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hmin kya ka um, a ngaesikuhpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">zakaw a sangsakuhpaw kya mah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka um zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thinlung te mih tuanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawsaenaw ka pyathui hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kae nynh zungzae sei ka be lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae ka thinria lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhte athua lanze, hiinnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka malang khe a thawzyabung cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">kamaw nynh ka rae vae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">muisaw heize a thawzya cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahoy leipaw a ryduaanaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinria zah de ka tah;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thinria zah ccanglang ka hawitaw;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama amaw a laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">po a zui mamin.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hiinzia kha ka muih vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama aning kha ka dansah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka cciakhae cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengannaw ka pyathui cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">a rah a khui hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaengannaw ka pya cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anaenaw te asawnaw a um hae paw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw um sah, daenaw um sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha ka dansah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">57.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:17">Efe 2.17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hoylei hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuileih tho zah adae kho leipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">rili te nynh a loku hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuileih nynh athupaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">tuiccua kha a thuakhae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw hoylei hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw um khyh, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">ka Pachia nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">57.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 48:22">Isa 48.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahmepaw Looh-aesungnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Synku leite siatua! Na roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mungkae roi hawte ccaesah tua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka ccungccaw hae rawsenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw kalan hopah hae lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jakob ciihan hae seinaw kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw kalan hopah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minmin nynh kae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nin takyh yn ccung hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka laanpi ny kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungrythuakhaekuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">dingnaw a raepaw minphuin thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih Pachia phungzae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">vua khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">adingpaw byapianaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ngia hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia kalan naeku kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungrythua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kaening nynh looh-ae kae sung zahmah</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou nae muihpya khyh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Zakaw kae sangsaku zahmah</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccemou nae nypya khyh?” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nanning nynh looh-ae na sung nin oh khe,</para>
  <para style="q2">naemaw rynaw kha na rae oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae ryalahtu hae balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na tuaa na sah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nanning nynh peku khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">ziaku khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">arysawthahpaw kuihlung te</para>
  <para style="q1">thungku khylan looh-ae na sung oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Atunin looh-ae na sung tahaw oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">looh-ae sungnaw nynh tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae roi kha ahangnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">thae thua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nin kheit lungkhu mawtemaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zakawsangsakute</para>
  <para style="q1">looh-aesungnaw tahawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rypaw athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Thing akoikuhpaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">lu tebing lanpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">buriboei te buhhaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">i lanpaw athua zawtou?</para>
  <para style="q1">E hynh looh-aesungnaw na ci cih oh tou?</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a nawccawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">nin na ci cih oh tou?</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae nynh ka rypaw looh-aesungnaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">ahme leipaw khiikunaw kha supyapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">phupaw ripaw kha khahpyapaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahkunaw a teingpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">luesahpaw te puihnawpaw ccong</para>
  <para style="q2">miakaw khyapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vuelawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na looh neethung buapaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">inn a hoi leipaw ryachipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na inn lang thuakhaepaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">a sasete a umpaw kha na muih ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">boeining pyabuapaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">na puizia hae sibia leipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thua khyh tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">58.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:35">Mat 25.35</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhte na cyi zetuh, na awnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">awkhua takaw e awnaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">yn langkuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">arangte na dan cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha thyaa ae ccousahtupaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na malang khe a cceih cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na nulang te ae rintu athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ko cih zah, ae oi cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">bawmnaw mue khylan na sia cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh, E kya mang ka um,</para>
  <para style="q1">ae cipah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Puihnawpaw ccong kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kuihdung te khikunaw kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ahoy leipaw byaho kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasah na vua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a vuelawpaw kha na looh na pya zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a vawsawpaw a hobounaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na bawm lanze thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na awnaw tuh mohnaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a aw cih zah, na mohnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ninthuccynglyn hawte a aw cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tyty ae cciakhae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramrou kya na hanlan ahoboupaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae ccingsahpah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ru hae kha thungnaw a pya cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh tui abukuhpaw khokhu hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tui akan boi leipaw tuidy hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Langmawlya aroh vae hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sakthui athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">khawlya e arynpaw aleihpaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">na bingchih cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">nang tuh ting athua vae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">khualungrua kha a raethuitu,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw umnaw laanpi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a raethuitu cite ko na thua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang nynh sabbath nin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thethyasah leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw ka nin kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw rynaw kha zui leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">sabbath nin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lungrythua lan umpaw nin,</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtua lan umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nin</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw cite na ko ze thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw rynaw kalan ccia leite,</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw rynaw kha zui leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw pekipaw kha cyi leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">sabbath nin kha saw na tua ze thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">na lungrythuakhaekuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi ahangpaw vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ccisakuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">na minpaaw Jakob rho khate</para>
  <para style="q2">looh kae dang cih, cite</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> munglae nynh a ho vae.</para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Dingleinaw te Tuaasahkunaw kha Detahnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dotua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">khum nawlan kharouh dyn khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a nakaring tuh thae nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">kharouh pan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nae hoyleinaw nynh nanning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae Pachia kyate ae sawsaku oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">nawthae khyh nawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">nae seinaw nynh a mae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning kyate ccanglang a hawisah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize nae kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">chiise te nungsikuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae kuihdung tuh hoyleinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuh; nae munglae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">hynbya kha ho zah, nae lae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw bya te a ccohku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">asasite ho khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung nynh mah a byathan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">hmerarih lan thuakhae khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw kha doliakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hynbya kha a ho hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thyaruhnaw kha ccaaw lang poi hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw kha a saah hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh huparepaw tui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a keisah hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">moisaw bu kha boei lang a kua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tui a aepaw miakaw tuh a chih,</para>
  <para style="q1">akoipaw atui nynh huparepaw lang akei.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mih boeikua tuh boeining lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tang kho khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a raeku hae paw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw kha bongkuh kho khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih ryalaw tuh hoyleinaw ryalaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuih kya puathonaw a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mih ccu nynh hoyleinaw lang ccue zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">seinaw a hoi leipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">chia khylan a ccuenua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih tuanaw tuh ahoy leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuanaw thua zah, mih laanpi kya</para>
  <para style="q2">riathaenaw te ronaw a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59.7-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:15-17">Rom 3.15-17</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Daenaw laanpi kha nyh khyh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih laanpi kya byading um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih laanpi kha akoupaw laanpi lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a rae hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e laanpi a zuipaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw kha nyh khyh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze byading tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening te sawkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw tuh aening kyacia phah khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">awnaw kha ah ngaehoi oh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw nynh a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">awnaw kha ah ngaehoi oh zemah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw kya nynh ah ccia oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mitmohpaw hawte pang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">po ah haetua oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">a mit sae leipaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">maemae ah zahkuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ninthuccynglyn pi khe zetepakaw</para>
  <para style="q2">riryngmoh ccyh lya hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ah thy ah pawkuh oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawsae hae paw laku kya tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">michi hawte nynh ah thua oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ah balyn mawte vong hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">are-aro ah tuakuh oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">vahu hawte ah khui oh.</para>
  <para style="q2">Byading kha ah ngaehoi oh zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">ah mue khyh oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">khumnaw kha ah ngaehoi oh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">aening te asawkuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kae cyiseimenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na malang myarya alung,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae seinaw nynh kaemaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rawsete ccaekia a khan.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae cyiseinaw tuh kaemaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phang um zah, kae nykupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kae seinaw hae tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cyiseimenaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vuanaw, ah Pachia zuinaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ccanglang maekunaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuaasahnaw byahonaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">rawsenaw byahonaw te hynbya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccykekute tuh-e tuh thinlung kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">honaw kha nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Byading tuh nulang ki zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw tuh asawnaw kya a thadyn;</para>
  <para style="q1">byaccing tuh zapi malang khuliakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw tuh tee kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Byading tuh zo zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw a sibiapaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">luadekunaw a tung.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">Tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh muih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">byading a um khyh keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungryccing khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccaw lu kheit san</para>
  <para style="q2">um khyh cipaw a ny,</para>
  <para style="q1">Hopiatu lu kheit san</para>
  <para style="q2">a um khyhpaw kha a ngaeangthua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze amaw a kuih nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw hanlan taenaw pya zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a dingnaw nynh amaw kha a bawm.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:5">Isa 63.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dingnaw kha bykhaw hawte khawkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khumnaw sivawlukhung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a khungku;</para>
  <para style="q1">phulawnaw boei kha zingkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinrianaw angkile kha a kiku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:14">Efe 6.14</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 6:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:8">1Th 5.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih cyisahnaw thyhte a liaru cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawsetu hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinkhykuh cih zah, a rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a liaru cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">rili khunglang e ram hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a liaru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze niccaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha a rih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nithua lang um hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a phu-enaw kha a rih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khisan nynh mung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">tingkhawpaw vawkhu tuh tui ale hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">aning tuh yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aning tuh Shawkhawtu hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion lang yn thua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">seinaw kyate a maeleihkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob ciihan hae kalan yn thua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">59.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:26">Rom 11.26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />E ka byakinnaw hynh minmin ryte ka rae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci: Nae tungvaw a umpaw ka muisaw te nae munglae kya ka nung vae paw ka bya tuh nae munglae, nae ccaaw hae munglae, nae mintaw hae munglae kyate atu te zungzae cia phiakuh lan khyh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Apazaekuh hae paw Sueluanaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thokuh lah, awtua;</para>
  <para style="q2">na awnaw tuh yn thua vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> phu-enaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw alangkuh vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mohnaw nynh laephi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phang a bong cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">marae zipingpaw mohnaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae kha a bong cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw yn langkuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a phu-enaw tuh na tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q2">yn langkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minphuin hae tuh na awnaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan hae tuh na kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">awkhua takaw e awnaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">oun thua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngawdo lah, na pepan balyn kha dotua;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin balyn tuh pynkheihlan</para>
  <para style="q1">sueluakuh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan oun cceih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccapaw hae tuh asawnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">oun cceih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccanung hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">imua do-oihtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kuih te a dua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh na muih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya na lungtua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">na bung thyngku biate</para>
  <para style="q2">na lung apaw cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize rili lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q2">hoirumnaw tuh na kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">oun cciakhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae sisua tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kalauh patae tuh na kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Midian ram te Efah ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">anopaw kalauh hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ae thuanua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Sheba ram e hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">oun thua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh sui te frankinsen kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun phu cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thehoysahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a siakhae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kedar ram e tuuphu balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan oun sueluakuh cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Nebaioth ram e tuutepaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na rya ae lawpah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e hae kha ka silawhang vawlan</para>
  <para style="q2">mang lan nawccaw athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aphu-epaw ka beikinn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phu ka esah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maeking hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih bu kalan a zou hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">vahu hae hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">a zou hae paw khuh-e hae khuh</para>
  <para style="q2">hum hae mou?</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia min hanlan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw hanlan thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccaaw hae kha mih sui mih ngun ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">asawnaw kyate cciakhae khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">rili khunglang e ram hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn ngaw hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Tarshih ccingbaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">masaty nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize aning nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phu-enaw ae pya vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ramccang hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae khualungrua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ae raepah cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih siapharan hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha rya ae lawpah cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize ka thinria zah</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha de kae tah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama ka thawccinaw liate</para>
  <para style="q1">nae tungvaw ngaethya</para>
  <para style="q2">kae umsah vae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Minphuin ccangpaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih siapharan hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">ataruinte cciakhaekute<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:25-26">Bya 21.25-26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">mih sisua kha nae kalan</para>
  <para style="q1">oun cciakhae nawlan hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae koikua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">khuazi khuadae khaw leite</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae po hungkuh sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na rya ae lawpah cih leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ram te peenaw tuh aroh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhcihawpaw ram hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">marya mawte ro athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka beikinnthyaa hmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">puithyasah khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">Lebanon phu-enaw athuapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">saipres thing, plane thing te</para>
  <para style="q1">maeccaw thing hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya oun thua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccu ka khangnaw hmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a phu ka esah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang ae tuaa ae sah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ciihan hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">oun thua cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ae bakhungpah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae theihrya hae paw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na cculeihpaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a bakhung cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Khuapi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:9">Bya 3.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Israel Pachia Athyaapaw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion khua cite ae ko cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lu kheit nynh sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">na kya po ccia lei lan ciate</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha ae hua hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ae vua hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae alesaepaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">she kheit koute she kheit</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw hmin lang kae rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minphuin hae mateitui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na neih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan hae matei kha na zu cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nang ae Khumtu,</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae Shawkhawtu te</para>
  <para style="q2">Jakob Pachia Athungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thuapaw kha na nyh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sohin ccelang sui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thuakhaepah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">sivaw ccelang ngun,</para>
  <para style="q2">thingphe ccelang sohin,</para>
  <para style="q1">lung ccelang sivaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae thuakhaepah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Nang ae uktu lang Daenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">kae nungpah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ryalaw a nawtu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">Dingnaw kha kae nungpah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na ram lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">puathonaw the kha thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ramri lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">vawsaw riathaenaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ronaw the kha thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">thae thua vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">na khualungrua kha Khumnaw cite</para>
  <para style="q2">na ko cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na koikua hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Thehoynaw cite na ko cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia tuh Zion Phu-enaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuadae kya khuanin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na awnaw thua vae lan khyh zah<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">60.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:23">Bya 21.23</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:5">22.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">khuazi kya sawpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw ae pya vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw na awnaw athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na Pachia tuh na phu-enaw athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na khuanin tuh ccah vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">na sawpaw mah</para>
  <para style="q1">nulang sihkuh vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae tynpaw na awnaw athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na raw na khuinaw ccyh tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athang vae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na ccungccaw hae balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ding cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram kha zungzae a pee cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae kha phu-esah ka thua nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh ka linpaw atoihpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuihhae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin kyaze adih huapaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">phin phinkheit lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">anyaa huapaw lu kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athungpaw minphuin phuin kheit lang</para>
  <para style="q1">a tang cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">accyh azaw te tuh-e tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">arangte ka ccingsah cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Luesahnaw Thehoypaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipaw PACHIA Muisaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tungvaw a um,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:5">Mat 11.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:22">Luk 7.22</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:18-19">Luk 4.18-19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha chitui yn thuh vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuaasahkunaw a teing hae paw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoypaw thuakhaepya khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">kae hynh yn saw vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlung akoi hae paw vaemaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">dansah khylan, a kyng hae paw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">luenaw kong hopya khylan te</para>
  <para style="q1">thongccah hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">luesah khylan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thawccinaw kum te</para>
  <para style="q2">ah Pachia kya-e liarunaw nin kha</para>
  <para style="q1">siakhae khylan thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a rah a khui hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtangnaw pya khylan thuasah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:4">Mat 5.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zion kya a rah a khui hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bawm khylan—</para>
  <para style="q1">buhhaw hanpaw haetapawsi,</para>
  <para style="q2">rawkhuinaw hanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lungtuanaw chitui,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaethyanaw hanpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lungtuanaw boeining kha</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kalan pya khylan thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn saw vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a phu-enaw</para>
  <para style="q2">langsaku khylan a linpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">dingnaw thingku cite minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ko athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh langmawlya e</para>
  <para style="q2">aroh hae paw kha a sakthui cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">khawlya e aroh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a thadynsah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">she patae kya a la roh vae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">khuapi hae kha a sakthui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minphuin ccangpaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thadynte nae tuuphu hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ae rinpah cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ramccang hae nynh nae loo</para>
  <para style="q2">ae phopah cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">misu khokhu kha ae do-oihpah cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nanning kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ko na thua cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ah Pachia rya a lahtu hae cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ko na thua cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin ccangpaw hae sisua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na ae cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hoirumnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungpawkhaekuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nae maethyanaw elang leit ning</para>
  <para style="q2">na mueru cih oh, nae thethyanaw elang</para>
  <para style="q1">na mue oh paw kyakhe nae lungtua cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze nae hanpaw leit ning kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccouru cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw lungtuanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae kya-e athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawccecize kae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">byading kha ka ry,</para>
  <para style="q1">luadenaw te ahme leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">cyisahnaw kha ka hua;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ryalaw mee kha lungzite</para>
  <para style="q2">ka pya cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin ryte zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinnaw kha ka rae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mih ccaaw mih no hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">mintaw hae tuh ccungccaw hae kya te</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae kya mih minthaan cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">hythua a pya hae paw nynh thua cite</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin a muih hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">balyn nynh a nyh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya myaryamaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lungtua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka muisaw tuh ka Pachia kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungpaw cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize haetapawsi te a ccaankuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zudy ccangvaepaw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aphutepaw a uccaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaankuhpaw akaenung</para>
  <para style="q1">liaccanung hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">khumnaw boeining kha</para>
  <para style="q1">yn lawsakuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw angkiccua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn kisahku vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">61.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:2">Bya 21.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Laephi nynh aku kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a posah hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khokhu nynh a lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">ccoukuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a lesah thung hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae balyn malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">dingnaw te thehoysahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a langsakuh cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zion kya-e Thyaaccounaw te Khumnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jerusalem thyaaccounaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">awkhua takaw e awnaw hawte aw zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Jerusalem khumnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">phang a awpaw maeekhua hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">athua mawlaezung,</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion elang yccae leite ka um lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem elang zya ka dae lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minphuin hae nynh na kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">thyaaccounaw kha a muih cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan hae balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na phu-enaw kha a muih cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> munglae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae phu cih paw min thawpaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha ko na thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">apuithyapaw bawilukhung</para>
  <para style="q2">na thua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na Pachia kuih kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan lukhung na thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang kha vuapaw ccungccaw cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ko na thua vae lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ram kha Ccungccaw Adaenaw ram</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ko thua vae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">a tungvaw Ka Lungrythuanung cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ko na thua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na ram tuh Vawpaw a hoipaw ram</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ko athua cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw a lungrythua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na ram tuh vawpaw a hoi vae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccangvae te liaccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zuvaw lang a tang hae hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae raetupaw nynh nang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zuvaw lante ae umkhae cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">zudy ccangvaepaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">akaenung liaccanung tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a lungtua hawte, na Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw a lungtua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pou Jerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2">na khualungrua vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawviatu hae kha ka nung vae hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh khuazi khuadae</para>
  <para style="q1">umtaw lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha nysah thuinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a pya hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q2">zya dae nan oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jerusalem kha</para>
  <para style="q2">tynsah zah, laephi pynpi kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a min a thaansah mawlaezung</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha umtawsah nan oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ranglang kuih te thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athungpaw a kuih te thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">bya a kinkupaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Nae ccathae kha nae rhaw hae looh lang</para>
  <para style="q2">bua ka pya vae lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">na bangnuathe oh paw misutui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang hae nynh neih vae lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuh-e ccathae a ccakhung hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a thehoysah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">misu thae a ccakhung hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw ka voidu lungkhu khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a neih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koikua kyate pou oh, pou oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae hanlan laanpi kha</para>
  <para style="q1">paccynpah oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">laanluepi kha rae oh, rae oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">lung hae kha phe thyaa lan vua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae luki khe</para>
  <para style="q2">alan kha sae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi adianaw kyacia</para>
  <para style="q2">a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Dotua, nang ae khumtu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">yn cceih cciamang,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ryalaw mee tuh amaw kya um zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">62.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:10">Isa 40.10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">Bya 22.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">aning nynh mue lan a ccanpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a malang khe a um,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">Zion ccanung kha hopah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin kha, “Athyaapaw Ccungccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a Shawkhaw hae paw,”</para>
  <para style="q1">cite ko athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha, “Muih Athua Vae Paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">Vua Athua Leipaw Khuapi,”</para>
  <para style="q2">cite ko na thua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Edom tungvaw Liarunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Edom ram Bozrah khua kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">asepaw azong ohkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">boeining kha lawkute</para>
  <para style="q2">yn thuapaw khuh hummou athua?</para>
  <para style="q1">Asung-epaw angkiccua kha lawkuh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw a thungnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">yn cceihpaw khuh hummou athua?”</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q2">“Thyaaccounaw kong kha hote</para>
  <para style="q1">khumnaw lanpaw thungnaw a hoipaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kamaw nynh ka thua.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63.1-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Isa 34.5-17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49.7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eze 25.12-14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1.2-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pawccemou na angkiccua tuh se zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">na boeining tuh misu mianaw khu kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a su hae paw boeining te aloku?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Misutui mianaw khu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka makhaete ka su zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw lu kheit sanmah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kya umbua khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">khah-e hae kha thinriate bungpawte</para>
  <para style="q2">sydete ka nonde hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">atui nynh ka boeining kha pia zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63.1-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:5-17">Isa 34.5-17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:7-22">Jer 49.7-22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:12-14">Eze 25.12-14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 35:1-15">35.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:11-12">Amo 1.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="OBA 1:1-14">Oba 1-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:2-5">Mal 1.2-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">ka angkiccua balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">azong pong ohkuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Phulawnaw nin tuh ka thinlung kya</para>
  <para style="q2">um zah, ka shawkhawnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ryalaw kum tuh yn thua vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka do zahmah bawmtu um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">riri ka do zemah kae yn bawmtu</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit san um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">tukeiccuze kamaw kuih nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">taenaw kha yn thuakhaepah zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thinrianaw nynh kae kha yn bawm.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:16">Isa 59.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thinria zah ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka syde hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bungpaw zah minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zoihtatyh lan ka pae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hiinnaw chiise kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi vawlan ka lae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Israel tungvaw Pachia Thawccinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> sungsahnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya lepaw te thehoysah lan</para>
  <para style="q1">accanpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalawnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">the ka hoysah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aening elang atyn-are oun cyipah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thawccinaw thyhte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya le zah atynpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a sungsahnaw thyhte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">Israel phin hanlan myarya lepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">thawccinaw kha a langsaku vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Thanccingte minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae kha yn ling cih lei hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccaaw hae nynh thua hae,” a ci;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh mih lungriathaenaw balyn kya</para>
  <para style="q2">mih Khumtu lang yn tang.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaw malang e vaawpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha a khum hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a sungsahnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">a ngaethyaumsahnaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha a shawkhaw hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">alia vae paw ccyh balyn kya</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha hangthung hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha dou hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw a Muisaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaethyasah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tukeiccuze aning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin rhaw lang tang zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw ccaccei nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rhaw a tuk hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh langmawlya e she,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalahtu Moses she kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a liathui hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kha tuurin hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">rili lungkhu te</para>
  <para style="q1">a cciakhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha</para>
  <para style="q2">teimou a um vae?</para>
  <para style="q1">Mih lungkhu kya athyaapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a Muisaw a nungtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />aphu-epaw a kuih kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Moses a ranglang kuih kya</para>
  <para style="q1">a umsahtupaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw min kha</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw hanlan raeku khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">mih malang e tui kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a phiasakuhtupaw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">63.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Exo 14.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />minmin kha akhunaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">po a cciakhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">teimou a um vae?</para>
  <para style="q2">Ramkaw kya a cceihpaw marang hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin tuh thykupawku leite</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Accya kya a cceihbungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vaetua hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Muisaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha haeungnaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhcite aphu-epaw min kha</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw hanlan langsakuh khylan</para>
  <para style="q1">na ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngaesikute Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaawram kyate dobung tua lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw te aphu-epaw</para>
  <para style="q1">na umnaw kyate muihtua,</para>
  <para style="q2">Na lungthonaw te na thungnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">teimou a um?</para>
  <para style="q2">Na sungsahnaw te ngaethya</para>
  <para style="q1">na umsahnaw tuh teimou a um?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuh-e hae tuh ka hanlan khee athua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham nynh kaening kha</para>
  <para style="q2">oun nyh khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel nynh mah oun ny khyh zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh kae Paaw nynh na thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae Paaw nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya mawte kaening</para>
  <para style="q2">oun Shawkhawtu tuh na min nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kaening hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na laanpi kyate pawccemou</para>
  <para style="q1">ccanglang nae cciasah sei?</para>
  <para style="q2">Na raw kae ri khyh nawlan</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccemou kae thinlung hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae khungsah?</para>
  <para style="q1">Na ryalahtu hae hanlan te</para>
  <para style="q2">na rho athuapaw phin hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">yn kitua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Athyaapaw na ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">sosoh kyalya kae uk;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama atu tuh kae rhaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na beikinnthyaa kha a syde vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kaening tuh nang nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">na uk boi lei hae paw hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">na min te ko athua boi lei</para>
  <para style="q2">hae paw hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q1">khaw cia kae thua vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mua hae tuh na malang khe</para>
  <para style="q2">a hy ccaw hae, vaawlui kha hung lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">yn rungbung tua,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na min kha na rhaw hae nysah khylan,</para>
  <para style="q2">maee nynh thabu kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a u hawte thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tui kha a ccohsah hawte thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">yn rungbung tua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhteze nynh minphuin hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na malang khe a thyngkuh cih hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaening nynh kae la tua leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ri lan umpaw uccaw hae kha he na rae te,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae rungbung zah mua hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na malang khe a hy hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaw a ngaehoikuh hae paw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">rya a lawpah hae paw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw laelan ccangpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">langmawlya mawte</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung nynh mah thae boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a nakaring te thae boi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a mit te mah muih boi khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">64.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:9">1Ko 2.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahmepaw kha lungtuate</para>
  <para style="q2">a cyih hae paw te na laanpi kya</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae tua hae paw kha na ccuepe hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Kae tungvaw na thinria zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">kae sei mamin; kaening kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nae retawku keiccuze kae sei vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kaening balyn tuh athyaa leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hawte kae thua vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">adingpaw kae cyisahnaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw boeining hawte nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kaening balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thingnaw hawte kae naan zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae hoyleinaw nynh kaemaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khisan hawte ccaring oun mung.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na min ae kopaw te na kya</para>
  <para style="q2">kyngku lan a zuakuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">lu kheit san um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize kaening kha</para>
  <para style="q1">na mae ccanglang nae hawitaw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">kae hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">lungkhu langkhe nae ap vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhzemah, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh kae Paaw nynh na thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening tuh anglae kae thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang tuh kaening oun raetupaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ang raetu nynh na thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening balyn tuh na kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">nae raekupaw nynh kae thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, thawte na thinria nan sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">hoyleinaw kha palei liathui nan.</para>
  <para style="q1">Atu tuatua, kaening balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccungccaw hae nynh kae thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Athyaapaw na khuapi hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ramkaw lang nynh a tang vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Zion tuh ramkaw lang</para>
  <para style="q2">tang vae zah, Jerusalem tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">arohpaw lang nynh a tang vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kae minpaaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ae thehoysahnaw hae hmin,</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw te apuithyapaw kae beikinn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te u thua vae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae lungrythuanaw hmin balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">arohpaw lang nynh a tang vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, e hae balyn koute,</para>
  <para style="q2">phang na synkuh ung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Yccae leite phang umte kaening hynh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya ccih lante de nae tah ung cih tou?</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ahmepaw Pachia Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kae yn ngia lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mue lanpaw te kae yn ccung lei hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">yn muih lan hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">paccynkute ka um.</para>
  <para style="q1">“E kya mang ka um, e kya mang ka um,” cite</para>
  <para style="q2">ka min yn ko leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin kha ka hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:20">Rom 10.20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mih tuakunaw thyhte cyih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahoy leipaw laanpi a zui hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">kawngae lei hae paw minphuin kalan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">anin ninlang ka kuih ka dyngpya hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:21">Rom 10.21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />minmin tuh khokhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">silawnaw rae hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ohkhe vawlan mynkhuhpaw kha ute</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thin yn riasahpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />shawku kya haung hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">khuazi khe alang leinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hmin kya a um hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">voh saw kha ae hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih angphe lungkhu umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw saw ehang kha a sia hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />minmin nynh, “Kae tuh nang laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">myaryamaw ka thyaahua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">ka kalan naeku leite</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw um lan zya um,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">E ccungccaw hae tuh ka naduh lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q2">maeekhuh thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">anin ninlang aruapaw maee nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka malang azeikuhpaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Zya ka dae lan khyh, ka liaru cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih hoyleinaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">mih minpaaw hae hoyleinaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mih by kyakhe ka liaru ccaccing cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="qr">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize minmin nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mua hae vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">mynkhuhpaw kha pya hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">sangpyng hae vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q1">ka the yn thyasah hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih by vawlan khe mih cyisahnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka tou cih zah phe ccing lan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka liaru cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">misu nge kyakhe misutui kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a muih hae ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Khah-e kha roh nan,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize khe kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuanaw a um,” a ci hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhawte ka ryalahtu hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka cyih cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha pong ka roh lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakob phin kyate ciihan</para>
  <para style="q2">ka langsakuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah phin kyate ka mua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">rho lang a ccoutupaw ka langsakuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka po hae paw nynh tuh-e ram tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rho lang a ccou cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ryalahtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae yn ccungpaw ka ccungccaw hae hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">Sharon tuh tuu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">rampaeekunaw hae hmin lang a tang cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Akhor Accya tuh vaetua hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryanaw hae hmin lang a tang cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:24-26">Jos 7.24-26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nanning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a vua hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw ka mua kha a ning hae paw,</para>
  <para style="q1">Gad khozi hanlan ccaboi</para>
  <para style="q2">a phaepah hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q1">Meni khozi hanlan misutui</para>
  <para style="q2">a nungpah hae paw nynh na thua oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nanning kha thaloi rhaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">kae ap cih oh zah, nae balyn mawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw chianaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">na bakhung cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize he kae ko oh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae khung khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">bya kae hopya oh ze,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ngaepah khyh oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka muihnaw khe ahoy leipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na cyih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka lungrythua leipaw kha na poku oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">hynhte a ho:</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka ryalahtu hae tuh a ae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nae vuelaw cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ryalahtu hae tuh a neih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama nanning tuh nae tuihaw cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ryalahtu hae tuh mih lungpaw cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nae maethah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka ryalahtu hae tuh lungpawte</para>
  <para style="q2">hlaw a sah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama nanning tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlungccite na sia cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">lungriathaete na rah cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thyalaw nawlan mang khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">nae min kha ka popaw ccungccaw kya</para>
  <para style="q1">na cciataw cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">te Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha ae theih cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalahtu hae kha min thawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a phu cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh ram lungkhu kya</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuanaw a ngiapaw miakaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a lungzipaw Pachia liate</para>
  <para style="q2">hythuanaw kha a ngiakuh cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">ram lungkhu kya byakinkunaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a raepaw nynh a lungzipaw</para>
  <para style="q1">Pachia liate bya a kinkuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize langmawlya e</para>
  <para style="q1">vawsawnaw hae kha ning thua vae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ka muihnaw kyate thuruh athua vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Aphu-epaw Raenaw Thawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaaw thawpaw te laephi thawpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka rae cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">langmawlya e uccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">liathui thua vae lan khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuathui mah thua vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:22">Isa 66.22</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:13">2Pe 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Bya 21.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka rae lanpaw uccaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae nae lungtua sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae lungpaw sah;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize Jerusalem kha</para>
  <para style="q1">lungpaw um lante ka rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lungrythua lante ka rae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem kya ka lungpaw cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae tungvaw</para>
  <para style="q1">ka lungrythua cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">tuin kya rawkhuinaw roi te</para>
  <para style="q1">lungvawsawnaw roi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thae thua vae lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 21:4">Bya 21.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin khua kya nosi lyate</para>
  <para style="q2">a chihpaw um lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a she phe dia lan a hiin leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">atawpaw um lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">kum za kheit te a chihpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">zawthaw cite tua athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">kum za kheit a bia maw a chihpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thyalawnaw a muepaw cite tua athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin nynh inn a sak cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a umnah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">misu khokhu kya misu ku</para>
  <para style="q2">a linkuh cih hae zah athae kha a ae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minmin nynh a sak hae paw inn kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">milae nynh umnah lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh a lin hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">misu thae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">milae nynh ae lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ccungccaw hae hiinshe tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">thingku hiinshe hawte athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka po hae paw tuh mih kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">rya a lawku hae paw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">khaw cia mih lungpawkhaekuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin tuh accakaepaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">banghan lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">shethya hanlan ccaaw saahkuh lan khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua a pya hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">ccaawno athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">mih ciihan hae mah</para>
  <para style="q2">hythua ccoupaw athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin nynh yn ko maw hae khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka oi cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">bya yn hopya cciamang lya hae khe</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thaepah vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Suizaw te tuutaw tuh a aekheih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih tuh tangnuapaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">ccatanphue kha a ae cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama hupaw tuh laenoi kha a ae cih!</para>
  <para style="q1">Athyaapaw ka mua pynpi vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh vawsawnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">pyakuh lan khyh hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">rohkuh lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">65.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:6-9">Isa 11.6-9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Minphuin hae kha Bya A Pia hae</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Vaawlui tuh ka bawitungkhung thua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh ka ccu synaw nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawcihawpaw inn mou</para>
  <para style="q2">ka hanlan nae sakpah cih oh?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka umnaw hmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawcihawpaw mou athua?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:34">Mat 5.34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 5:35">35</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:22">23.22</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66.1-2a: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:49-50">Loc 7.49-50</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />E hae balyn hynh ka kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">ka raepaw athua keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">e hae balyn hynh ka kya-e nynh thua hae,</para>
  <para style="qr">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q2">Zakaw a sangsakuhpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinlung kya a ngaesikuhpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ka bya keiccuze a thyngkuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka do cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tangnuapaw a theihpaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw a theihpaw te nynh a loku;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuutaw te silawnaw a raepaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ui nging a khyatupaw te nynh a loku;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccathae silawnaw kha a raepaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">voh chii a pyatu te nynh a loku;</para>
  <para style="q1">mynkhuhpaw silawnaw lante</para>
  <para style="q2">frankinsen kha a pyatu tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zohtuh kha hythua a pyatu te nynh a loku.</para>
  <para style="q1">E ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mimaw laanpi kha pokuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih nungsikunaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungry athuakhaekuh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin hanlan saryanaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka popah cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh a ri hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih tungvaw ka thuasah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ka ko hae ze</para>
  <para style="q2">hum nynh sanmah yn oi khyh,</para>
  <para style="q2">bya ka ho vae ze yn ngaepah khyh hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka muihnaw khe ahoy leipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">cyih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka ry leipaw kha a poku hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zion kha Thyaaccousahnaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">a thyngkuh hae paw nanning,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw bya kha ngaetua oh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Ka min keiccuze nanning</para>
  <para style="q1">ae hua oh paw te ae vua oh paw</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ccungccaw hae toulou nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Nae lungtuanaw kha kae muih nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a phu-e sah,” a ci hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maethyanaw a mue cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuapi kya-e siaruanaw roi te</para>
  <para style="q2">beikinn kya-e roi tuh ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q1">A rhaw hae kha de a tah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> roi nynh thua!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccanung Zion tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">neitangia a cci mawkhe</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaaw a pui vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ccinaw nynh a thuanua mawze</para>
  <para style="q2">ccapaw kha a saah vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:5">Bya 12.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhcihawpaw tuh hummou a thae boi?</para>
  <para style="q2">Tuhcihawpaw tuh hummou a muih boi?</para>
  <para style="q1">Ram ramkheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">nin kheit lungkhu a pui kho cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Minphuin phuin kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccyh sosoh kya a pui kho cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuhzemah Zion tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">neitangia he accih takaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccaaw hae tuh palou a pui vae hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ccaaw saahsah lante ka paccyn koute</para>
  <para style="q2">saahsah leite ka um cih tou? cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccaaw ka poisahpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">puisah leite ka khee cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">cite na Pachia nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem a sungsah hae paw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw ryte lungtuakheih oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a hanlan nae lungpaw sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a rah a khui hae paw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw ryte nae lungtua sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungpaw sah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuhteze tuh ngaengansahpaw a matei kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na zu cih oh zah na byn cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">aphu-epaw a by kya-e kha</para>
  <para style="q2">lungrythuakhaekute na zu cih oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem langkhe hoirumnaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">vaw hawte ka luasah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin ccangpaw hae sisua kha</para>
  <para style="q1">paraeparae leikuhpaw vaw hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka luasah cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning nynh a matei kha na zu cih oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">a kuih te ae dua cih oh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccukharu vawlan khe ae oi cih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nung nynh a ccaaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaengansah hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">nanning kha ngaengannaw kae pya cih oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem khe ngaengannaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">pya na thua cih oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Thinrianaw te Uknaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh na muih cih oh zah</para>
  <para style="q2">nae lungpaw cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">nae pyn tuh lonua hawte a lethung cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalahtu hae ryte umkheih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thinrianaw nynh a rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawse hae cipaw ny athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dotua, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a thinrianaw khate thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a kya-e thuiheinawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">maeesoi khate thuasah liaru khylan</para>
  <para style="q2">khiccung tahawpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a marangle kha ccikute</para>
  <para style="q2">maee khate yn thua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccungccaw balyn kha</para>
  <para style="q2">maee te thaloi khate bya a pia cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a chia hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya alung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh: Voh saw, pazu saw te anungsikuhpaw aepaw kha aete, angaelung e ccungccaw kha zui hae zah, khokhu kya mimaw toulou kha thyaaccousakuh hae zah a thyaasakuh hae paw tuh thangnaw kya a thuakheih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih ryalaw te mih tuanaw kha ka ny, minphuin hae te alokuh leipaw bya a ho hae paw balyn kha suelua khylan kae thua cih; te minmin nynh oun thua cih hae zah ka phu-enaw kha a nyh cih hae, <verse number="19" style="v" />minmin laku khe syntawnaw ccangkheit ka nung cih. Minmin kya-e a hiinhy hae paw kha Tarshish ram, Put ram te the kaw a thya hae paw Lud ram, Tubal ram te Javan ram, ka minthaannaw kha thae leite ka phu-enaw kha mah a nyh lei hae paw asawnaw rili khunglang e ram hae kalan ka saw cih hae; minmin nynh ka phu-enaw kha minphuin hae kya a siakhae cih hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel hae nynh ccathae silawnaw kha thyaararihpaw angphe te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang a cciakhae hae hawte, tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh nae puizia hae kha marang, marangle, puihnawpaw, lann te kalauh vawlan khangte ram takyh kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pyapaw hawkhate athyaapaw ka mua Jerusalem langkhe a cciakhae cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin laku e abang kha ranpibawi lang te Levi minphuin lang ka nung cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka rae cih paw vaaw thawpaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi thawpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ka malang atyn hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae ciihan hae te nae min tuh atyn cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66.22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Isa 65.17</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:13">2Pe 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Bya 21.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sawpaw sah leihpaw takyh kya te</para>
  <para style="q2">sabbath nin takyh kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha beik khylan ka malang</para>
  <para style="q1">oun thua cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin nynh oun pou cih hae zah kae yn doupaw ccungccaw hae rhua kha a do cih hae; mih saw a aepaw zanpaw hae tuh chih lan khyh hae, mih maee mah chih lan khyh, ccungccaw balyn malang anungsikuhpaw athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">66.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:48">Mar 9.48</ref></char></note></para>
</usx>